<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:48:29 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Acts</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kông-vuq Kak-xưq-đô</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kông-vuq</para>
  <para style="toc3">Act</para>
  <para style="mt">Kông-vuq Kak-xưq-đô</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Wơơy kadraq Thê-ô-phi-lơ, gô heq dơơp vlôh phon achih valơk thưq nhưk truh tôôy varơuq đơu Lôôk Jê-xu heq xarôp dưk dơơp ji padoh pato, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />dong truh hngơy Kadraq jah xagook tok plêêk, tuôôy heq kahniq apok tanưưl xing Lôôk Phool Hiel ka khơl xatyauq đơu Kadraq heq rơơlh, <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />kung laa khơl adro đơu Kadraq heq truh kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk đong riirh ka oot, atêq tuôôy Kadraq heq chiuq pơơl dal, dii 'ngưng bơơn xanưk, vii heq rama vlôh dii oot đom poot kưl hngơy ji đnooy kaluh varơuq truh daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Tuôôy tavơh mot dii oot, Kadraq heq lơh ka oot leh ik chuh klơlh Jê-ru-sa-lem, bơh pheq takôô apok tavek ku Vaq, “laa varơuq đơu oh ay heq tameng xing thơy, <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />đaneq Jăng heq dơơp bap-tem bơơn daak, bơh oh ay hnoq jah bap-tem ji Lôôk Phool Hiel leh xiik atêq kaluh hngơy neq.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Vii nưq, tuôôy kung mamuuyq hooy truh, oot vôôch Kadraq đaneq: “Kuh Lôôk, jơq be Kadraq panưk hlê dêh ka I-sơ-ra-ên đom tuôôy neq?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Nưq bơh, Kadraq đnooy dii oot: “Varơuq deng ka oh ay jah xet leh aalq laa kawat long katuôôy đơu Vaq heq đinq tyauq qwuyen da uh ku Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Lunư, oh ay hnoq nhonq xok taay yaak tuôôy Kơy Phool Hiel kahri tol xăk, ji oh ay hnoq laa khơl manih xanưk ku thơy aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, đom dêq dêh Ju-đê, dêh Sa-ma-ri, ji ăm truh loch dêq play vari.” <verse eid="ACT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Atêq tuôôy xanoh kaluh apok nưq, tuôôy oot măn đong 'yo, yôôych Kadraq jah xagook tok, ji muuyq đum kluk đơ kađoq Kadraq klơlh mot oot. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Đom tuôôy oot đong tamaak anhinq 'yo tol plêêk tuôôy Kadraq jah xagook tok, yôôych 'yo hơq, vaarq dro khơl kanau hlưp qwuân aau ko truh dưk gah oot. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />Oot đnooy: “Taleq dro Ga-li-lê hơq, aleq khơl ay dưk 'yo tok plêêk? Lôôk Jê-xu neq, Kơy heq jah xagook tok plêêk klơlh khơl ay, kung hnoq truh đaji kach đơu khơl ay heq hloq Kadraq hooy tok Plêêk.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Nưq yôôch, xing ngok đoot jah taayh laa Ô-liu, oot wiit xuq truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, đơu đoot nưq măn jeq Jê-ru-sa-lem, e kawat trôôk hooy đom muuyq hngơy Sa-bat. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Tuôôy oot heq xuq truh, oot hooy tok tol rawaak yơơt duq oot đong măn hlê, e Phi-e-rơ, ji Jăng, kung Ja-kơ ji Anh-rê, Phi-lip ji Thô-ma, Ba-thê-lê-mi ji Ma-thi-ơ, Ja-kơ koot kanau A-phê ji Si-môn Xê-lôt, kung Ju-đe, koot ku Ja-kơ. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Dêq hloay oot raay kajưk raa kach anguk muuyq đom varơuq apôôy, dii khơl mư drê kung Ma-ri, miq ku Lôôk Jê-xu, ji dii khơl ma oh kanau ku Kadraq.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Đom kaluh hngơy nưq, atêq tuôôy dưk tok măn katul đom khơl oh ay kơy (sôôq karôp khơl adro ka aduq neq laa kơh muuyq hreek vaarq kưl), Phi-e-rơ đnooy:<verse eid="ACT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Wơơy oh ay, khơl adro oh ay, neq laa varơuq băt dăt pheq jah jêêk đom Rahlăp Vah, laa apok đơu Lôôk Phool Hiel heq tauq adroyq xing huuy vuua Đa-vik truh Ju-đa, adro vlôh jêêk dro jarooy trôôk ka bing rôp Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Vii ni heq jah 'yo achung dii haay ji heq nhonq phon ni truh varơuq dơơp neq.” <verse eid="ACT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />(Nưq yôôch ni heq root muuyq manay ruôngq xing jêêt kông ku varơuq leh hyioh jăk, ji atêq tuôôy biq gưlh panhuq akoq pôôt, ni hruh klaak, măn dêq klaak ni biq hruh vlôh pi gôk. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Varơuq neq vlôh jêêk varơuq qween thuôk đôôyq dii dêq hloay khơl adro đong măn aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem. Vii anưq, manay ruôngq nưq jah taayh bơơn apok athêêk ku oot laa “Hak-en-đa-ma”, iq laa “Manay Ruôngq Vahaap”.) <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Vii varơuq nưq heq jah valơk đom rahlăp Thi Thiên:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Dayh xôq manay ruôngq ni biq ralưp ralaak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">kung te e kơyq riirh măn đnư,’ ji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Dayh xôq adro kadrơy nhonq xok varơuq dơơp ku ni.’<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Vii anưq, duh pheq e khơl manih heq kung hooy dii haay đom tuôôt kawat đơu Lôôk Jê-xu hooy hlê katul haay, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />pa xarôp xing pheep bap-tem ku Jăng ăm truh hngơy đơu Kadraq jah xagook tok klơlh haay — muuyq đom khơl adro nưq pheq vlôh jêêk dro dưk xanưk truh varơuq riirh hlê ku Kadraq kung dii 'wot.” <verse eid="ACT 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Oot bôk vlôh vaarq dro, Jô-sep jah taayh laa Ba-sa-ba, đơu dro yôôych jah taayh anơng laa Juk-tu, ji Ma-thia. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Tuôôy xadrook apôôy, oot tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, kadih Kadraq, Kơy xet xuum klaak ku tôôy dro, xiin pato vlôh muuyq đom vaarq dro neq đơu Kadraq heq rơơlh laa kơyq <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />xôq ka nhonq xok varơuq dơơp ku varơuq dơơp neq kung adro jah rơơlh đơu Ju-đa heq ka'lăk xôq hooy truh aduq ku ni.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Oot palăk truh vaarq dro nưq, ji palăk rôh muut Ma-thia, nưq laa kơy jah bơu rơơlh achung dii kưl muuyq khơl xatyauq.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Tuôôy hngơy Lêh Nguh Twuân heq truh yôôch, dêq hloay oot măn kung dii mamuuyq aduq muuyq kachô. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Tưng hưng, muuyq hnưm ahlôôk xing plêêk ahna vlôh, dang đaji đơơt khiel kalh jah klôôp truh, ji ni muut viik loch hloay đom hnhư aduq oot đong 'ngôôy. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Yôôch kaluh kapiet đaji bơơn ôôlh rama vlôh dii oot, tuôôy heq paraay loch, yôôych ni 'nharum găp tol tôôy muuyq adro đom oot. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Dêq hloay oot jah viik galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel ji pa xarôp đnooy ji kaluh apok xarooy kadrơy, xatyauq Kơy Phool Hiel kahniq ăm oot đnooy.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Tuôôy nưq e khơl manih Jo Thaiq đong măn hlê măn Jê-ru-sa-lem, laa khơl adro tuôq kuh xing tôôy daak ku khơl tamooy 'laarq plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Tuôôy xarooy nưq ahna vlôh, bing karôp tagumq hlê ji biq xôôl dôôl vii tôôy adro raay tameng oot đnooy bơơn apok xarooy ku xăk. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Dêq hloay manih karôp raay tưng hưng ji xok dơơp akêh, đnooy đaneq: “'Yo hơq, be aalq dêq hloay khơl manih đong đnooy nưq laa manih Ga-li-lê be aalq? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Dơơp đaleq haay tameng tưng adro oot đnooy bơơn apok xarooy đêh ku oot đom dêh đơu haay jah pa iir vlôh? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Nee laa manih Bat-thê, manih Mê-đi, manih Ê-la-mit, khơl manih măn hlê aduq Mê-sô-bô-ta-mi, Ju-đê, e hloay Kap-ba-đôk, Bông, A-si, <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />kung đaji Phi-ri-gi, Bam-phi-li, Ai Kâp, kaluh dêh thuôk Li-bi jeq Si-ren, ji khơl manih kadrơy xing Rô-ma truh hlơq, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />dêq manih Jo Thaiq aluq manih tuôq đaauq Jo Thaiq, manih Kơ-rêt ji manih Ah Râp, haay raay tameng oot đnooy bơơn apok xarooy ku haay truh kaluh varơuq kôt lơyq ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Dêq hloay oot raay tưng hưng ji hloq khoq hlolh, manih neq đnooy dii manih hơq: “Varơuq neq e iq laa aleq?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Măn muuyq sôôq kadrơy tache aklêêu heq đnooy đaneq: “Taleq dro nưq laa đong biq vuul lok ngưưm!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Bơh atêq tuôôy dưk tok, Phi-e-rơ dii kưl muuyq khơl xatyauq heq tok apok ji đnooy dii oot: “Wơơy oh ay, manih tamooy Jo Thaiq ji dêq hloay khơl leq đong măn hlê aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, varơuq neq pheq vlôh jêêk varơuq qween thuôk đôôyq dii oh ay, ji xiin dayh 'ngiik tôôr iq tameng apok gô. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Vii khơl manih neq leh biq vuul đaji oh ay biit, vii đong laa wat thưq pe đom hngơy. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Lunư, neq laa varơuq heq jah đnooy vlôh gamưh kơy hlit Jô-ên:<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Kơy Plêêk xanoh: “Varơuq hnoq xalih truh đom kaluh hngơy lôôch dik,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">“Gô hnoq kahrôq Kơy Phool Hiel Gô tol tôôy xăk xamơk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">koot kanau ji koot kadrê êêp koot hnoq đnooy hlit,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">khơl tadăp blaay ku êêp koot hnoq hloq ăm xet adroyq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">ji khơl karaq ku êêp koot hnoq apau hloq đom apau.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Pheq đnooy tol khơl xapok kanau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">xapok kadrê ku Gô đom kaluh hngơy nưq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">Gô hnoq uk pôôt Kơy Phool Hiel Gô, ji oot hnoq đnooy hlit.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Gô hnoq kahniq kaluh varơuq akêh tol plêêk yơơt</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">ji kaluh dơuq akêh 'laarq vari lêq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">vahaap ji ôôlh kung dii khul 'nhuuy.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Mot hngơy hnoq biq vlôh jêêk kamơng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">măn xiêk yôôych jêêk vahaap,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">adroyq tuôôy truh hngơy kôt ji tađnah tađnaak ku Lôôk.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Ji paq kê adro leq taayh apôôy yal Lôôk yôôych hnoq jah wơơt.”’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />Wơơy oh ay, khơl manih I-sơ-ra-ên, xiin dayh tameng kaluh apok neq: Lôôk Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret laa dro jah Kơy Plêêk dơơp xanưk dii oh ay ji kaluh varơuq taay yaak, pheep akêh ji dơuq akêh đơu gamưh Kadraq, Kơy Plêêk heq xanưk dơơp măn katul oh ay, đaji kadih oh ay heq xet. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kơy nưq biq nôôp, tyauq ka varơuq heq jah đinq ji varơuq xet adroyq ku Kơy Plêêk, oh ay heq păk kaxêêt tuôôy đongq tol gay charăk gamưh hlê ti khơl adro leh e ganuun, <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Kadraq laa Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq khienq riirh hlê, atêq tuôôy xaloot klơlh varơuq pơơl hwơơl ku varơuq kaxêêt, vii ni leh e paraat adrơk jư Kadraq pi 'laarq ni. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Vii vuua Đa-vik đnooy truh Kadraq đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Gô hloay hloay hloq Lôôk măn adroyq kangưưr gô</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">vii Kadraq măn pi akoh gô, xôq gô leh biq anhưh hrưng.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Vii kơq nưq, xuum gô mưng me ji kapiet gô hlah hlaak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">Bơh măn iaq đnoyq, xăk xamơk gô kung hnoq padơy pado đom varơuq takôô gamưh.<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />Vii Kadraq hnoq leh ka'lăk phool hiel gô đom aduq karuk adro kaxêêt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">kung hnoq leh xôq ka Kơy Vah Kadraq 'yo hloq varơuq oop hruh.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kadraq heq kahnoq vlôh ka gô trôôk varơuq riirh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">Kadraq hnoq dơơp ka gô viik galaay xuum hlah hlaak kung dii xăk xamơk ku Kadraq.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />Wơơy oh ay, wơơy oh ay, bơơn varơuq hôôk kajưk, varơuq hnoq ik đnooy dii oh ay truh mo kơy Đa-vik, nưq laa kơy heq kaxêêt ji heq jah up, mô xanưng ku kơy đong măn katul haay ăm truh hngơy neng. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Ji yôôch, vii laa kơy hlit ji vii xet đaneq Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp apok paleek dii kơy xôq tol muuyq koot xau thuôk adrơơk kơy tol ngaai kơy, <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />lunưq atêq tuôôy hloq adroyq varơuq neq, vuua heq đnooy truh varơuq riirh hlê ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, đaneq Kadraq leh biq ka'lăk đom aduq karuk manih kaxêêt, xăk xamơk kadraq kung leh hloq varơuq oop hruh.<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Kơy Plêêk heq khienq Lôôk Jê-xu neq riirh hlê, dêq hloay 'wot laa manih xanưk ka varơuq nưq. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Vii nưq, tuôôy heq jah vanê tok pi akoh Kơy Plêêk ji nhonq xok apok tavek truh Lôôk Phool Hiel xing Vaq, yôôych Kadraq heq uk pôôt varơuq đaneq, laa varơuq đơu oh ay đong hloq ji tameng.<verse eid="ACT 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Vii Đa-vik heq be hooy tok plêêk, bơh kadih kơy đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Lôôk xanoh dii Lôôk gô: “Dayh 'ngôôy pi akoh Gô,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />dong truh tuôôy Gô khienq khơl adro tachơơl ku Koot jêêk đool xôq jôôk ku Koot.”’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />Lunưq, dêq hnhư I-sơ-ra-ên pheq xet kach kajưk dik đaneq Kơy Plêêk heq lăp Kadraq dơơp Lôôk ji Kơy Wơơt Dêh, nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu neq, adro đơu oh ay heq đongq đing.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Tuôôy heq tameng anưq, oot jiq 'nhok đom xuum, yôôch tơơl dii Phi-e-rơ ji khơl jah rơơlh măn hlê, đaneq: “Nee khơl adro oh ay, 'wot pheq dơơp kajoq?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Lunưq Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii oot: “Dayh wiit xuq ji tôôy dro đom oh ay pheq chiuq pheep bap-tem taayh yal Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu xôq jah varơuq ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh ku xăk, yôôch oh ay hnoq nhonq xok kadrool laa Lôôk Phool Hiel. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Vii apok tavek nưq laa deng ka oh ay, ka koot xau ku oh ay ji ăm dêq hloay khơl adro măn xangưưy, nưq laa paq kê kơyq đơu Lôôk laa Kơy Plêêk haay hnoq taayh tawooyh.” <verse eid="ACT 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Bơơn 'ngưng apok đêh đnoyq, kơy heq dơơp xanưk ji ahluk hluul oot, đaneq: “Dayh xôq xăk jah wơơt klơlh adrơơk xơk tauq neq.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Anưq, atêq tuôôy nhonq xok apok ku kơy, oot chiuq bap-tem, kơh pe ravơu phool hiel heq jah athêêp muut Tayuup Vah đom hngơy nưq. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Tuôôy nưq, oot kưq dơơp đnoyq đom pato dayq ku khơl jah rơơlh ji đom varơuq tagumq hlê, đom varơuq pleelh tôôp ji đom apok xadrook apôôy.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Varơuq yôq varaal kahri tol tôôy adro, ji 'ngưng varơuq akêh kung dơuq akêh kahnoq vlôh gamưh khơl jah rơơlh. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Dêq hloay khơl adro tuôq yôôych tagumq hlê ka muuyq aduq ji jah achung tôôy thưq, <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />oot tek vari hluôôt ji garuh anôôp oot, yôôch ahlook kaluh nưq ka tôôy adro, tyauq đaji tưng adro e duh xung luleq, <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />tôôy hngơy vơơ kưq miet muuyq xuum măn đom hnhư hơu, vơơ pleelh tôôp aduq tưng hnhư, oot heq ahlook aklah tuôông xa đom varơuq hlah hlaak ji xuum klaak dong dik, <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk ji e tamaq xuum dii dêq hloay manih karôp, măn Lôôk đong măn athêêp khơl adro jah wơơt muut tayuup nưq tôôy hngơy.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-e-rơ ji Jăng hooy tok hnhư hơu muut wat xadrook apôôy, laa muut wat thưq xiit. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Muuyq adro nưq, biq tâk xing đom klaak miq ni, heq jah xakôôk truh, laa adro đơu tôôy hngơy khơl drơy xôq aduq 'mok ku hnhư hơu, aduq jah taayh laa 'Mok Kaxay, xôq vôôch jêêt ăm hloh xing khơl adro hooy muut đom hnhư hơu, <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />đơu tuôôy hloq Phi-e-rơ ji Jăng xarôp hooy muut đom hnhư hơu, ay apôôy vôôch ăm nhonq jêêt ăm hloh. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Bơh atêq tuôôy kung dii Jăng 'yo atrêêk muut ay nưq, Phi-e-rơ đnooy: “Dayh 'yo muut 'wot!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Nưq yôôch ay 'yo anhinq muut baarq kơy, biit nhonq xok axit kajoq nưq xing oot. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Lunư, Phi-e-rơ đnooy: “Vajang long baak, be thưq leq e măn aduq gô, bơh varơuq đơu gô e, gô ăm ay neh. Taayh yal Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret, dayh tawaak hooy.” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Tuôôy heq jư riit ay aduq ti akoh, kơy đơ ay dưk tok, yôôych hloay jơnưq, pla jôôk ji mot kaa ku ay jah găk kalh. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Atêq tuôôy kaplok tok, ay dưk kajưk ji pa xarôp tawaak hooy, yôôych ay muut đom hnhư hơu dii oot, vơơ hooy vơơ ayuch vơơ ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Dêq hloay manih karôp 'yo hloq ay tawaak hooy ji ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />Yôôch oot nhonq vlôh ay nưq, đaneq ay 'miêh laa dro hloay 'ngôôy vôôch jêêt ăm hloh aduq 'Mok Kaxay ku hnhư hơu, lunưq oot biq galôp viik varơuq akêh ji tưng hưng vii varơuq heq xalih vlôh ka ay.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy ay nưq đong hooy tyauq Phi-e-rơ ji Jăng, dêq hloay manih karôp dii viik varơuq tưng hưng, kung ka ung mamuuyq charơơk truh oot ka 'mok ngo, aduq jah taayh laa 'Mok Ngo Sa-lô-môn. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Bơh tuôôy hloq anưq, Phi-e-rơ tơơl hlê dii manih karôp:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 3:12">“Wơơy oh ay, laa manih karôp I-sơ-ra-ên lơơy, aleq oh ay xok dơơp akêh truh varơuq neq? Long aleq oh ay 'yo 'wot anhinq đanưq 'wot heq khienq ay nưq tawaak hooy xing taay yaak long varơuq tamaq đêh ku xăk? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Kơy Plêêk ku Ap-ra-ham, Kơy Plêêk ku I-sak ji Kơy Plêêk ku Ja-kôp, nưq laa Kơy Plêêk ku mo kơy haay, heq vanê ayuôôt Xapok ku Kadraq, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, Kơy đơu oh ay heq rôp nôôp ji wih ka'lăk adroyq kangưưr Phi-lat tuôôy kơy nưq heq đinq tha Kadraq vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Bơh oh ay heq chôôyq ka'lăk Kơy Vah ji Hyioh Jăk, đooy vôôch jah tha ka xăk muuyq dro păk kaxêêt manih, <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />bơh oh ay heq păk kaxêêt Kơy Kahniq Varơuq Riirh, laa Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, đơu 'wot laa adro xanưk ka varơuq neq. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ji xing xuum tuôq aduq yal Kadraq, ay nưq, adro đơu oh ay raay hloq ji xet, yôôych yal Kadraq heq dơơp ăm kalh paraat. Xuum tuôq nưq gamưh aduq Kadraq heq ăm ay nưq varơuq kalh paraat dêq hloay đanưq hloay kangưưr dêq hloay oh ay. <verse eid="ACT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />Juneq, wơơy oh ay, gô xet đaneq oh ay heq dưk dơơp đom varơuq vlô apoop, ji khơl padrok dêh ku oh ay kung dang anưq. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Bơh kaluh varơuq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq tauq adroyq xing huuy ku dêq hloay khơl hnhư hlit, đaneq Kơy Wơơt Dêh ku Kadraq pheq chiuq jiq jiêh, yôôych Kadraq heq dơơp jah jêêk đanưq. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Jo anưq, dayh wiit xuum, ji wih wiit hlê, xôq kadrôôp maroh ku oh ay jah pa hlơơp, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />xôq ka tuôôy kawah kaxay đơơu truh xing varơuq rama vlôh ku Lôôk, ji Kadraq patăk dăt Kơy heq jah pato đinq ka oh ay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />laa Kơy duh pheq jư hlê tol daak plêêk dong truh katuôôy 'meq hlê tôôy paroh, laa varơuq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq đnooy xing hnu xing huuy khơl kơy hlit vah ku Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />Dik anưq, Môi-se heq đnooy đaneq: ‘Lôôk, Kơy Plêêk ku haay hnoq dưk tok ka oh ay muuyq dro kơy hlit dang đaji gô xing đom katul khơl oh ay ku haay. Oh ay hnoq tameng adro gamưh tyauq dêq hloay paq kê varơuq leq đơu adro đnooy kung oh ay. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Bơh varơuq hnoq xalih vlôh ka adro leq đơu atoh leh tameng adro Kơy hlit nưq, yôôych adro nưq hnoq biq păk kaxêêt klơlh manih dêh.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Anưq yôôch, dêq hloay khơl kơy hlit xing Sa-mu-ên ji khơl adro xatyauq atêq kơy, atoh oot tok apok đnooy, yôôych oot kung padoh taboon truh kaluh hngơy neq. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Oh ay laa koot xau ku khơl kơy hlit ji ku tavek đơu Kơy Plêêk heq lăp dii mo kơy haay, tuôôy xanoh dii Ap-ra-ham, đaneq: ‘Ji vii muuyq koot xau ku koot, dêq hloay khơl adrơơk tamooy tol vari hnoq jah vanong.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Adroyq dik dii oh ay, atêq tuôôy dưk tok Xapok xăk, Kơy Plêêk heq patăk dăt Kơy nưq truh kahniq vanong ka oh ay bơơn kach awih ngưưr tôôy adro klơlh varơuq xơk tauq ku oh ay.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy oot đong đnooy dii manih karôp, khơl thơy tơơk tưp, kung khơl jư hnhư hơu ji kaluh manih Sa-đu-sê garuk truh oot, <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />thier raa tôq jaraq vii vaarq adro đong padoh pato manih karôp ji đnooy vlôh varơuq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt đom Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Yôôch bing oot rôp vaarq adro ji rôp muut karuk kôô truh hngơy atêq, vii tuôôy nưq heq kamơng yôôch. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Bơh phon 'ngưng đom sôôq khơl adro atêq tuôôy tameng apok padoh nưq heq tuôq, ji sôôq adro khơl kanau heq tok truh lakah dăp ravơu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom hngơy atêq, khơl dưk xanok ku oot kung khơl kadraq lơơk ji khơl thơy pato ganuun jah tagumq hlê aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />dii An-ne thơy tơơk tưp kôt, kung Kai-phe, Jăng, A-lek-xan-đơ ji dêq hloay khơl adro thuôk truh adrơơk thơy tơơk tưp kôt. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Atêq tuôôy jarooy vaarq adro xôq măn katul, oot vôôch: “Xing taay yaak leq, long taayh yal kơyq đơu êêp kơy heq dơơp varơuq nưq?” <verse eid="ACT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Muut tuôôy nưq, vii jah viik galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel, Phi-e-rơ heq đnooy dii oot: “Wơơy khơl dưk xanok ku manih karôp ji khơl kadraq lơơk, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />atoh hngơy neng 'wot biq vôôch hlê truh varơuq kaxay đôôyq dii muuyq dro jiq, đaneq gamưh 'leq ay nưq heq jah payơh, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />yôôych neq pheq laa varơuq jah dêq hloay êêp kơy ji padêq manih I-sơ-ra-ên xet truh, đaneq taayh yal Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret, Kơy đơu êêp kơy heq đongq đing tol gay charăk, Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq khienq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, nưq laa gamưh Kơy nưq đơu manih neq dưk kalh paraat kangưưr êêp kơy. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Kadraq laa kuk phơu heq biq 'yo leh ra kajoq bơyh êêp kơy, nưq laa khơl thơq xơy, đơu heq vlôh jêêk talaat phơu kahnier muum hnhư. <verse eid="ACT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Be e varơuq wơơt xok aduq paq kê kơyq đêh, vii măn 'laarq plêêk be e yal leq đêh jah kahniq ăm măn katul koot manih xôq haay pheq gamưh đnư jah wơơt.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Tuôôy hloq varơuq kôk dik ku Phi-e-rơ ji Jăng, ji nhonq xet đaneq baarq kơy laa khơl dro be hok ji vlô, yôôych oot tưng hưng, oot kung nhonq vlôh vaarq dro, đaneq vaarq dro heq hmưq măn dii Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Đom tuôôy, vii hloq khơl kanau heq jah payơh dưk dii baarq kơy, lunưq oot leh e varơuq kajoq xôq tơơl aklơ hlê. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy vlôh tanưưl ka taleq dro nưq hooy klơlh hnhư padrok xadrah, oot tajauq dii mamuuyq, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />đaneq: “Haay duh dơơp kajoq dii khơl dro neq? Nưq laa xing muuyq pheep akêh trơ trơ heq xalih vlôh xing taleq dro neq, dik laa ro raang đôôyq dii dêq hloay khơl leq đong riirh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, ji haay leh hnoq laayq nhonq. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Lunư, xôq varơuq neq leh lơy taboon vlôh athêêp katul đom manih karôp, haay pheq đnooy joa naap oot leh dơơp đnoyq taayh yal nưq xôq đnooy dii paq kê dro leq.” <verse eid="ACT 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Anưq, tuôôy ăm taayh vaarq dro muut, oot vlôh tanưưl leh đnooy vlôh long pato dayq paq kê varơuq kajoq taayh yal Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Bơh tuôôy Phi-e-rơ ji Jăng tơơl apok, vaarq dro heq đnooy dii oot: “Jơq be laa troq măn kangưưr Kơy Plêêk tuôôy tameng tyauq êêp kơy iaq Kơy Plêêk? Êêp kơy dayh 'yo hlê yơu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Vii 'wot leh ik leh đnooy truh kaluh varơuq 'wot heq hloq ji tameng.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Anưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy naap joa athêêp, oot tha vaarq dro hooy, jo leh akhiim hloq varơuq kajoq xôq đơu oot hnoq ik hmơt dook vaarq dro, nưq laa vii kơq manih karôp, vii tôôy dro raay ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk truh varơuq heq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Vii adro khơl kanau hơq, adro đơu pheep akêh payơh neq xalih vlôh, yôôych heq iaq poot kưl tuuyh.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy jah tha vlôh, baarq truh dii oh ay khơl tuôq ku baarq ji taboon hlê tôôy varơuq đơu khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji khơl kadraq lơơk heq đnooy dii baarq. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Tuôôy heq tameng yôôch, oot muuyq xuum atok apok tok wih truh Kơy Plêêk ji tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq laa Kơy heq panưk jêêk plêêk, vari ji tahli, kung tôôy paroh măn đom nưq, <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />laa Kơy, gamưh hlê mo kơy 'wot xing Lôôk Phool Hiel, xing aduq huuy ku Đa-vik xapok Kadraq, heq xanoh đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Aleq kaluh daak tôq jaraq,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">ji kaluh tamooy xôq vih hư hlơơp?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Khơl vuua tol vari dưk tok, ji khơl padrok kôt jah tagumq hlê kung mamuuyq</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">tachơơl Lôôk ji tachơơl Kơy chiuq para jơu ku Kadraq.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Vii đom dong dik, hloay Hê-rôt ji Bôn-xơ Phi-lat, kung dii khơl tamooy xadaay ji tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên, heq jah tagumq hlê dii mamuuyq đom theng neq tachơơl Xapok vah ku Kadraq laa Lôôk Jê-xu, Kơy đơu Kadraq para jơu, <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />xôq dưk dơơp tôôy varơuq đơu ti Kadraq ji varơuq dơơp ku Kadraq heq đinq adroyq ăm xalih vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Juneq, Lôôk lơơy, xiin dayh 'yo hlê kaluh apok joa naap ku oot, ji xiin kahniq ăm khơl xapok ku kadraq padoh vlôh apok Kadraq dii dêq hloay varơuq kôk dik <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />tuôôy Kadraq tơơk ti ku Kadraq vlôh xôq ka varơuq payơh, kaluh dơuq akêh ji kaluh varơuq hlêêl akêh jah xalih truh gamưh yal ku Xapok vah Kadraq, laa Lôôk Jê-xu.” <verse eid="ACT 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Tuôôy oot heq xadrook apôôy yôôch, aduq đơu oot đong anguk hlê biq anhưh hrưng, yôôch dêq hloay oot raay jah viik galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel ji padoh taboon apok ku Kơy Plêêk kung dii xuum kôk dik.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Tuôôy nưq, bing karôp khơl manih heq tuôq raay e achung muuyq xuum klaak ji danưng kooy. Leh kơyq 'yo muuyq varơuq leq đom kaluh kajoq thuôk truh xăk laa ku đêh, đơu đôôyq dii oot, tôôy thưq laa ku achung. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Bơơn taay yaak kalh paraat, khơl jah rơơlh đnooy vlôh apok xanưk truh varơuq riirh hlê ku Lôôk Jê-xu, ji vanong plêêk kôt galơh măn tol dêq hloay oot. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Vii leh e manih leq tayuh thiuq katul đom oot, vii atoh khơl leq laa kôôch jah dêq vari dêh long hnhư wah, yôôych atêq tuôôy tek, oot adrơk truh sôôq jêêt heq agoop jah, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />yôôch xôq aduq jôôk khơl jah rơơlh, măn jêêt nưq jah ahlook ăm tưng adro xatyauq adro nưq e xung duh leq.<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Tuôôy nưq, Jô-sep, dro jah khơl jah rơơlh taayh laa Ba-na-ba (anơng jah jich iq laa Koot ku Varơuq Hlơq Hlôôp), laa muuyq adro Lê-vi, manih tamooy Chip-rơ, <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />atêq tuôôy tek yôôch manay ruôngq thuôk ku kơy, kơy heq xagook jêêt truh ji bu aduq jôôk khơl jah rơơlh.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq dro nưq anơng A-na-nia, kung Sa-phi-ra, kadrê ni, heq tek muuyq hluôôt vari, <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />yôôch ay nưq jư đêh ka xăk muuyq phon xing sôôq jêêt nưq (adro kadrê kung xet), ji atêq tuôôy xagook muuyq phon hơq truh, ay nưq bu aduq jôôk khơl jah rơơlh. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Bơh Phi-e-rơ đnooy: “A-na-nia, vii aleq Sa-tan viik galaay xuum ay khienq ka ay đnooy pa ôôh Lôôk Phool Hiel đơu jư đêh ka xăk muuyq phon xing sôôq jêêt ku hluôôt vari nưq? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Tuôôy măn nưq, be aalq hluôôt vari hloay laa ku ay, ji atêq tuôôy jah tek yôôch, sôôq jêêt hloay thuôk 'laarq qwuyen ku ay be aalq? Dơơp đaleq đơu ay biit jauq varơuq neq đom xuum ay? Be aalq ay đnooy pa ôôh koot manih 'leq, đơu laa dii Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Anưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy A-na-nia tameng kaluh apok nưq, ay nưq kloh hơơy đơu gưlh pôôt, ji varơuq varaal yôq thier kôt kahri tol dêq hloay khơl leq tameng kaluh varơuq neq. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq dưk tok, khơl tadăp blaay ahnom hlê ay nưq ji tuôôy heq xakôôk vlôh pi gôk yôôch oot xagook hooy up.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Bơh varơuq xalih truh kơh pe wat atêq nưq, kadrê ay nưq tawaak muut, koq lưp xet varơuq heq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii mư: “Dayh đnooy ka gô xet e jơq baarq heq tek hluôôt vari dii jaq tonư jơq be?” Yôôch mư đnooy: “Ư, jaq tonư nưq.” <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Bơh Phi-e-rơ dăt mư: “Dơơp aleq đơu varơuq nưq jah vaarq adro kung mamuuyq xôq thưh Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk? Dayh 'yo hơq, pla jôôk ku khơl adro heq up kanau mư măn ka 'mok, ji oot kung hnoq xagook mư hooy up.” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Hloay jơnưq, mư nưq gưlh pôôt aduq jôôk kơy ji kloh hơơy. Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tawaak muut, khơl tadăp hloq xaak mư, yôôch atêq tuôôy xakôôk mư vlôh pi gôk, oot up mư pi gah kanau mư. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Varơuq varaal yôq thier kôt kahri tol dêq tayuup vah ji tol dêq hloay khơl leq tameng truh kaluh varơuq neq.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Tuôôy nưq, gamưh pla ti ku khơl jah rơơlh, 'ngưng dơuq akêh ji varơuq akêh xalih vlôh katul đom manih karôp, ji oot raay muuyq xuum măn aduq 'Mok Ngo Sa-lô-môn. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Bơh leh kơyq đêh hôôk muut nhôp dii oot, long tabơh manih karôp 'miêh đong vanê oot. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Tuôôy nưq, kang 'ngưng manih jah athêêp muut tuôôy xôq xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk iaq đnoyq, sôôq dro karôp dêq kanau hloay khơl kadrê, <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />truh nôôy khơl kadrơy pheq đnooy xagook manih jiq vlôh trôôk, amik tol ravaak ji xadôôk, xôq tuôôy Phi-e-rơ hooy dalơh hlê, yôôych axit nhưk long lơuq ku kơy hnoq ik kahlôôp tol kơyq nưq đom oot. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Muuyq bing manih karôp 'ngưng kung ga uun mamuuyq truh xing kaluh theng gah gih Jê-ru-sa-lem, xagook tyauq manih jiq ji khơl manih biq kamuuych a'moh dơơp ra ơơh, đơu dêq hloay oot raay jah payơh.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Bơh atêq tuôôy xalaak kah, thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji dêq hloay khơl adro tyauq kơy nưq (laa khơl manih thuôk bing Sa-đu-sê) viik galaay xuum 'yarơ, <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />yôôch khơl adro nưq tơơk ti tol khơl jah rơơlh ji rôp oot muut hnhư karuk achung. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Bơh đom klôôy, muuyq yaak plêêk ku Lôôk heq luh 'mok hnhư karuk, xagook oot vlôh pi gôk, ji dăt: <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Hooy yuh, ji atêq tuôôy dưk đom hnhư hơu, dayh đnooy dii manih karôp kaluh apok ku varơuq riirh neq.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Anưq yôôch, tuôôy heq tameng anưq, oot hooy muut đom hnhư hơu tuôôy rahưng tađnah ji pato dayq. Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy thơy tơơk tưp kôt dik ji khơl adro tyauq kơy nưq truh aduq, oot ăm anguk hlê Khơl Karôp kung dêq hloay khơl draq lơơk đom manih I-sơ-ra-ên, yôôch patăk manih truh hnhư karuk xôq jarooy khơl jah rơơlh truh. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Bơh tuôôy truh aduq, khơl jư 'yo leh hloq khơl jah rơơlh đom hnhư karuk, nưq laa atêq tuôôy wih wiit hlê, oot tauq taboon, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />tơơl đaneq: “'Wot hloq hnhư tu heq jah kađnoch chăk bơơn kaluh dong varơuq jư 'yo, ji kuun jư yôôych dưk ka 'mok, bơh atêq tuôôy luh vlôh, 'wot be hloq kơyq măn pi 'lăp dêq.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Tuôôy nưq, hloay tuôôy bing oot heq tameng taleq apok nưq, dêq khơl ưk dưk jarooy bing kuun hnhư hơu hloay khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt raay xôôl dôôl truh kaluh tauq taboon, dơơp aleq varơuq đanưq laay hnoq ik xalih vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Anưq yôôch, muuyq kơyq nưq, atêq tuôôy truh aduq, heq tauq dii oot đaneq: “Dayh 'yo nee, khơl manih đơu êêp kơy rôp muut karuk neq đong măn đom hnhư hơu, heq dưk pato dayq manih karôp!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Tuôôy nưq, adro dưk xanok, hooy kung khơl jư 'yo, heq jarooy oot xuq, leh hôôk tơơk jôôk ti, vii oot yôq manih karôp, e đaneq oot biq tiip phơu. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Tuôôy heq jarooy khơl jah rơơlh xuq, khơl adro nưq xôq oot katul Tayuup Karôp, yôôch thơy tơơk tưp kôt xadrah vôôch oot, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />đaneq: “'Wot heq đnooy ka êêp kơy tanưưl kơmq pato dayq đom yal neq, đơu 'yo hơq, êêp kơy heq khienq Jê-ru-sa-lem galaay viik varơuq pato dayq êêp, ji êêp kơy yôôych xung xagook vahaap ku manih nưq uk tol 'wot.” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Bơh tuôôy tơơl hlê, Phi-e-rơ ji khơl jah rơơlh đnooy: “Pheq tameng tyauq Kơy Plêêk iaq laa khơl drơy. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Kơy Plêêk ku mo kơy haay heq khienq Lôôk Jê-xu riirh hlê, Kadraq laa Kơy đơu êêp kơy heq păk kaxêêt, tuôôy kađnok tol gay charăk. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Kơy Plêêk heq vanê Kơy nưq tok dơơp Vuua ji Lôôk Wơơt Dêh măn pi akoh kadraq, xôq kahniq varơuq wiit xuum ka I-sơ-ra-ên kung varơuq ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />'Wot laa manih xanưk ku kaluh varơuq nưq, kung dii Lôôk Phool Hiel, Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ăm khơl manih tameng tyauq Kadraq.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Bơh atêq tuôôy tameng anưq, bing oot thier tưk jaraq ji xung păk kaxêêt khơl jah rơơlh. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy muuyq dro nưq dưk tok katul Tayuup Karôp, laa muuyq adro Pha-ri-si, anơng laa Ga-ma-li-ên, thơy pato ganuun, jah dêq manih dêh kul vado, kơy dăt xagook khơl jah rơơlh vlôh pi gôk muuyq jơy. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Yôôch kơy đnooy dii oot:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:35">“Wơơy oh ay, khơl manih I-sơ-ra-ên, dayh rơơt rol dii xăk xamơk truh varơuq đơu oh ay đinq dơơp ka taleq adro neq. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Vii adroyq kawat neq, Thêu-đa heq dưk tok, kadih xưng ni laa muuyq dro đaleq nưq, sôôq kaluh manih khơl kanau heq nhôp bing kung ni muut kơh poot hreek, đơu ni heq biq păk kaxêêt yôôych dêq hloay khơl adro leq jah nhăp tameng tyauq ni raay biq pachaay, yôôch bing oot hooy truh aduq be e kơyq. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Atêq adro neq, Ju-đa manih Ga-li-lê heq dưk tok đom katuôôy jauq hlê sôôq manih dêh ji dăt manih karôp tyauq ni. Adro nưq kung kaxêêt, yôôych dêq hloay khơl adro leq jah jarooy tyauq ni raay biq pachaay hyaak. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Juneq gô đnooy dii oh ay varơuq neq: Dayh chuh xangưưy klơlh taleq dro nưq ji xôq kê ka oot, vii atoh iq đinq neq long kaluh varơuq neq laa xing koot manih, yôôych ni hnoq biq păk kaxêêt, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />bơh atoh varơuq nưq laa xing Kơy Plêêk, yôôych oh ay hnoq leh ik păk kaxêêt oot, đơu leh kheoq oh ay pheq đnooy hnoq ik biq 'yo laa dro tachơơl dii Kơy Plêêk.” Nưq laa, oot tameng tyauq kơy. <verse eid="ACT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Atêq tuôôy ăm taayh khơl jah rơơlh, tuôôy heq tiel dook yôôch, oot vlôh tanưưl kơmq pato dayq taayh yal Lôôk Jê-xu, yôôch oot tha ăm hooy.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Nưq atoh, khơl jah rơơlh dưk tok hooy klơlh varơuq tangưưr mot kung Tayuup Karôp, hlah hlaak vii oot heq jah 'yo laa taxưngq chiuq biq đnooy ra ơơh vii Yal Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Tôôy hngơy, hloay đom hnhư hơu long đom tưng hnhư, oot leh padơy pato dayq ji padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay — Lôôk Jê-xu laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Tuôôy nưq, đom kaluh hngơy nưq, tuôôy sôôq khơl jah rơơlh đong athêêp tok, yôôych varơuq ramôôl heq xalih vlôh xing manih Jo Thaiq vơ đnooy apok Hi Lap đôôyq dii manih Hê-bơ-rơ, vii khơl mo valơu ku oot đong biq ka'lăk tăk đom varơuq hơu varơuq tôôy hngơy. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Anưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy kưl vaarq khơl jah rơơlh taayh anguk muuyq bing karôp 'ngưng khơl xatyauq, oot đnooy: “Neq laa varơuq leh hnoq 'yo nhonq ik đôôyq dii 'wot tuôôy ka'lăk apok ku Kơy Plêêk vlôh atêq xôq hơu varơuq para xa. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Bơh, wơơy oh ay, dayh rơơlh xok xing katul oh ay pơh dro khơl kanau jah xanưk tolh, viik galaay Kơy Phool Hiel ji varơuq khôôt xet, laa khơl adro đơu 'wot hnoq ik phon pahnăp ka varơuq duh neq. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Măn 'wot yôôych hnoq lo kajưk đom varơuq xadrook apôôy ji varơuq hơu varơuq apok Lôôk.” <verse eid="ACT 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Apok nưq dơơp hlah xuum kangưưr dêq hloay manih karôp. Nưq laa, oot rơơlh Ê-tiên, muuyq dro viik galaay xuum tuôq ji Lôôk Phool Hiel, Phi-lip, Bô-kô-rơ, Ni-ka-nô, Ti-môn, Ba-mê-na ji Ni-kô-la, muuyq dro An-ti-ôt tyauq Jo Thaiq jaauq, <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />laa khơl dro đơu oot jarooy truh xôq dưk kangưưr khơl jah rơơlh, ji atêq tuôôy xadrook apôôy, khơl jah rơơlh xôq ti tol khơl manih nưq.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Yôôch nưq, apok ku Kơy Plêêk athêêp đnoyq ranưh vlôh, ji sôôq adro khơl jah rơơlh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem athêêp muut 'ngưng iaq, jauq hloay muuyq bing thier karôp khơl thơy tơơk tưp heq tameng tyauq xuum tuôq.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Tuôôy nưq, Ê-tiên viik vanong ji taay yaak, dơơp varơuq akêh ji pheep akêh kôt đom manih karôp. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Bơh muuyq sôôq manih heq dưk tok, laa khơl adro thuôk hnhư tagumq hơq, aduq jah taayh laa “Khơl Adro Rayơh Rayơơy”, kung khơl manih Si-ren, manih A-lek-xan-tri, dii taleq dro xing Si-li-si, ji A-si, tagêh apok dii Ê-tiên. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Nưq đơu, oot leh e paraat tachơơl hlê nôôy varơuq khôôt xet ji Kơy Phool Hiel đơu Kơy heq padoh vlôh gamưh Kơy nưq. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Atêq nưq, oot root dăt taleq dro xôq đnooy đaneq: “'Wot heq tameng kơy nưq đnooy kaluh apok katơơk galơh tachơơl dii Môi-se ji Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Oot ahluk dăt dêq manih karôp hloay khơl kadraq lơơk kung khơl thơy pato ganuun, ji atêq tuôôy kathôp truh, oot rôp kơy ji ahoot truh Tayuup Karôp. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Katuôôy, oot ralauq xôq khơl adro dơơp xanưk pa ôôh, taboon luneq: “Manih neq leh padơy đnooy kaluh apok katơơk galơh truh aduq vah ji ganuun. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Vii 'wot heq tameng ni đnooy đaneq Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret hơq hnoq pahyaak ka'lăk aduq neq ji tađôôy kaluh ganuun dơơp đơu Môi-se heq pato hlê ka haay.” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Tuôôy atrêêk 'yo muut kơy, dêq hloay khơl manih đong 'ngôôy đom Tayuup Karôp hloq mamưưt kơy đaji mamưưt ku yaak plêêk.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Tuôôy nưq, thơy tơơk tưp kôt đnooy: “Kaluh varơuq nưq e jơq đanưq long leh?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Nưq laa, kơy đnooy vlôh:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 7:2">“Wơơy oh ay, khơl oh ay ji khơl kơy kadraq lơơk, xiin dayh tameng: Kơy Plêêk tađnah tađnaak heq rama vlôh dii mo kơy Ap-ra-ham ku haay tuôôy kơy măn aduq Mê-sô-bô-ta-mi, adroyq katuôôy kơy măn hlê aduq Cha-ran; <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />ji Kadraq xanoh kung kơy đaneq: ‘Dayh vlôh klơlh dêh palơy ku koot, kung đaji klơlh adrơơk rong nooy ku koot, ji koot dayh hooy truh dêh đơu gô hnoq pato ka koot.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Atêq nưq, atêq tuôôy vlôh klơlh dêh ku tamooy Kanh-đê, kơy riirh aduq Cha-ran. Yôôch xing nưq, atêq tuôôy vaq kơy kaxêêt, Kơy Plêêk heq jarooy kơy muut dêh neq, đom aduq đơu oh ay juneq đong riirh. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Kadraq heq be kahniq ka kơy muuyq hluôôt vari đom dêh, pheq đnooy muuyq aduq tooq pla jôôk kung leh. Nưq đơu Kadraq heq tavek kahniq dêh ka kơy xôq thuôk qwuyen ku kơy, kung ăm koot xau ku kơy xatyauq atêq kơy, long kơy koq e koot. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Lunư, Kơy Plêêk heq xanoh luneq, đaneq adrơơk kơy hnoq laa dêh tamooy aduq muuyq dêh xangưưy be xet, yôôch khơl drơy hnoq rôp oot dơơp xapok đơu xa dơơp ra ơơh đom poot hreek xanưm. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Kơy Plêêk xanoh: ‘Ji Gô hnoq xadrah dook vari dêh đơu oot heq pheq tameng xatyauq, yôôch atêq nưq, oot hnoq vlôh hooy ji ayuôôt laat Gô ka aduq neq.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Kadraq kung heq kahniq ăm kơy tavek truh pheep goch kađuh, ji vii anưq, kơy pahleh I-sak ji dơơp pheep goch kađuh ka koot kơy muut hngơy thưq thơơm; I-sak dơơp đanưq ka Ja-kôp, ji Ja-kôp kung dơơp anưq ka kưl vaarq ưk adrơơk. <verse eid="ACT 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Vii khơl ưk adrơơk 'yarơ dii Jô-sep, oot heq tek kơy hlê Ai Kâp; đơu Kơy Plêêk măn kung kơy, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />ji waak wơơt kơy klơlh tôôy varơuq pơơl hwơơl ku kơy, Kadraq kung kahniq vanong ji varơuq khôôt xet ka kơy kangưưr Pha-ra-ôn, vuua Ai Kâp, ji vuua nưq heq lăp kơy jư 'yo tol Ai Kâp kung dêq hnhư kơy. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq naanq pangoot xalih truh tol loch dêq dêh Ai Kâp ji Ka-na-an, laa varơuq pơơl dal thier kôt, ji khơl mo kơy ku haay be axek jah tuôông xa. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Anưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy tameng aduq A Kâp e va away, Ja-kôp patăk khơl mo kơy haay truh đnư đơơt thưq nhưk. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Ji đom đơơt thưq vaarq, Jô-sep heq kadih kahnoq vlôh kadih xăk ka khơl ay kơy, yôôch kôôch hnhư ku Jô-sep jah Pha-ra-ôn nhonq xet. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy dăt khơl ay xuq, Jô-sep dăt đoonq Ja-kôp, vaq kơy, kung dêq hloay khơl hnhư, dii sôôq manih laa pơh kưl dăp. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Nưq laa, Ja-kôp hooy pôôt truh Ai Kâp, yôôch kơy kaxêêt, ji khơl mo kơy ku haay kung anưq. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Oot jah jarooy truh Si-chem ji up đom xanưng đơu Ap-ra-ham heq root dii sôôq jêêt bơơn baak xing khơl koot kanau ku Hê-mô aduq Si-chem. <verse eid="ACT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Tuôôy nưq, tyauq đaji kawat ku apok tavek đơu Kơy Plêêk heq tavek dii Ap-ra-ham heq truh jeq, yôôych sôôq manih athêêp 'ngưng ji jah karôp 'ngưng aduq Ai Kâp, <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />dong truh tuôôy muuyq dro vuua kadrơy dưk xanok Ai Kâp, đơu vuua nưq 'miêh leh xet Jô-sep. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Vii xôq vih haiq manih tamooy haay, vuua nưq heq dơơp ra ơơh mo kơy haay, dơơp ka khơl oh nga đơơu pa iir ku oot biq avih ka'lăk, leh ik jư ăm riirh. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Muut tuôôy đơu Môi-se jah pa iir vlôh, kơy kaxay tamaq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. Kơy jah văch xiap pe xiêk đom hnhư vaq kơy. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy kơy biq vơơ hloq, koot kadrê ku Pha-ra-ôn heq xagook kơy hooy ji văch xiap kơy đaji koot kanau ni. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Môi-se jah pato dayq đom tôôy varơuq khôôt xet ku manih Ai Kâp, kơy măn e paraat đom apok đnooy ji varơuq dơơp ku kơy. <verse eid="ACT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Bơh tuôôy kawat poot kưl xanưm heq truh dii kơy, biit vlôh đom xuum kơy iq xung truh hlơq oh ay kơy, nưq laa koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Tuôôy hloq muuyq dro nưq biq dơơp ra ơơh, kơy heq dưk vlôh bing ji dưk dơơp varơuq bla thu ka adro biq rôp toop tuôôy hmơt kaxêêt manih Ai Kâp hơq, <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />kơy măn biit oh ay hlolh đaneq Kơy Plêêk bơyh ti kơy đong taway truh varơuq wơơt ka oot, bơh oot leh hlolh. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Hngơy atêq, kơy e mot katul oot tuôôy đong takaay tayaat, ji kơy ahmưk nhăk oot wih truh varơuq tagu, đaneq: ‘Nee khơl ay, khơl ay raay laa oh ay. Vii aleq khơl ay tagay jiq xuum mamuuyq?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Bơh adro đong dơơp ra ơơh manih gah gih kơy heq taluq kơy vlôh, đnooy: ‘Kơyq heq lăp kơy dơơp manih dưk xanok ji padrok xadrah tol 'wot? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />Dang aleq laa kơy đong xung păk kaxêêt gô đaji kach đơu kơy heq păk kaxêêt manih Ai Kâp hngơy ahnưh?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Anưq yôôch, Môi-se xadăk klôônq adroyq apok đnooy nưq, ji kơy vlôh jêêk tamooy măn hlê đom dêh Ma-đi-an, aduq đơu kơy pahleh jah vaarq koot kanau. <verse eid="ACT 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />Tuôôy poot kưl xanưm heq dalơh hlê, muuyq yaak plêêk rama vlôh dii kơy aduq wăngq we thuôk đoot Si-nai, đom muuyq đum ôôlh aduq pôôp jaliê. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy 'yo hloq anưq, Môi-se xok dơơp akêh truh ka varơuq nưq, yôôch tuôôy kơy truh jeq xôq 'yo dong kih, yôôych e apok ku Lôôk: <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Gô laa Kơy Plêêk ku mo kơy koot, Kơy Plêêk ku Ap-ra-ham, ku I-sak ji ku Ja-kôp.’ Tuôôy nưq, vii varơuq yôq varaal ka ung truh, Môi-se leh hôôk 'yo. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Yôôch Lôôk xanoh dii kơy: ‘Dayh tơq kaxôôp vlôh klơlh jôôk koot, vii aduq đơu koot đong dưk laa vari vah. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Atêq tuôôy heq 'yo, gô 'yo hloq varơuq pơơl hwơơl ku tamooy Gô aduq Ai Kâp, Gô heq tameng apok tanguh alo ku oot, ji Gô heq pôôt xôq wơơt oot. Juneq, dayh hlê đnen nee, Gô patăk koot truh Ai Kâp.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />Môi-se neq, kơy đơu oot heq chôôyq ka'lăk xing tuôôy đnooy: ‘Kơyq heq lăp kơy dơơp manih xakaq 'yo long padrok xadrah?’ — Kơy Plêêk patăk dăt kơy vơơ dơơp kơy xakaq 'yo vơơ dơơp manih wơơt, xing ti ku yaak plêêk heq rama vlôh dii kơy aduq pôôp jaliê. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Kơy heq jarooy oot vlôh, atêq tuôôy dơơp kaluh pheep akêh ji dơuq akêh aduq dêh Ai Kâp ji aduq Tahli Dôôp, kung đaji đom wăngq we tuôôt poot kưl xanưm. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Nưq laa Môi-se, kơy heq đnooy dii koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên đaneq: ‘Kơy Plêêk hnoq panưk tok muuyq kơy hlit ka oh ay dang đaji gô, xing katul đom khơl oh ay ku oh ay.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Neq laa manih măn đom manih karôp aduq wăngq we kung dii kơy hơu, Kơy heq xanoh kung kơy tol đoot Si-nai, ji dii khơl mo kơy haay, kơy laa dro heq nhonq xok apok hloay riirh xôq kahniq ăm haay, <verse eid="ACT 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />đơu đôôyq kung kơy, mo kơy haay leh trôôch tameng tyauq; wih hlê, oot chôôyq ka'lăk ji awih xuum oot wih truh Ai Kâp, <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />tuôôy dăt A-rôn: ‘Dayh dơơp ka 'wot kaluh yaak hnoq jarooy pato 'wot. Truh phon Môi-se neq, manih heq jarooy 'wot vlôh klơlh dêh Ai Kâp, 'wot leh xet varơuq kajoq heq xalih vlôh ka kơy nưq.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Nưq laa, oot dơơp muuyq vangưl bo koot đom kaluh hngơy nưq ji tơơk tưp ôq ka dang vangưl nưq, yôôch hlah hlaak vii varơuq dơơp ku ti oot. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Tuôôy nưq, Kơy Plêêk wih katoor ji ka'lăk oot ayuôôt laat kaluh xalok tol plêêk, đaji heq valơk đom rahlăp ku khơl hnhư hlit, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Wơơy hnhư I-sơ-ra-ên, be aleq êêp koot heq tơơk tưp ka Gô kaluh ôq ji kuah lêh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">đom tuôôt poot kưl xanưm aduq wăngq we?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Êêp koot heq xakôôk raap đơ ku yaak Mo-lok</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ji xalok yaak Rom-phan ku êêp koot,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">— kaluh dang vangưl đơu êêp koot heq dơơp vlôh xôq akuh kaluh nưq —</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 7:43">ji Gô hnoq xagook êêp hlê pi hơq Ba-bi-lôn.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Raap xanưk tavek măn kung mo kơy haay đom wăngq we, dang đaji Kơy xanoh dii Môi-se heq padoh pato, pheq dơơp raap nưq tyauq khwuôôn dang đơu kơy heq hloq, <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />đơu kung dii raap nưq, atêq tuôôy xôq padooy dưk katôôl, mo kơy haay kung heq xagook tyauq 'laarq katuôôy Jô-suê đom varơuq hooy tagoa dêh ku khơl tamooy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq đuôôy hooy kangưưr mo kơy haay ăm truh katuôôy Đa-vik, <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />laa dro jah vanong kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, ji kơy heq apôôy vôôch xôq axek muuyq aduq măn ka hnhư ku Ja-kôp. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Anưq yôôch, Sa-lô-môn heq xơy panưk hnhư ka Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Lunư, Kơy Thier Yơơt leh măn đom aduq ti manih dơơp vlôh, đaji hnhư hlit e đnooy:<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />‘Lôôk xanoh: Plêêk laa ngôôy Gô, ji vari laa đool xôq jôôk Gô.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Êêp koot hnoq xơy hnhư đaleq ka Gô?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Long aduq leq deng ka varơuq padơy pado ku Gô?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Be aalq ti Gô heq panưk jêêk dêq hloay kaluh thưq neq ih?’<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Wơơy khơl manih găk ranong, xuum ji tôôr leh chiuq goch kađuh hơq! Oh ay hloay tachơơl tangưưr Lôôk Phool Hiel. Mo kơy ku oh ay đaleq, oh ay kung đanưq. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Muuyq dro leq đom khơl hnhư hlit đơu mo kơy ku oh ay heq leh rôp toop? Oot heq păk kaxêêt khơl adro padoh tauq adroyq ka varơuq truh ku Kơy Hyioh Jăk, đơu oh ay đong heq vlôh jêêk adro xalih xuum ji dro păk kaxêêt Kơy nưq, <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />nưq laa khơl adro heq nhonq ganuun xing varơuq đnooy pato ku khơl yaak plêêk, đơu leh jư xok.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy tameng kaluh apok nưq, oot biq pưk xalôh tôq jaraq đom xuum oot, ji oot takik kaneeng dii kơy. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Bơh đong tuôôy jah viik galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel, atêq tuôôy 'yo tamaak tol plêêk, kơy hloq varơuq tađnah tađnaak ku Kơy Plêêk ji Lôôk Jê-xu dưk măn pi akoh Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Kơy đnooy: “'Yo hơq, gô hloq kaluh tal plêêk jah luh ranưh, ji Koot Manih dưk măn pi akoh Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="ACT 7:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy alo pariau kôt apok, oot kajet tôôr oot hlê yôôch kung mamuuyq kathôp muut kơy. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Tuôôy heq taluq vlôh pi gôk theng, oot tiip phơu muut kơy. Khơl adro xanưk xôq aau gôk ku oot aduq jôôk muuyq tadăp blaay jah taayh laa Sau-lơ. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Oot tiip phơu Ê-tiên đom kaplah kơy apôôy, đaneq: “Kuh Lôôk Jê-xu, xiin taway xok phool hiel koot.” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Anưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy kul takuul pôôt, kơy taayh kôt apok: “Lôôk lơơy, Kadraq leh uk kadrôôp neq tol oot.” Tuôôy đnooy apok nưq xong yôôych kơy vik.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Tuôôy nưq, Sau-lơ 'miêh trôôch varơuq păk kaxêêt Ê-tiên.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Anưq yôôch, đom hngơy nưq, muuyq đơơt rôp toop kôt heq xalih vlôh tachơơl dii Tayuup Vah aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, măn dêq hloay khơl tuôq pachaay hyaak loch dêh Ju-đê ji Sa-ma-ri, leh jauq khơl jah rơơlh. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Khơl adro tuôq kuh heq up xôq Ê-tiên ji e varơuq nhim angơuq thier kôt deng ka kơy. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Bơh, Sau-lơ dơơp ra ơơh kôt ka Tayuup Vah. Tuôôy kưq kahluh muut tưng hnhư, ahoot kaah khơl kanau hloay khơl kadrê vlôh, kơy rôp oot muut karuk.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Long anưq, khơl adro biq pachaay hyaak heq hooy loch aduq padoh vlôh Hêêl Kaxay truh apok Lôôk. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lip hooy aloh truh theng Sa-ma-ri, kơy đnooy vlôh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh ka oot. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Tuôôy nưq, manih karôp muuyq xuum tabông truh muut kaluh kajoq jah Phi-lip padoh, đom tuôôy tameng kaluh apok nưq ji hloq kaluh pheep akêh đơu kơy dưk dơơp. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Vii 'ngưng dro đom sôôq oot biq kaluh garu xi nhôp, ni heq vlôh klơlh atêq tuôôy pariau kôt apok tok. Măn 'ngưng dro biq talêêt ji tâk yôôych heq jah payơh. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Tuôôy nưq, e varơuq hlah hlaak thier kôt đom theng nưq.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Bơh muuyq dro khơl kanau nưq, anơng laa Si-môn, adroyq neq heq hmưq dơơp thơy pajơơu đom theng ji dơơp tưng hưng manih Sa-ma-ri, kadih xưng ni laa khơl kôt lơyq, <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />manih đơu dêq hloay oot, xing de truh kôt, raay tabông tameng tyauq vii đnooy đaneq: “Kơy neq laa taay yaak ku Kơy Plêêk, laa varơuq jah taayh laa Kôt Lơyq.” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl drơy tameng tyauq kơy, vii đom muuyq kawat yơơt, kơy heq khienq oot tưng hưng bơơn kaluh varơuq pajơơu. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Bơh tuôôy oot tuôq Phi-lip, vii jah padoh đnooy hêêl kaxay truh daak Kơy Plêêk ji yal ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, yôôych oot chiuq Bap-tem, dêq khơl kanau hloay khơl kadrê. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Yôôch kadih Si-môn kung tuôq, tuôôy heq chiuq Bap-tem, kơy kưq athêêp đnoyq măn dii Phi-lip. Kung hloay, tuôôy jah hloq kaluh hlêêl akêh ji kaluh varơuq taay yaak kôt lơyq xalih vlôh, kơy thier tưng hưng.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy tameng đaneq tamooy dêh Sa-ma-ri heq tuôq nhonq đaauq ku Kơy Plêêk, khơl jah rơơlh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem dăt Phi-e-rơ ji Jăng truh dii oot, <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />laa vaarq adro jah rơơlh đơu atêq tuôôy truh aduq, heq xadrook apôôy ka oot, xôq oot hnoq ik nhonq xok Lôôk Phool Hiel. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Vii Kadraq 'miêh koq kahri tol muuyq kơyq đom sôôq oot, bơh oot vơ laa heq jah Bap-tem đom yal Lôôk Jê-xu đơu heq. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Anưq vaarq dro khơl jah rơơlh xôq ti tol oot, yôôch oot nhonq xok Lôôk Phool Hiel. <verse eid="ACT 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy hloq đaneq Kơy Phool Hiel jah kahniq ăm gamưh varơuq xôq ti ku khơl jah rơơlh, yôôych Si-môn palo jêêt ka oot, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />wơơy: “Xiin kung ăm gô qwuyen da uh neq xôq atoh kơyq đơu gô xôq ti tol, yôôych adro nưq hnoq ik nhonq jah Lôôk Phool Hiel.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Bơh Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii kơy: “Apôôy ka jêêt ku kơy măn đom varơuq păk kaxêêt dêq kung kơy, vii kơy biit root ik vanong kahniq ku Kơy Plêêk bơơn jêêt! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Leh e phon long apiq kajoq đom varơuq neq deng ka kơy, vii xuum kơy be aalq laa hyioh jăk kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Anưq, dayh wiit xuum truh varơuq xơk neq ku kơy ji xadrook apôôy dii Lôôk, xet 'leq gamưh đnư đơu biit truh ku xuum kơy hnoq jah ka'lăk. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Vii gô hloq kơy đong măn đom kamit pahlăk ji looy tooy ku varơuq leh hyioh jăk.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Bơh tơơl hlê, Si-môn tơơl: “Xiin khơl kơy xadrook apôôy dii Lôôk thay ka gô, xôq leh muuyq varơuq leq đom kaluh varơuq đơu êêp kơy vơơ đnooy hnoq ik xalih vlôh ka gô.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Anưq, atêq tuôôy dơơp xanưk ji padoh apok Lôôk, oot wih hlê ngưưr xuq Jê-ru-sa-lem, kung hloay đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay ka 'ngưng palơy ku manih Sa-ma-ri.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq yaak plêêk ku Lôôk xanoh dii Phi-lip đaneq: “Dayh dưk tok ji hooy xuq pi naam tol trôôk xing Jê-ru-sa-lem jarooy pôôt truh Ga-xa.” (Nưq laa aduq wăngq we.) <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Tuôôy heq dưk tok, kơy dưk hooy, ji 'yo hơq, muuyq dro khơl kanau, manih Ê-thi-ô-bi, padrok thaiq jaamq hơu vuua ku Kan-đak, mo vuua Ê-thi-ô-bi, laa dro 'miêh đong jư 'yo dêq hloay kho bauq ku mo, kơy heq truh xôq ayuôôt laat aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />kung tuôôy nưq, kơy đong wiit xuq, 'ngôôy tol xe ôô ahleh ku kơy ji đok rahlăp hlit Ê-sai. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Tuôôy nưq, Kơy Phool Hiel đnooy dii Phi-lip: “Dayh truh jeq ji hlê jeq xe ôô ahleh nưq.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Anưq yôôch, tuôôy heq charơơk truh, Phi-lip tameng adro padrok neq đong đok rahlăp hlit Ê-sai, yôôych kơy đnooy: “Kadraq dong dik hlolh kaluh kajoq kơy đong đok long leh?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Bơh adro padrok đnooy: “Dơơp kach leq đơu gô hnoq ik hlolh ik, atoh muuyq kơyq nưq hnoq pato jarooy ka gô?” Kung tuôôy nưq, kơy mơơy Phi-lip tawaak tok xôq 'ngôôy kung dii kơy. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Tuôôy nưq, talok Rahlăp Vah đơu kơy đong đok laa đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">“Kơy biq jarooy hooy đaji trưưu truh loo pưk dơơp ôq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">ji đaji trưưu koot im hnhep kangưưr manih goch hlôôk ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:32">lunưq, Kơy be luh huuy kơy.<verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Đom varơuq dơơp ra ơơh, hyioh jăk ku Kơy biq varoh xok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Kơyq hnoq taboon hlê ka adrơơk Kơy?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ACT 8:33">Vii xăk riirh Kơy heq biq xagook klơlh vari.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Tuôôy đnooy hlê, padrok thaiq jaamq đnooy dii Phi-lip: “Gô xiin ay ăm gô xet, hnhư hlit đong đnooy varơuq neq truh akơyq — truh kadih xăk kơy long truh muuyq kơyq kadrơy?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Anưq laa, luh huuy kơy vlôh ji pa xarôp xing phon Rahlăp Vah neq, Phi-lip đnooy vlôh Hêêl Kaxay truh Lôôk Jê-xu ka adro padrok nưq. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Anưq yôôch, tuôôy oot đong hooy tol trôôk, oot hooy truh aduq e daak nưq, yôôych padrok thaiq jaamq dăt: “'Yo hơq, daak! Varơuq kajoq đong klơl hlê gô chiuq bap-tem?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />[Tuôôy nưq, Phi-lip đnooy dii kơy: “Atoh kơy tuôq bơơn dêq hloay xuum klaak kơy, yôôych kơy hnoq jah wơơt.” Anưq yôôch tuôôy tơơl apok, dro padrok đnooy: “Gô tuôq muut Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, laa Koot Kơy Plêêk.”] <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Adro padrok đnooy dăt dưk xe ôô ahleh hlê ji dêq baarq raay hooy pôôt daak, dêq Phi-lip ji padrok thaiq jaamq, yôôch kơy dơơp bap-tem ka dro padrok nưq. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy oot heq tok klơlh daak, Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk taway Phi-lip hooy, ji padrok thaiq jaamq leh măn 'yo hloq kơy đnoyq, adro padrok hlah hlaak hooy đnoyq tyauq trôôk ni. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Măn Phi-lip yôôych jah 'yo hloq aduq A-xôt, ji tuôôy dalơh hlê dêh nưq, kơy padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ka dêq hloay kaluh theng, dong truh tuôôy kơy hooy truh Sê-sa-rê.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Bơh Sau-lơ, đom tuôôy hloay kưq đnooy apok naap joa ji varơuq păk kaxêêt tachơơl dii khơl jah rơơlh ku Lôôk, atêq tuôôy truh dii thơy tơơk tưp kôt, <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />yôôych xiin xing aduq kơy kaluh hla thư deng ka khơl hnhư anguk aduq Đa-mach, xôq atoh kơy axek jah paq kê kơyq tyauq Đaauq, kaah khơl kanau hloay khơl kadrê, yôôych Kơy xagook oot đom tuôôy biq vek jarooy xuq Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Tuôôy nưq, đom tuôôy hooy trôôk, varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy kơy jeq truh theng Đa-mach, tưng hưng xaraar tađnah xing plêêk jaraak tađnah tol kơy, <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />yôôch, atêq tuôôy gưlh pôôt vari, kơy tameng muuyq xarooy xanoh dii kơy: “Sau-lơ, Sau-lơ, aleq koot rôp toop gô?” <verse eid="ACT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy đnooy: “Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq laa kơyq?” Lôôk xanoh: “Gô laa Jê-xu đơu koot đong rôp toop; <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />lunư, dayh dưk tok ji hooy muut đom theng, yôôch dong varơuq hnoq jah đnooy dii koot truh varơuq kajoq duh dik ka koot xôq dưk dơơp.” <verse eid="ACT 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Bơh khơl adro hooy trôôk kung kơy yôôych dưk đnư leh đnooy ik apok, tuôôy tek xarooy đơu leh hloq kơyq. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Tuôôy nưq, Sau-lơ dưk tok klơlh vari, bơh tuôôy mot ku kơy jah luh vlôh, yôôych kơy be hloq kajoq dêq. Anưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy rôp ti jarooy kơy hooy, oot xagook kơy muut theng Đa-mach. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Tuôôt pe hngơy, kơy leh 'yo hloq kajoq, ji kơy be xa kung be hôôch.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Tuôôy nưq, aduq theng Đa-mach e muuyq dro jah rơơlh nưq anơng A-na-nia. Lôôk xanoh dii kơy đom muuyq ăm xet adroyq: “A-na-nia lơơy!” Yôôch kơy đnooy: “Kuh Lôôk, xiin 'yo nee, koot neq!” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk xanoh dii ay: “Atêq tuôôy dưk tok, dayh hooy truh trôôk taayh laa Hyioh Jăk, ji dayh axek đom hnhư ku Ju-đa muuyq dro anơng Sau-lơ, manih Tat-sơ, dayh văch 'yo, vii manih neq đong xadrook apôôy, <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />ji đom muuyq varơuq ăm hloq adroyq, kơy nưq heq hloq muuyq dro anơng A-na-nia hooy muut ji xôq ti tol kơy xôq kơy nưq hnoq ik tađnah mot hlê.” <verse eid="ACT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Bơh A-na-nia tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, koot heq tameng xing 'ngưng manih truh adro neq, truh xet taleq varơuq ra ơơh kơy nưq heq dơơp vlôh ka khơl jah rơơlh ku Kadraq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Ji ka đnen, kơy nưq e varơuq ăm qwuyen xing khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt xôq rôp vek tôôy adro taayh apôôy yal Kadraq.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Nưq bơh, Lôôk xanoh dii kơy: “Kưq hooy yuh, vii kơy neq laa kông varơuq ku varơuq rơơlh đôôyq dii Gô, xôq xagook yal Gô vlôh kangưưr kaluh tamooy kadrơy, jauq hloay khơl vuua, kung dii koot xau I-sơ-ra-ên; <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />vii Gô hnoq kahnoq ka kơy nưq xet kơy duh pheq chiuq pơơl 'ngưng đaleq vii yal Gô.” <verse eid="ACT 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Anưq yôôch, A-na-nia dưk hooy ji hooy muut đom hnhư nưq. Atêq tuôôy xôq ti tol kơy, kơy đnooy đaneq: “Nee ay Sau-lơ, Lôôk heq patăk gô — nưq laa Lôôk Jê-xu, Kơy heq rama vlôh kung ay tol trôôk đơu ay hooy truh đnen — xôq ay hnoq ik 'yo hloq hlê ji jah viik galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Hloay jơnưq, muuyq thưq kajoq nưq dang đaji kaxaap, kaluh nưq klêh klơlh mot ku kơy, vơơ hloay, kơy 'yo hloq hlê, ji atêq tuôôy dưk tok, kơy chiuq pheep bap-tem; <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />tuôôy heq nhonq tuôông xa, kơy jah e hlê kalh paraat.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Tuôôy nưq, kơy măn dii khơl jah rơơlh aduq Đa-mach taleq hngơy. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Hloay jơnưq, Kơy padoh taboon Lôôk Jê-xu đom kaluh hnhư hơu, đaneq Kadraq laa Koot Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Tôôy dro tameng raay tưng hưng, đnooy: “Be aalq neq laa dro heq păk kaxêêt khơl manih apôôy taayh yal neq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem ih? Ji be aalq kơy nưq heq truh đnen vii kakơq nưq, xôq atêq tuôôy rôp vek yôôych jarooy oot xuq ăm khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt be aalq?” <verse eid="ACT 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Bơh Sau-lơ kưq kalh paraat athêêp, ji dơơp xôôl dôôl ka khơl manih Jo Thaiq riirh aduq Đa-mach bơơn kach dưk xanưk đaneq Jê-xu laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Lunư, tuôôy 'ngưng hngơy heq dalơh hlê, manih Jo Thaiq kung mamuuyq xôq vih păk kaxêêt kơy. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Nưq bơh, xôq vih ku oot heq jah tauq ka Sau-lơ xet. Anưq yôôch, khơl drơy pheq đnooy kôô 'yo kaluh 'mok theng hloay hngơy ji kamơng xôq păk kaxêêt kơy. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy jarooy hooy đom klôôy, khơl xatyauq ku kơy xôq kơy pôôt pi gôk apưt theng, bơơn kach raduk kơy pôôt đom muuyq poop vuk.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Bơh tuôôy heq truh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, kơy raanq paraat axek trôôk xôq jah tagu dii khơl xatyauq, đơu dêq hloay oot raay yôq kơy, leh tuôq đaneq kơy laa khơl xatyauq. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy jarooy kơy hooy, Ba-na-ba xagook kơy truh tavơh khơl jah rơơlh, yôôch taboon ka oot dơơp aleq đơu kơy heq 'yo xet Lôôk tol trôôk, kung đaji Kadraq heq xanoh dii kơy, ji đaleq aduq Đa-mach, kơy heq kôk kalh padoh taboon taayh yal Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Anưq laa, kơy măn kung dii oot tuôôy muut vlôh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, kôk kalh padoh taboon taayh yal Lôôk. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kơy vơơ athêêk, vơơ tagêh apok dii khơl manih Jo Thaiq đnooy apok Hi Lap, bơh oot axek trôôk păk kaxêêt kơy. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Bơh tuôôy heq xet đanưq, khơl oh ay jarooy kơy pôôt truh Sê-sa-rê, ji jarooy kơy hlê Tat-sơ.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Anưq, tayuup vah loch hloay dêh Ju-đê, Ga-li-lê, ji Sa-ma-ri e varơuq hrok hrol; vii jah panưk tok kung tawaak hooy đom varơuq kuh yôq Lôôk ji đom varơuq hlơq hlôôp ku Lôôk Phool Hiel, tayuup vah jah karôp athêêp 'ngưng. <verse eid="ACT 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh nưq laa tuôôy Phi-e-rơ đong hooy loch dêq dêh, yôôych kung hooy aloh truh aduq khơl vah riirh aduq Li-đa. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Yôôch aduq nưq, kơy tavơh muuyq dro hơq, anơng Ê-nê, đong vik lêêt tol chanưng tuôôt thơơm xanưm, nưq laa dro biq taqwauq talêêt. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Phi-e-rơ đnooy dii ay nưq: “Ê-nê lơơy, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu payơh ka ay. Dayh dưk tok ji deep chanưng kơy yơu,” ji hloay jơnưq, ay dưk tok. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Dêq hloay khơl leq riirh aduq Li-đa ji Sa-rôn heq hloq ay, oot raay wiit hlê kung Lôôk.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Tuôôy nưq, aduq Jôp-bê e muuyq khơl jah rơơlh nưq anơng Ta-bi-tha, anơng nưq, tuôôy jah jich vlôh, yôôych taayh laa “Đô-ka”. Mư 'miêh viik kaluh varơuq tamaq kung dii 'ngưng varơuq ăm hloh đơu mư heq dơơp. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Varơuq xalih vlôh đom kaluh hngơy nưq, nưq laa atêq tuôôy gưlh jiq, mư kaxêêt. Xatyauq nưq, tuôôy heq hôôp 'nhaau ka mư yôôch, khơl drơy xôq mư đom rawaak tol paak ataalh. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Vii Li-đa măn jeq Jôp-bê, lunưq khơl xatyauq tuôôy tameng đaneq Phi-e-rơ đong măn aduq nưq, oot patăk vaarq dro truh kung kơy, hluk hluul: “Xiin dayh dayh truh dii 'wot.” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Nưq laa, atêq tuôôy dưk tok, Phi-e-rơ hooy raa dii oot, laa khơl dro đơu, tuôôy heq truh aduq, oot jarooy kơy tok rawaak tol paak, yôôch dêq hloay mo valơu truh pi gah kơy nhim, ji pato ka kơy 'yo kaluh aau kahliik kung 'ngưng qwuân aau đaleq đơu Đô-ka heq axit tuôôy đong măn kung oot. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Bơh tuôôy heq dăt dêq hloay vlôh pi gôk ji kul takuul pôôt, Phi-e-rơ xadrook apôôy, yôôch atêq tuôôy wih hlê xaak kaxêêt, kơy đnooy: “Ta-bi-tha, dayh kah yuh.” Nưq laa, mư liêk mot mư vlôh, ji tuôôy 'yo hloq Phi-e-rơ, mư 'ngôôy kah. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Atêq tuôôy palo ti vlôh ka mư, kơy rôôk mư dưk tok, yôôch tuôôy heq taayh khơl vah ji khơl mo valơu muut, kơy ăm hloq mư đong riirh. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Tuôôy nưq, kaluh varơuq neq vlôh jêêk hêêl padoh vlôh loch dêq Jôp-bê ji 'ngưng dro tuôq muut Lôôk. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Varơuq xalih vlôh atêq nưq laa kơy heq măn hlê 'ngưng hngơy aduq Jôp-bê dii muuyq dro nưq anơng Si-môn, laa thơq thuôk kađuh.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Tuôôy nưq aduq theng Sê-sa-rê, muuyq dro nưq anơng Kot-nây, laa padrok xakaq kôt thuôk bing kuun jah taayh laa I-ta-li, <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />laa manih tamaq xuum ji kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk kung dii hloay hnhư kơy, dơơp 'ngưng varơuq ăm hloh ka manih karôp ji xadrook apôôy dii Kơy Plêêk kach hloay hloay. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Đom kơh kawah wat thưq xiit đom hngơy, đom muuyq varơuq ăm xet adroyq, kơy 'yo hloq ro raang muuyq yaak plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk truh dii kơy ji đnooy kung kơy: “Kot-nây!” <verse eid="ACT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Bơh atêq tuôôy 'yo anhinq muut kơy yaak plêêk ji kadrăch varaal, kơy đnooy: “Wơơy kadraq, e varơuq kajoq?” Yôôch kơy nưq đnooy dii kơy: “Kaluh apok xadrook apôôy ku kơy kung dii kaluh varơuq tamaq kaxay ku kơy heq tok truh kangưưr Kơy Plêêk đaji muuyq kuah lêh văch truh. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Tuôôy nưq, dayh patăk manih truh Jôp-bê ji ăm mơơy Si-môn nưq, adro jah taayh laa Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Kơy nưq đong jah đoonq tiip xing muuyq Si-môn hơq, thơq thuôk kađuh, laa dro e hnhư ka gah tahli.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Anưq yôôch, tuôôy yaak plêêk, laa kơy xanoh dii kơy, heq chuh hooy, yôôych atêq tuôôy taayh vaarq dro xapok đom hnhư, kung dii muuyq dro kuun kuh kul đom sôôq khơl manih hơu varơuq kơy, <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />ji tuôôy heq taboon ka oot tôôy varơuq, kơy patăk oot truh Jôp-bê.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Hngơy atêq, đong tuôôy khơl manih nưq hooy trôôk ji jeq truh theng, Phi-e-rơ hooy tok ataalh apo hnhư xôq xadrook apôôy kawah wat thưq drơu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy xarôp tek pangoot ji trôôch xa, bơh đom tuôôy khơl drơy đong palauq tuôông xa, muuyq varơuq ăm xet adroyq truh tol kơy, <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />kơy hloq lawah plêêk heq jah luh vlôh ji muuyq tuôông tađnưk nưq kahri pôôt, dang đaji muuyq tômq khanh kôt, jah ahlea pôôt vari xing poot muum, <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />đơu đom nưq laa dêq hloay kaluh paroh ôô poot jôôk, kaluh paroh ahoot kanaap tol vari ji kaluh xêêp plêêk, <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Yôôch muuyq apok xanoh truh kung kơy: “Phi-e-rơ, atêq tuôôy kah, dayh dơơp ôq ji xa yơu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Bơh Phi-e-rơ tơơl: “Kuh Lôôk, leh ik 'leq, vii koot be dong leq xa paq kê thưq kajoq klơơr 'yêq ji leh xarêh xaraat.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Ji muuyq yưk tra, apok xanoh nưq truh dii kơy đom yưk thưq vaarq: “Kaluh kajoq Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp xarêh, koot te 'yo laa klơơr 'yêq.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Anưq yôôch, varơuq neq xalih vlôh truh pe yưk, ji vâk nưq hloay jơnưq jah atok tol plêêk.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Tuôôy nưq, đom tuôôy Phi-e-rơ đong xôôl dôôl đom xuum truh varơuq ăm xet adroyq đơu kơy vơơ hloq laa kajoq, yôôych 'yo hơq, khơl adro jah Kot-nây patăk hooy heq dưk kangưưr 'mok, atêq tuôôy axek vôôch hnhư Si-môn. <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />Tok apok taayh, oot vôôch Si-môn, jah taayh laa Phi-e-rơ, e jơq long leh laa đong jah tiip đoonq ka đnen. <verse eid="ACT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Măn Phi-e-rơ, đom tuôôy măn đong biit truh varơuq ăm xet adroyq hơq, yôôych Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh dii kơy: “'Yo hơq, pe dro khơl kanau đong axek koot. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Lunư atêq tuôôy dưk tok, koot dayh pôôt ji hooy dii oot, leh kamưưl ier kajoq, vii Gô heq patăk oot.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Nưq laa, tuôôy heq hooy pôôt truh taleq dro nưq, Phi-e-rơ đnooy: “'Yo ne, gô laa dro khơl ay đong axek. Vii kakơq kajoq đơu khơl ay truh đnen?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Tuôôy nưq, oot đnooy: “Padrok ưk kôt Kot-nây, muuyq dro hyioh jăk ji kul yôq Kơy Plêêk, kung hloay jah xanưk tolh xing padêq manih Jo Thaiq, heq jah muuyq kơy hơu vah pato dayq pheq taayh kơy truh hnhư kơy xôq tameng kaluh apok pato dăt xing aduq kơy.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Anưq, tuôôy heq mơơy oot muut hnhư, kơy tiip đoonq oot.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Yôôch hngơy atêq đnoyq, atêq tuôôy dưk tok, kơy hooy vlôh dii oot, ji taleq oh ay xing Jôp-bê raay hooy dii kơy. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Ji yôôch, hngơy atêq, oot hooy truh Sê-sa-rê. Tuôôy nưq, Kot-nây đong kôô oot, đom tuôôy heq taayh 'ngưng oh ay kơy kung khơl 'wơyq qween xet tagumq tưưuq hlê. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy Phi-e-rơ tawaak muut, tuôôy tavơh mot kơy, yôôych Kot-nây kuh ayuôôt, kul pôôt aduq jôôk kơy. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Bơh Phi-e-rơ rôôk kơy dưk, đnooy: “Xiin dayh dưk tok! Xăk xamơk gô kung laa koot manih đơu heq.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Đom tuôôy đnooy athêêk dii Kot-nây, kơy tawaak muut ji hloq 'ngưng dro heq tưưuq anguk hlê. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Katuôôy, kơy đnooy dii oot: “Kadih oh ay xet neq laa varơuq aklơ ganuun vlôh aleq đôôyq dii muuyq manih Jo Thaiq xa athêêk long truh hlơq muuyq dro daak kadrơy, bơh dii gô, Kơy Plêêk heq pato dăt leh taayh muuyq dro laa klơơr 'yêq long leh xarêh. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Vii anưq, atêq tuôôy jah mơơy, gô heq hooy muuyq kach leh duh biit. Anưq, gô đong thăk măk, kakơq kajoq đơu oh ay ăm mơơy gô?” <verse eid="ACT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kot-nây tơơl: “Poot hngơy adroyq, truh wat neq, gô đong xadrook apôôy đom hnhư gô muut wat thưq xiit, yôôych 'yo hơq, muuyq dro dưk kangưưr gô đom qwuân aau ah raliek, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />ji dro nưq đnooy: ‘Kot-nây, apok xadrook apôôy ku ay heq jah tameng ji kaluh varơuq kaxay ku ay heq jah văch truh kangưưr Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Anưq, dayh patăk manih truh Jôp-bê ji mơơy Si-môn, laa manih jah taayh laa Phi-e-rơ. Kơy nưq đong jah tiip đoonq aduq hnhư ku Si-môn, muuyq thơq thuôk kađuh, gah tahli.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Vii anưq, gô hloay jơnưq ăm manih hooy mơơy kơy, kung hloay kơy kung heq dơơp kach hyioh troq tuôôy truh đnen. Lunưq, juneq, dêq hloay 'wot đong măn đnen kangưưr Kơy Plêêk xôq tameng tôôy varơuq heq jah Lôôk padoh pato ka kơy.” <verse eid="ACT 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy luh apok đnooy vlôh, Phi-e-rơ đnooy: “Gamưh tol varơuq dik, gô nhonq xet đaneq Kơy Plêêk be aalq laa Kơy bing kơyq. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Tađôôy muut đnư, đom tôôy khơl tamooy, kơyq kuh yôq Kadraq ji dơơp varơuq hyioh jăk yôôych jah 'yo nhonq đôôyq dii Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Apok kơy plêêk đơu Kadraq heq atăq truh ka manih I-sơ-ra-ên, tuôôy padoh vlôh Hêêl Kaxay truh varơuq hrok hrol gamưh hlê Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu — Kadraq laa Lôôk ku dêq hloay — <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />oh ay heq xet tuôôy kaluh varơuq xalih vlôh ratơh tuôôt loch dêh Ju-đê, pa xarôp aduq Ga-li-lê, atêq pheep bap-tem đơu Jăng heq padoh taboon, <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />truh Jê-xu, Kơy vlôh xing Na-xa-ret, đaleq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq para jơu ka Kadraq bơơn Lôôk Phool Hiel ji taay yaak, laa kơy hooy kađneng kahơ dơơp varơuq kaxay tamaq ji payơh tôôy dro biq kamuuych nhôp, vii Kơy Plêêk măn dii Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />'Wot laa khơl manih dơơp xanưk truh dêq hloay kaluh varơuq đơu Kadraq heq dơơp, tol daak dêh ku manih Jo Thaiq ji măn aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, kung laa Kơy đơu oot heq păk kaxêêt hlơơp bơơn kach kađnok Kadraq tol gay charăk. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp ka Kadraq riirh hlê muut hngơy thưq pe ji khienq Kadraq rama vlôh ro raang, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />leh aalq ăm dêq hloay tôôy dro, bơh ăm khơl dơơp xanưk heq jah Kơy Plêêk rơơlh xing adroyq — nưq laa ăm 'wot, khơl dro heq xa ji hôôch kung dii Kadraq atêq tuôôy Kadraq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Kadraq heq đnooy dăt 'wot padoh taboon ka manih karôp ji dơơp xanưk kach kôk kalh đaneq Kadraq laa Kơy heq jah Kơy Plêêk rơơlh dơơp Kơy xưh xadrah adro riirh hloay adro kaxêêt. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Nưq laa truh Kadraq, dêq hloay khơl kơy hlit dơơp xanưk đaneq atoh kơyq xôq xuum tuôq aduq Kadraq yôôych nhonq xok varơuq ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh gamưh yal Kadraq.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Đom tuôôy Phi-e-rơ măn đong đnooy kaluh apok nưq, yôôych Lôôk Phool Hiel kahri tol tôôy dro đong tameng apok kơy plêêk ku Kơy. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Khơl manih tuôq thuôk nhomq chiuq goch kađuh — nưq laa dêq hloay khơl leq heq hooy achung dii Phi-e-rơ — raay tưng hưng, vii varơuq kahniq ăm Lôôk Phool Hiel kung jah uk pôôt tol tamooy daak kadrơy. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Vii oot tameng khơl manih neq đnooy bơơn kaluh thưq apok đêh ji ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk. Đom tuôôy nưq, Phi-e-rơ luh apok: <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Be aleq kơyq nưq hnoq ik klơl đơ daak xôq khơl manih neq leh jah dơơp bap-tem, nưq laa khơl dro heq nhonq xok Lôôk Phool Hiel kung đaji 'wot?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Anưq yôôch, kơy dăt ka oot chiuq bap-tem đom yal Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. Atêq nưq, oot xiin kơy măn hlê axit hngơy.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl jah rơơlh ji oh ay măn loch dêh Ju-đê tameng đaneq tamooy kadrơy kung heq tuôq nhonq apok ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy Phi-e-rơ hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, khơl dro thuôk bing chiuq goch kađuh tayaat takaay dii kơy, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />đnooy đaneq kơy heq hooy muut aduq khơl dro be goch kađuh ji xa achung dii oot. <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Bơh tuôôy tok apok, Phi-e-rơ padoh hlê ka oot tyauq tưng varơuq đaneq: <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Gô đong xadrook apôôy aduq theng Jôp-bê, ji đom kaplah phoch langoch gô 'yo hloq varơuq ăm xet adroyq truh muuyq vâk tađnưk nưq đong kahri pôôt, dang tômq khanh kôt tuôôy poot muum jah ahlea pôôt xing plêêk ji ni truh kachô gô, <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />đơu tuôôy wih mot 'yo muut đnư, gô 'yo anhinq ji hloq kaluh paroh poot jôôk tol vari, kaluh paroh ôô gôk, kaluh paroh ahnoot, kung kaluh paroh xêêp plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Yôôch gô kung tameng muuyq apok xanoh dii gô: ‘Phi-e-rơ, atêq tuôôy kah, dayh dơơp ôô ji xa yơu!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Bơh gô tơơl: ‘Kuh Lôôk, leh ik 'leq, vii thưq klơơr 'yêq long leh pa xarêh be dong leq hooy muut đom huuy koot.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Lunư, xarooy xing plêêk tơơl hlê đom yưk thưq vaarq, đaneq: ‘Kaluh kajoq Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp xarêh, koot leh ik 'yo laa klơơr 'yêq.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq neq xalih vlôh truh pe yưk, yôôch tôôy thưq jah duuy wiit hlê tok plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Ji 'yo hơq, pe dro khơl kanau hloay jơnưq dưk kangưưr hnhư đơu 'wot đong măn 'lăp, vii heq jah patăk hooy xing Sê-sa-rê truh dii gô. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Tuôôy nưq, Kơy Phool Hiel dăt ka gô hooy dii oot, leh kamưưl ier kajoq. Nưq yôôch, drơu oh ay neq kung hooy dii gô, ji 'wot hooy muut đom hnhư ku dro nưq. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Xatyauq nưq, kơy nưq heq taboon hlê ka 'wot đaleq kơy nưq heq hloq yaak plêêk dưk đom hnhư kơy, xanoh đaneq: ‘Dayh patăk manih truh Jôp-bê ji ăm mơơy Si-môn, manih jah taayh laa Phi-e-rơ, <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />laa manih hnoq đnooy ka ay kaluh apok pato dăt đơu gamưh nưq, ay hnoq jah wơơt — ay ji hloay hnhư ku ay.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Bơh tuôôy gô xarôp đnooy, Lôôk Phool Hiel heq kahri pôôt tol oot kung dang đaji tol haay muut tuôôy kapa tep. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Yôôch gô văch truh apok xanoh ku Lôôk, đaleq Kadraq hmưq đnooy: ‘Jăng heq dơơp bap-tem bơơn daak; bơh oh ay hnoq jah bap-tem bơơn Lôôk Phool Hiel.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Lunưq, atoh Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ăm oot kung muuyq vanong kung đaji ăm haay tuôôy xôq xuum tuôq muut Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, yôôych gô laa kơyq đơu hnoq ik đơ klơl Kơy Plêêk?” <verse eid="ACT 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq tameng taleq apok nưq, oot paq takaay tayaat đơu ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, đnooy đaneq: “Nưq yôôych Kơy Plêêk kung heq kahniq ăm khơl tamooy kadrơy xuum wiit xuum xôq jah varơuq riirh.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Atêq nưq, khơl manih biq pachaay hyaak xing tuôôy rôp toop xalih vlôh atêq ka varơuq Ê-tiên heq pachaay vlôh truh aduq Phê-ni-xi, Chip-rơ ji An-ti-ôt, leh đnooy ka kơyq truh đaauq, vơ đêh vlôh manih Jo Thaiq. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Bơh taleq dro đom sôôq nưq laa taleq dro ưk Chip-rơ ji Si-ren, đơu khơl dro neq tuôôy heq hooy truh An-ti-ôt, oot kung đnooy dii khơl manih Hi Lap, padoh vlôh Hêêl Kaxay truh Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ti ku Lôôk măn kung oot; ji muuyq sôôq thier karôp, vii tuôq, heq wih xuq dii Lôôk. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Tuôôy nưq, hêêl truh khơl manih neq pahêêr truh tôôr tayuup vah măn aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, lunưq oot patăk Ba-na-ba hooy truh aduq An-ti-ôt, <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />đơu atêq tuôôy truh aduq ji 'yo hloq vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk, kơy jah hlah hlaak ji ahmưk nhăk dêq hloay kưq măn đom Lôôk dii varơuq dưk kajưk đom xuum klaak. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Vii kơy laa muuyq dro tolh, viik galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel kung xuum tuôq, ji 'ngưng dro jah athêêp muut ka Lôôk. <verse eid="ACT 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Atêq nưq, kơy hooy truh Tat-sơ xôq axek Sau-lơ. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Tuôôy heq axek hloq, kơy jarooy sau-lơ truh An-ti-ôt. Nưq yôôch, varơuq xalih vlôh đôôyq dii oot pheq đnooy đom hloay muuyq xanưm nưq laa jah tưưuq hlê dii tayuup vah ji pato dayq 'ngưng dro. Katuôôy, yưk adroyq dik aduq An-ti-ôt, khơl xatyauq jah taayh laa Kơ Đôk Nhân.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Tuôôy nưq, đom kaluh hngơy nưq, taleq kơy hlit xing Jê-ru-sa-lem hooy pôôt truh An-ti-ôt. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Nưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy muuyq dro đom sôôq oot, anơng A-ga-but, dưk tok, xing Kơy Phool Hiel, kơy ăm xet đaneq muuyq naanq pangoot kôt jeq xalih truh tol loch dêh araak. Varơuq neq heq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy Kơ-lôt. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Nưq laa đom khơl xatyauq, tôôy dro đom sôôq nưq, atoh kơyq e paraat măn kơh leq, oot heq đinq deng vlôh phon waak xôq atăq ka oh ay riirh aduq Ju-đê, <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />đơu oot dik heq dơơp đanưq, tuôôy ăm xagook truh khơl kadraq lơơk gamưh ti ku Ba-na-ba ji Sau-lơ.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Tuôôy nưq, muut kawat nưq, vuua Hê-rôt vlôh ti dơơp ra ơơh muuyq sôôq manih đom tayuup vah. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy nưq păk kaxêêt Ja-kơ, ay ku Jăng, bơơn xieh. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy hloq đaneq varơuq neq laa varơuq nhăp iq đôôyq dii manih Jo Thaiq, kơy nưq kung laay hooy truh rôp jư Phi-e-rơ (đơu kaluh varơuq nưq xalih vlôh muut kaluh hngơy ku tuôôy lêh Tôôp Leh Tape), <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />ji atêq tuôôy rôp jư phi-e-rơ, kơy nưq heq ăm xagook muut karuk, phon ahlook poot bing kuun jư 'yo kơy, xung đinq hoot kơy vlôh kangưưr manih karôp atêq Lêh Dalơh Hlê. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Nưq laa, long Phi-e-rơ đong biq karuk đom tu, bơh varơuq xadrook apôôy yôôych măn jah dưk dơơp muuyq kach dêq xuum wih truh Kơy Plêêk deng ka kơy xing tayuup vah. <verse eid="ACT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Tuôôy nưq, muut tuôôy Hê-rôt xarôp xagook kơy vlôh xadrah, jơq klôôy nưq, Phi-e-rơ đong vik katul vaarq dro kuun, biq kal bơơn vaarq raq looy tooy, katuôôy khơl kuun jư pi adroyq 'mok đong jư 'yo tu. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />'Yo hơq, muuyq kơy hơu ku Lôôk truh dưk gah kơy, xaraar tađnah jaraak ahnhe đom phong karuk. Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy pah muut katêêk Phi-e-rơ, viq kơy hơu nhơk kah kơy, dăt: “Dayh kah yơu,” ji kaluh talơy looy tooy kơy rôh vlôh klơlh ti. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Tuôôy nưq, Kơy hơu đnooy dii kơy: “Dayh kadih hnek katêêk ji troaq kaxôôp ku ay muut.” Nưq yôôch, kơy dơơp dang đanưq. Kơy yaak plêêk kung đnooy dii kơy: “Dayh hlưp aau pi gôk ku ay muut ji tyauq gô.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Atêq tuôôy vlôh pi gôk, kơy tyauq kơy nưq đơu kơy heq be xet đaneq varơuq đong jah dưk dơơp xing kơy hơu laa dik bơh kơy 'miêh biit laa đong hloq muuyq varơuq ăm xet adroyq. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Tuôôy heq dalơh hlê bing kuun jư thưq muuyq ji thưq vaarq, oot hooy truh kahlăk 'măk 'mok bơơn maam jarooy muut theng, đơu ni kadih luh vlôh ka oot. Atêq tuôôy vlôh pi gôk, oot hooy aloh muuyq trôôk ji kơy hơu nhăp vơ chuh klơlh kơy. <verse eid="ACT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Tuôôy kadih xăk heq văch hlê, Phi-e-rơ đnooy: “Dong dik, juneq gô đơơu xet đaneq Lôôk heq patăk kơy hơu Kadraq ji wơơt gô klơlh ti Hê-rôt, kung tôôy takôô ku manih Jo Thaiq.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Katuôôy, tuôôy heq hlolh đanưq, kơy hooy truh hnhư Ma-ri, miq ku Jăng, jah taayh laa Mak, đơu aduq neq e 'ngưng khơl tuôq jah tưưuq hlê ji đong xadrook apôôy. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy kơy ahngoq 'mok ngo, muuyq xapok kadrê, anơng Rô-đơ, tawaak hlê jeq xôq tơơl apok. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Atêq tuôôy nhonq vlôh xarooy ku Phi-e-rơ, đơu vii hlah hlaak, mư heq leh luh 'mok, bơh wih charơơk muut 'lăp, mư pahêêr đaneq: “Phi-e-rơ đong dưk kangưưr 'mok.” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Lunư, oot đnooy dii mư: “Mư đong vlôh rapơ.” Bơh mư kưq chăk chănq varơuq xalih vlôh đanưq. Lunưq, oot đnooy: “Nưq laa kơy hơu ku kơy nưq.” <verse eid="ACT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Wih hlê, Phi-e-rơ ahngoq đnoyq, ji atêq tuôôy luh vlôh, oot 'yo hloq kơy ji xok dơơp akêh. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq vlôh hlêêl bơơn ti ka oot hnhep, kơy padoh bơơn kach leq đơu Lôôk heq jarooy kơy vlôh klơlh tu. Katuôôy, kơy dăt: “Dayh taboon hlê kaluh varơuq neq ka Ja-kơ ji ka khơl oh ay.” Yôôch tawaak vlôh pi gôk, kơy hooy truh muuyq aduq kadrơy. <verse eid="ACT 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq xaroq, e varơuq tarok 'nhih leh de đom bơy bing kuun vii varơuq heq xalih vlôh ka Phi-e-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Măn Hê-rôt, tuôôy heq ăm arơơk aruôh axek manih đơu leh hloq, tuôôy tra vôôch yôôch bing kuun jư, kơy nưq patăk ăm păk kaxêêt oot. Ji atêq tuôôy hooy xing Ju-đê aloh truh Sê-sa-rê, kơy nưq măn hlê ka đnư.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy nưq đong măn jaraq tamooy Ti-rơ ji tamooy Si-đôn. Nưq yôôch, oot kung mamuuyq hooy truh tavơh kơy nưq, ji tuôôy heq xok xuum Ba-la-tut, laa padrok jư 'yo ku vuua, oot athêêk tagu vii dêh oot jah xok tuôông xa xing dêh ku vuua. <verse eid="ACT 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Tuôôy nưq, muut hngơy heq đinq, atêq tuôôy hlưp aau vuua ji 'ngôôy tol ngaai, Hê-rôt đnooy vlôh kangưưr oot. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Tuôôy nưq, manih karôp taayh kôt: “Nưq laa apok ku muuyq kơy yaak, leh aalq ku koot manih!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Yôôch hloay jơnưq, muuyq kơy hơu ku Lôôk dook kơy nưq bơyh vii kơy nưq leh tơơk varơuq tađnah tađnaak ka Kơy Plêêk, ji atêq tuôôy biq hraay xa, yôôych kơy nưq kloh hơơy.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Măn apok ku Kơy Plêêk kưq lơy ranưh ji jah athêêp 'ngưng.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Xatyauq nưq, Ba-na-ba ji Sau-lơ wiit xuq truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, tuôôy heq payôôch kaluh varơuq hơu dơơp ku oot, jarooy xatyauq Jăng kung hooy, adro jah taayh laa Mak.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Tuôôy nưq, măn đom Tayuup Vah aduq An-ti-ôt, e khơl hnhư hlit ji thơy pato: Ba-na-ba, Si-mê-ôn jah taayh laa Ni-jê, Lu-si-ut manih Si-ren; Ma-na-hem, ma oh văch ku vuua chư hơu Hê-rôt, ji Sau-lơ. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Tuôôy nưq, đong tuôôy oot ayuôôt laat Lôôk ji deek xa, yôôych Lôôk Phool Hiel xanoh: “Pheq xôq đêh Ba-na-ba ji Sau-lơ vlôh ka Gô, vii kaluh varơuq đơu Gô heq tawooyh taayh oot.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Kơq nưq, atêq tuôôy deek xa, xadrook apôôy ji xôq ti tol vaarq dro nưq, oot xôq ăm hooy.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Anưq, atêq tuôôy jah patăk hooy xing Kơy Phool Hiel vaarq adro pôôt truh Sê-lơ-xi; ji xing nưq oot hooy ge truh Chip-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Tuôôy heq truh aduq Sa-la-min, oot padoh taboon apok ku Kơy Plêêk đom kaluh hnhư hơu ku manih Jo Thaiq. Tuôôy nưq, oot kung e Jăng đaji muuyq dro waak varơuq. <verse eid="ACT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Xatyauq nưq, atêq tuôôy tapa hlê kaluh ngok tahli truh aduq Ba-phô, oot tavơh muuyq dro nưq, muuyq thơy pajơơu, kơy hlit pa ôôh manih Jo Thaiq, anơng ni laa Ba-jê-su, <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />đơu adro neq măn dii padrok thôngq đôk Sê-jut Phau-lut — muuyq dro hlolh xet. Tuôôy heq ăm mơơy Ba-na-ba ji Sau-lơ, padrok axek hlolh xôq tameng apok ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Bơh “thơy pajơơu” Ê-li-ma (vii anơng ni jah jich vlôh luneq), tachơơl oot, axek kach wih padrok thôngq đôk klơlh xuum tuôq. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Măn Sau-lơ, kung taayh laa Phao-lô, jah viik galaay Lôôk Phool Hiel, tuôôy 'yo atrêêk muut ni, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />ji đnooy: “Ne dro viik galaay tôôy varơuq aluut pa ôôh ji đu thưq xơk xơuq, koot ku kamuuych, adro tachơơl ku tôôy varơuq hyioh jăk, kơy hnoq be padơy đnooy pahyaak trôôk hooy hyioh jăk ku Lôôk ư? <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Tuôôy nưq, dayh 'yo yơu, ti ku Lôôk tachơơl dii kơy ji kơy hnoq biq apul, leh 'yo hloq mot hngơy đom muuyq kawat.” Nưq laa, hloay jơnưq, varơuq kamơng jaluk ju hwek apôôt tol ni, ji ni rawiit hooy rawiit hlê axek manih rôp ti jarooy ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq dưk xanưk varơuq vơơ xalih vlôh, padrok thôngq đôk tuôq, vii biq akêh kangưưr pato dayq ku Lôôk.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy pôôt ge xing Ba-phô, khơl dro dưk hooy kung Phao-lô hooy truh Bet-jê thuôk Bam-phi-li. Bơh vii wih luuy klơlh oot, Jăng wiit xuq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Măn oot, atêq tuôôy chuh klơlh Bet-jê, yôôych hooy truh An-ti-ôt thuôk Bi-si-đi, ji tuôôy heq hooy muut hnhư hơu đom hngơy Sa-bat, oot 'ngôôy jưq. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Atêq varơuq đok rahlăp ganuun ji kaluh rahlăp hlit, khơl jư 'yo hnhư hơu patăk manih truh dii oot, đnooy đaneq: “Wơơy oh ay, khơl dro oh ay, atoh apok lôôk ahmưk nhăk leq deng ka manih karôp măn aduq oh ay, yôôych xiin dayh đnooy vlôh.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Nưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy dưk tok ji awoyh ti vlôh hlêêl, Phao-lô đnooy:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Wơơy oh ay, khơl manih I-sơ-ra-ên ji khơl leq kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk, xiin dayh tameng. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Kơy Plêêk ku tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên neq heq rơơlh mo kơy haay, khienq oot karoh e đom kawat kaplah măn hlê tol vari Ai Kâp, ji bơơn pla ti tơơk yơơt, Kadraq jarooy oot vlôh klơlh đnư. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />Đom kawah kawat poot kưl xanưm Kadraq chiuq uunq oot aduq wăngq we. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Ji atêq tuôôy păk kaxêêt dêq pơh adrơơk tamooy đom dêh Ka-na-an, Kadraq kahniq dêh ku oot ăm oot dơơp kơ ngiip, <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />đom kawah poot hreek dăp kưl xanưm. Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Kadraq heq kahniq ka oot kaluh padrok xadrah ăm truh tuôôy kơy hlit Sa-mu-ên. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Xing tuôôy nưq kơn hơ, manih karôp apôôy vôôch muuyq vuua, ji Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ka oot Sau-lơ, koot kanau ku Kich, muuyq dro thuôk adrơơk Bên-ja-min, đom poot kưl xanưm. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Ji tuôôy heq ka'lăk kơy nưq, Kadraq xôq Đa-vik tok dơơp vuua ka oot, đơu tuôôy dơơp xanưk truh kơy, Kadraq kung xanoh: ‘Gô heq axek hloq Đa-vik, koot kanau Je-sê, muuyq dro tyauq xuum Gô, laa dro hnoq dơơp tôôy iq trôôch ku Gô.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Xing adrơơk ku vuua neq, tyauq đaji apok tavek, Kơy Plêêk heq xagook truh ka I-sơ-ra-ên muuyq Kơy Wơơt Dêh, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />tuôôy Jăng heq padoh pato adroyq nưq muuyq pheep bap-tem truh varơuq wiit xuum ka dêq hloay tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên, adroyq varơuq rama vlôh ku Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy Jăng đong payôôch varơuq dơơp kơy, kơy đnooy: ‘Oh ay biit gô laa kơyq? Be aalq laa gô 'leq. Lunư, dayh 'yo yuh, Kơy đong truh atêq gô, laa Kơy đơu gô leh taxưngq xôq tơq kaxôôp aduq jôôk Kadraq.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Wơơy oh ay, wơơy oh ay, laa koot xau thuôk adrơơk Ap-ra-ham ji khơl dro kuh yôq Kơy Plêêk katul đom oh ay, apok ku varơuq wơơt xok neq heq jah atăq truh ka haay. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Vii khơl dro riirh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem ji khơl padrok adrơk qwuyen ku oot leh 'yo xet Kơy nưq, lunưq oot heq dơơp jah jêêk kaluh apok ku khơl hnhư hlit măn jah đok tôôy hngơy Sa-bat, tuôôy rôp kadrôôp Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Long be axek hloq muuyq liq jo leq ka pheq kaxêêt, bơh oot heq kưq xiin Phi-lat khienq Kadraq biq păk kaxêêt. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy oot heq dơơp xaleep tôôy varơuq jah valơk truh Kadraq, yôôych atêq tuôôy xagook pôôt klơlh gay charăk, oot amik Kadraq đom muuyq mô xanưng. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Bơh Kơy Plêêk heq khienq Kadraq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />đơu Kadraq heq jah 'yo hloq đom 'ngưng hngơy xing khơl manih hooy tok kung dii Kadraq xing Ga-li-lê truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, khơl dro nưq juneq laa dro dơơp xanưk ku Kadraq kangưưr manih karôp. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />'Wot đong padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ka oh ay, laa apok tavek heq truh dii mo kơy ku haay, <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />đaneq Kơy Plêêk heq payôôch xaleep varơuq nưq ka khơl koot xau ku haay, tuôôy khienq Lôôk Jê-xu riirh hlê. Kung đaji varơuq heq jah valơk đom Thi Thiên thưq vaarq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Koot laa Koot Gô, hngơy neng Gô heq pahleh Koot.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Mot kadrơy, bơyh kơq Kadraq heq khienq Kơy nưq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt, hnoq leh măn wiit xuq dii varơuq oop hruh đnoyq, lunưq Kadraq đnooy đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Gô hnoq kahniq ka Koot kaluh vanong vah ku Đa-vik, nưq laa kaluh vanong kaxay kajưk dik.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Kung vii anưq, Kadraq xanoh đom muuyq Thi Thiên kadrơy, đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Kadraq hnoq leh xôq ka Kơy Vah Kadraq hloq varơuq oop hruh.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />E varơuq, đôôyq dii Đa-vik đom tuôôy đơơy ku kadih kơy, atêq tuôôy dơơp tyauq iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk, yôôych kơy heq vik, jah up kung mo kơy kơy, ji heq hloq varơuq oop hruh. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Bơh Kơy đơu Kơy Plêêk heq khienq riirh hlê yôôych leh hloq varơuq oop hruh.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />Lunưq, wơơy oh ay, wơơy oh ay, varơuq neq pheq laa varơuq hlolh xet đôôyq dii oh ay, đaneq gamưh Kơy nưq, varơuq ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh jah đnooy vlôh ka oh ay ji klơlh tôôy varơuq đơu bơyh oot, oh ay heq leh e paraat jah xưng hyioh jăk tyauq ganuun Môi-se. <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />Đom Kơy nưq, tôôy dro tuôq yôôych jah xưng hyioh jăk. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Anưq, dayh 'yo rơơt, leh kheoq varơuq heq jah đnooy đom kaluh rahlăp kơy hlit hnoq ik xalih truh ka oh ay:<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />‘Khơl katơơk galơh leh ra kajoq hơq, dayh 'yo yơu, yôôch varaal yôq ji biq păk kaxêêt dơyh!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Vii Gô đong dơơp muuyq varơuq đom katuôôy êêp,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">muuyq varơuq đơu êêp chăk chănq leh tuôq, long tabơh kơyq nưq taboon hlê ka êêp.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Tuôôy nưq, đong tuôôy vaarq dro chuh hooy, tamooy karôp apôôy vôôch xôq jah padoh ka oot kaluh apok nưq muut hngơy Sa-bat truh neq. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy buôyh nhomq anguk heq yôôch, 'ngưng manih Jo Thaiq ji khơl dro dêq xuum tyauq trôôk Jo Thaiq heq hooy tyauq Phao-lô ji Ba-na-ba, tuôôy vaarq dro đnooy athêêk dii oot, yôôych ahmưk nhăk oot kưq dơơp đnoyq đom vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Nưq yôôch, muut hngơy Sa-bat xatyauq nưq, dang đaji dêq theng tưưuq hlê xôq tameng apok ku Lôôk. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Bơh tuôôy 'yo hloq manih karôp, khơl manih Jo Thaiq viik xuum 'yarơ, ji tachơơl hlê kaluh varơuq jah đnooy xing Phao-lô, bơơn kach đnooy ra ơơh kơy. <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Tơơl hlê kach kôk kalh, hloay Phao-lô ji Ba-na-ba heq đnooy đaneq: “Varơuq duh dik laa apok ku Kơy Plêêk pheq jah padoh ka êêp kơy adroyq dik. Vii nhonq vlôh đaneq êêp kơy chôôyq ka'lăk apok neq ji kadih 'yo xăk leh taxưngq dii varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy, lunưq dayh 'yo yơu, 'wot đong wih hlê kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Vii Lôôk heq xanoh pato ka 'wot đaneq:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">‘Gô heq xôq koot đaji xaraar tađnah ka khơl tamooy daak kadrơy,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">xôq koot riirh ka varơuq wơơt xok truh aduq lôôch dik play vari.’”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tameng anưq, kaluh manih daak kadrơy hlah hlaak ji vado apok ku Lôôk, ji dêq hloay khơl leq heq jah đinq ka varơuq riirh đơơy đơơy yôôych raay tuôq. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Nưq yôôch, apok ku Lôôk jah padoh vlôh loch dêq dêh. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Bơh manih Jo Thaiq ahluk khơl mư kadrê xiaq đaauq thuôk khơl karoh e kung khơl dro dơơp kôt đom theng, yôôch muuyq đơơt rôp toop dưk tok tachơơl hlê Phao-lô ji Ba-na-ba, oot đuôôy vaarq dro vlôh klơlh ka duq theng ku oot. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy tapolh thul aduq jôôk xôq tachơơl oot, vaarq dro hooy truh I-kô-ni. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Măn khơl xatyauq jah viik galaay varơuq hlah hlaak ji Lôôk Phool Hiel.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh aduq I-kô-ni nưq laa kung dii mamuuyq oot hooy muut đom hnhư tagumq ku manih Jo Thaiq ji pato dayq dang đanưq pheq đnooy thier 'ngưng manih, dêq Jo Thaiq hloay Hi Lap, heq tuôq. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Bơh khơl manih Jo Thaiq lưp tuôq heq ahluk ji khienq xuum biit khơl manih tamooy kadrơy 'yarơ tachơơl hlê khơl oh ay. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Jo anưq, oot măn hlê đnư muuyq kawat yơơt, pato dayq kach kôk kalh truh Lôôk, laa Kơy dưk xanưk ka apok ku vanong plêêk Kadraq bơơn kach dơơp ka kaluh hlêêl akêh ji varơuq akêh xalih vlôh gamưh hlê ti oot. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Bơh tamooy đom theng biq aklah vlôh, ji muuyq sôôq yôôych tyauq manih Jo Thaiq, măn sôôq kadrơy tyauq khơl jah rơơlh. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Lunư, đom tuôôy xôq vih rôp toop ku dêq hloay khơl manih daak kadrơy ji manih Jo Thaiq, kung khơl dưk xanok ku oot, jah vlôh jêêk xôq dơơp ra ơơh ji tiip phơu oot, <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />yôôych atêq tuôôy xet varơuq nưq, oot du naanq hlê kaluh theng Li-kao-ni, Lit-trơ, Đet-bơ, ji dêh gah gih, <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />yôôch măn đnư, oot dơơp đnoyq padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Aduq Lit-trơ, muuyq dro atul tâk nưq đong 'ngôôy, dii vaarq jôôk taqwauq talêêt xing tuôôy măn đom klaak miq ni, đơu ay nưq koq hmưq tawaak hooy. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Ay neq tameng Phao-lô padoh, đơu kơy tuôôy 'yo atrêêk muut ay yôôych hloq đaneq ay neq e xuum tuôq xôq jah payơh. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Kơy đnooy kôt apok đaneq: “Dayh dưk hyioh tok tol jôôk ku ay”, yôôch ay kaplok tok ji tawaak hooy. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Katuôôy, tuôôy manih karôp 'yo hloq varơuq đơu Phao-lô heq dơơp, oot atok apok tok, đnooy bơơn apok Li-kao-ni ku oot, đaneq: “Kaluh yaak, hlưp xok xăk xamơk koot manih, heq hooy pôôt dii haay.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Oot kung taayh Ba-na-ba laa “yaak Jơơt,” măn Phao-lô laa “yaak Hek-mê,” vii kơy laa dro đnooy vlôh đaauq. <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Kung tuôôy nưq, thơy dok dơơp ku yaak Jơơt, laa para măn pi adroyq theng, atêq tuôôy xagook ôô bo ji vong raak truh 'mok, kơy nưq đinq tơơk tưp lêh kung dii manih karôp. <verse eid="ACT 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Bơh tuôôy tameng anưq, yôôych khơl jah rơơlh, nưq laa Ba-na-ba ji Phao-lô, atêq tuôôy heq chieh aau oot, oot kathôp hloay muut manih karôp, pariau kôt <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />ji đnooy: “Tôôy dro lơơy, aleq oh ay dơơp kaluh varơuq neq? 'Wot kung laa khơl manih kung dang xăk đaji oh ay, đong padoh Hêêl Kaxay ka oh ay, xôq wih oh ay klơlh taleq varơuq lưp e it neq xôq wih truh Kơy Plêêk hloay riirh, Kơy panưk jêêk plêêk, vari ji tahli, kung tôôy paroh đom nưq, <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />laa Kơy đơu đom kaluh đơơy heq dalơh hlê, heq xôq ăm dêq hloay kaluh tamooy tawaak hooy tyauq trôôk đêh ku oot, <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />bơh long anưq, Kadraq heq leh xôq ăm thiuq xanưk nưq truh kadih Kadraq, tuôôy măn dơơp vanong kaxay ka oh ay, bơơn kach kahniq jit xing plêêk kung muua xiêk raak play, khienq xuum oh ay phiq phơh dii tuôông xa ji hlah hlaak.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Ji tuôôy heq đnooy kaluh varơuq neq, oot vơ đu jư ik manih karôp leh tơơk tưp kuah lêh ka oot.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Nưq bơh, khơl manih Jo Thaiq heq truh xing An-ti-ôt ji I-kô-ni, atêq tuôôy heq ahluk manih karôp yôôch tiip phơu Phao-lô, oot ahoot kơy vlôh pi gôk theng, vii biit kơy heq kaxêêt. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Lunư, tuôôy khơl xatyauq dưk rawiit kơy, yôôych atêq tuôôy dưk tok, kơy hooy muut đom theng, yôôch hngơy atêq, kơy hooy kung Ba-na-ba truh Đet-bơ. <verse eid="ACT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Katuôôy, tuôôy heq padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay aduq theng nưq ji waak 'ngưng dro vlôh jêêk khơl xatyauq, oot wiit xuq aduq Lit-trơ, yôôch truh I-kô-ni, ji An-ti-ôt, <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />dơơp đnoyq dơơp ăm kajưk xuum khơl xatyauq, ahmưk nhăk oot kajưk đom xuum tuôq, đaneq: “Tavơh 'ngưng varơuq pơơl hwơơl laa varơuq duh dik ka haay xôq muut đom daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy paja dơơp khơl kadraq lơơk ka oot aduq tôôy Tayuup Vah, tuôôy heq xadrook apôôy kung dii varơuq deek xa, vaarq dro atăq panhăp khơl manih nưq ka Lôôk, laa Kơy đơu oot heq xôq xuum tuôq truh. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Ji atêq tuôôy dalơh hlê Bi-si-đi, oot hooy truh Bam-phi-li. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Tuôôy padoh đaauq aduq Bet-jê yôôch, oot hooy pôôt truh At-ta-li. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Xing aduq nưq, oot hooy ge truh An-ti-ôt, laa aduq oot heq jah ăm panhăp muut vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk ka kaluh varơuq đơu oot heq payôôch. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq truh aduq ji nhomq tagumq Tayuup Vah hlê, oot padoh taboon xet taleq varơuq Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp kung dii oot ji đaneq Kadraq heq luh 'mok xuum tuôq ka khơl tamooy daak kadrơy. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Xatyauq nưq, oot măn hlê dii khơl xatyauq muuyq kawat leh lêq.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Yôôch, muuyq sôôq manih hơq hooy pôôt xing Ju-đê, pato khơl oh ay đaneq: “Atoh oh ay leh chiuq goch kađuh tyauq ganuun ku Môi-se, yôôych oh ay leh ik jah wơơt.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Nưq laa, atêq tuôôy xalih vlôh varơuq lưp tagu ji takaay tayaat leh de katul Phao-lô ji Ba-na-ba kung dii khơl dro hơq, lunưq khơl oh ay dăt Phao-lô ji Ba-na-ba kung muuyq sôôq manih kadrơy katul đom oot xôq hooy tok tavơh khơl jah rơơlh ji kadraq lơơk aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem truh tayaat neq. <verse eid="ACT 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Anưq, khơl manih jah tayuup vah patăk hooy dalơh hlê kaah Phê-ni-xi hloay Sa-ma-ri, đnooy taboon hlolh varơuq wiit xuq tuôq đaauq ku khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, ji oot heq taway hlê hlah hlaak kôt ka dêq hloay khơl oh ay. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq truh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, oot jah vôôch hrok xing tayuup vah, khơl jah rơơlh ji khơl kadraq lơơk, katuôôy oot padoh hlê xet taleq varơuq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq kung dơơp dii oot. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Bơh taleq dro heq tuôq hơq thuôk bing Pha-ri-si dưk tok, đnooy đaneq: “Duh pheq dơơp pheep goch kađuh ka khơl dro nưq ji pato dayq oot pheq jư ganuun Môi-se.” <verse eid="ACT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Nưq laa, khơl jah rơơlh ji khơl kadraq lơơk tagumq hlê xôq 'yo hlê truh dong varơuq neq. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy 'ngưng tagêh xalih vlôh, Phi-e-rơ, dưk tok, đnooy dii oot:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:7">“Wơơy oh ay, wơơy oh ay, oh ay raay xet đaneq xing kaluh hngơy patep katul đom oh ay, Kơy Plêêk heq rơơlh kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy gamưh hlê vel huuy gô xôq tameng đaauq Hêêl Kaxay ji tuôq. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Kơy Plêêk, Kơy xet xuum klaak, heq dơơp xanưk ka oot, tuôôy kahniq Lôôk Phool Hiel ka oot, kung đaji ăm haay; <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />ji Kadraq leh aklah đêh katul haay dii oot, tuôôy khienq xuum oot jah pa xarêh bơyh xuum tuôq. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Nưq yôôych aleq juneq oh ay thưh Kơy Plêêk, tuôôy vâk muut ranong khơl jah rơơlh poop varaq đơu khơl mo kơy haay leh ik, ji haay kung leh e paraat xôq pơq? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Wih hlê, haay tuôq xôq jah wơơt xing vanong plêêk ku Lôôk Jê-xu, đơu oot kung tyauq muuyq kach đanưq.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Tuôôy nưq, dêq manih karôp jư hnhep ji tameng Ba-na-ba ji Phao-lô taboon hlê xet taleq dơuq akêh ji varơuq akêh Kơy Plêêk heq dưk dơơp katul đom khơl tamooy daak kadrơy gamưh oot. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Nưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy oot đnooy yôôch, Ja-kơ tơơl apok, đaneq: “Wơơy oh ay, wơơy oh ay, xiin dayh tameng gô. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Si-môn heq pato vlôh đaleq Kơy Plêêk adroyq dik heq angơuq 'yo xôq xok vlôh xing kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy muuyq tamooy ka yal Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Varơuq neq kung tamuut dii taleq apok ku khơl hnhư hlit đaji heq jah valơk:<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />‘Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, Gô hnoq wiit hlê,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">yôôch Gô hnoq panưk hlê raap ku Đa-vik, laa raap heq biq hrưp pôôt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Gô hnoq panưk hlê kaluh thưq biq hrưp pôôt ku ni ji 'meq hlê ni,<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />xôq ka phon măn hlê ku koot manih bơh dik hnoq ik axek akhiim Lôôk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">hloay kaah dêq hloay kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy, đơu tol kaluh tamooy nưq, yal Gô jah taayh apôôy măn aduq oot.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">Lôôk xanoh anưq, tuôôy dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq neq, <verse eid="ACT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />laa varơuq jah xet truh xing tuôôy hnu hmeq.’<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Vii nưq, gô 'yo hloq đaneq te dơơp xôôl dôôl ka khơl manih xing khơl tamooy daak kadrơy wiit hlê dii Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />lunư, duh valơk thư pato dăt oot chuh xangưưy varơuq klơơr 'yêq ku dang vangưl, varơuq apuq atrăp, hlek ôq kaxêêt phoch ji vahaap. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Vii xing kaluh tuôôy đơơy hnu hmeq, aduq tôôy theng, ganuun Môi-se măn ragơy e 'ngưng dro padoh taboon ganuun nưq, gamưh jah đok đom hnhư hơu muut tôôy hngơy Sa-bat.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Atêq nưq, khơl jah rơơlh ji khơl draq lơơk, kung hloay tayuup vah, hloq duh patăk khơl dro jah rơơlh katul đom oot hooy truh An-ti-ôt achung dii Phao-lô ji Ba-na-ba — e Ju-đa jah taayh laa Ba-sa-ba, ji Si-la, nưq laa khơl manih dơơp ưk đom khơl oh ay — <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />tuôôy valơk thư xagook hooy gamưh ti oot: “Khơl jah rơơlh ji khơl kơy draq lơơk, khơl oh ay, atăq ka khơl tuôq Lôôk loch dêh An-ti-ôt, Si-ri ji Si-li-si, nưq laa ăm oh ay, khơl manih vlôh xing khơl tamooy daak kadrơy. Dong dik kuh hlơq! <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Vii tuôôy neq, 'wot heq tameng đaneq taleq dro nưq tuôôy hooy vlôh xing katul 'wot heq ahluk oh ay bơơn kaluh apok đnooy dơơp loanq xuum oh ay, đơu khơl manih nưq yôôych 'wot be ăm qwuyen kajoq, <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />lunưq varơuq e veeh tolh dik ka 'wot laa atêq tuôôy heq muuyq xuum, rơơlh xok taleq dro, yôôych patăk oot hooy truh oh ay kung dii Ba-na-ba ji Phao-lô, vaarq oh ay xung xiaq ku haay, <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />laa vaarq dro heq hôôk kaxêêt xăk riirh baarq vii yal Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Jo nưq, 'wot heq dăt Ju-đa ji Si-la, laa khơl dro kung padoh taboon dong varơuq neq bơơn apok đnooy. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Vii kajưk đaneq Lôôk Phool Hiel ji 'wot heq hloq be e athêêp varơuq kajoq jah xôq dơơp pơq parêq tol oh ay đêh vlôh kaluh varơuq duh dik atêq neq: <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />pheq chuh xangưưy kaluh thưq đơơp ka dang vangưl, vahaap, kaluh ôô kaxêêt phoch, ji varơuq apuq atrăp, oh ay hnoq dơơp tolh, tuôôy jư kadih xăk klơlh kaluh varơuq nưq. Kuh oh ay jah kajưk kalh.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Nưq laa, atêq tuôôy jah patăk hooy, oot hooy pôôt truh An-ti-ôt, ji tuôôy anguk tayuup vah hlê yôôch, oot palo hla thư ăm. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy đok thư yôôch, khơl tuôq jah hlah hlaak adroyq varơuq ahmưk nhăk nưq. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Kaah Ju-đa hloay Si-la, kadih oot kung laa khơl hlit, heq ahmưk nhăk khơl oh ay bơơn muuyq apok yơơt ji khienq oot kalh paraat. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy măn đnư muuyq kawat, oot jah khơl oh ay jarooy xuq dii khơl dro heq patăk dăt oot kach hrok hrol. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />[Bơh Si-la hloq duh pheq măn hlê kung oot, lunưq Ju-đa heq dưk hooy muuyq dro.] <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Măn Phao-lô ji Ba-na-ba măn đnoyq aduq An-ti-ôt, pato dayq ji đnooy vlôh apok Lôôk, kung dii 'ngưng dro kadrơy.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Xatyauq nưq, atêq muuyq sôôq hngơy nhăk đinq, Phao-lô đnooy dii Ba-na-ba: “Dik, haay duh truh hlơq khơl oh ay, tuôôy wiit hlê aduq tôôy theng đơu măn đnư, haay heq padoh taboon apok Lôôk, 'yo oot đong đaleq.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Bơh Ba-na-ba kung xung jarooy Jăng, jah taayh laa Mak, kung hooy. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />Măn Phao-lô hloq leh đangq xôq jarooy nhu nưq kung hooy, nưq laa dro heq ka'lăk hooy klơlh oot tuôôy xing Bam-phi-li ji leh dưk dơơp dii oot đom kaluh varơuq. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq đơơt tayaat takaay kôt xalih vlôh, pheq đnooy oot biq aklah vlôh dii mamuuyq, katuôôy Ba-na-ba jarooy Mak tyauq kơy hooy ge truh Chip-rơ. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Măn Phao-lô, tuôôy heq rơơlh Si-la, yôôych dưk hooy, atêq tuôôy jah khơl oh ay pahnăp muut vanong plêêk ku Lôôk. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Nưq yôôch, kơy hooy loch Si-ri ji Si-li-si, dơơp kalh paraat kaluh tayuup vah.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy kung hooy pôôt truh Đet-bơ yôôch truh Lit-trơ, ji 'yo hơq, aduq nưq e muuyq khơl xatyauq hơq anơng Ti-mô-thê, koot kanau ku muuyq mư kadrê Jo Thaiq tuôq kuh, bơh vaq laa manih Hi Lap, <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />đơu nhu nưq jah xanưk tolh xing khơl oh ay aduq Lit-trơ ji I-kô-ni. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Phao-lô xung nhu neq vlôh hooy dii kơy, lunưq atêq tuôôy nhonq nhu, kơy dơơp pheep goch kađuh ka nhu, vii it lơơy ku manih Jo Thaiq đong măn đnư kaluh aduq nưq, vii oot raay xet đaneq vaq ku nhu laa manih Hi Lap. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy oot hooy trôôk hlê kaluh theng, oot đnooy hlê ka khơl tuôq pheq jư kaluh ganuun heq jah đinq xing khơl jah rơơlh ji khơl kadraq lơơk aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Anưq, kaluh tayuup vah jah kalh paraat đom xuum tuôq ji tôôy hngơy raay jah athêêp tok sôôq manih.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Tuôôy nưq, oot hooy dalơh hlê kaluh dêh thuôk Phi-ri-gi ji Ga-la-ti, vii heq biq Lôôk Phool Hiel klơl jư padoh apok Lôôk đom dêh A-si. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy heq truh jeq Mi-si-a, oot raanq hooy muut Bi-thi-ni, đơu Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk Jê-xu kung leh ăm pheep oot. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Nưq laa, ka'lăk hlê Mi-si-a, oot hooy pôôt truh Trô-ach. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Muuyq varơuq ăm xet adroyq rama vlôh dii Phao-lô đom klôôy: muuyq dro Ma-xê-đoan nưq đong dưk ji taayh kơy, đaneq: “Atêq tuôôy dalơh hlê truh Ma-xê-đoan, xiin dayh waak 'wot.” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Nưq laa, hloay tuôôy kơy heq hloq varơuq ăm xet adroyq nưq, 'wot vơơ hloay axek kach hooy truh Ma-xê-đoan, vii tuôq kajưk đaneq Kơy Plêêk heq tawooyh taayh 'wot padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay ka oot.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Jo nưq, tuôôy heq pôôt ge xing Trô-ach, 'wot hooy hyioh truh Sa-mô-tra-xơ, yôôch hngơy atêq truh Nê-a-bô-li, <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />xing nư, truh Phi-lip, đơu neq laa theng phôq duh dik nhưk đom dêh Ma-xê-đoan, muuyq dêh vari ku La Mah, yôôch 'wot kưq măn aduq theng phôq neq taleq hngơy. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Katuôôy, muut hngơy Sa-bat, 'wot vlôh pi gôk 'mok theng, pi gah tavook daak, aduq đơu 'wot biit laa aduq xadrook apôôy. Yôôch atêq tuôôy 'ngôôy pôôt, 'wot tajauq athêêk dii khơl mư kadrê đong tưưuq hlê aduq đnư. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Muuyq mư kadrê nưq anơng Li-đi, laa dro tabôôt tek vaayh tôô xing theng Thi-a-ti-rơ, vii e xuum kul yôq Kơy Plêêk, đong chiuq tameng, laa dro đơu Lôôk heq luh xuum xôq tabông truh kaluh kajoq đong jah đnooy xing Phao-lô. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Tuôôy nưq, hloay tuôôy mư heq chiuq Bap-tem kung dêq hnhư mư, mư xiin 'wot, đaneq: “Atoh êêp kơy xet hloq gô laa muuyq xuum dii Lôôk, yôôych xiin dayh măn hlê, muut đom hnhư gô.” Mư ahluk ahnek 'wot. <verse eid="ACT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Xatyauq nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy 'wot đong hooy trôôk truh aduq xadrook apôôy, muuyq mư kadrê xapok nưq đong biq kamuuych Phi-tôn nhôp, tavơh 'wot, đơu mư nưq 'miêh đong dơơp lơơy thier 'ngưng ka kôôch ni bơơn kach xada ti. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Tuôôy hooy tyauq atêq Phao-lô ji 'wot, mư nưq laa tok đaneq: “Khơl manih neq laa khơl xapok ku Kơy Plêêk Thier Yơơt, đơu oot đong đnooy vlôh ka oh ay trôôk wơơt xok.” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Tuôôy nưq, mư nưq dơơp đanưq đom 'ngưng hngơy. Bơh vii biq dơơp ngơyq 'ngưng, lunưq tuôôy wiit hlê dii kamuuych nưq, Phao-lô dăt: “Đom yal Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, gô dăt ka may hooy vlôh klơlh mư kadrê neq.” Yôôch ni kahluh vlôh kung ajơ nưq.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Bơh tuôôy khơl manih kôôch ku mư nưq hloq đaneq ka tuôôy tabôôt ku ni heq hlơơp, yôôych atêq tuôôy rôp xok Phao-lô ji Si-la, oot ahoot vaarq dro truh duq dêh tabôôt truh aduq kaluh khơl dơơp padrok. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Tuôôy xagook vaarq dro truh kangưưr khơl padrok yôôch, oot đnooy: “Taleq dro neq đong dơơp xalôônq xalaaoq theng haay, vii laa tamooy Jo Thaiq, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />lunưq oot đong padoh taboon kaluh dok dơơp đơu leh e pheep ka haay 'yo nhonq long dưk dơơp, vii laa tamooy La Mah.” <verse eid="ACT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Yôôch bing karôp kung dưk tok tachơơl hlê vaarq dro, lunưq atêq tuôôy ăm chieh aau oot vlôh, khơl padrok patăk dăt tiel oot bơơn rooy. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Katuôôy, tuôôy heq hmơt dook vaarq dro 'ngưng yôôch, bing oot xagook vaarq dro muut tu, dăt ka dro kuun 'yo jư oot dong rơơt rol, <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />đơu adro padrok nưq, tuôôy heq nhonq patăk dăt đanưq, heq karuk oot muut tu 'lăp, ji kal jôôk oot muut vawauq. <verse eid="ACT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Long anưq, kawah katul klôôy, đong tuôôy xadrook apôôy, Phao-lô ji Si-la kacheeu baai vah ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, măn khơl karuk kadrơy yôôych tameng oot. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq đơơt ahrưng vari kôt tưng hưng xalih vlôh, pheq đnooy kaluh kahnier hnhư tu biq anhưh anhưưy, yôôych dêq hloay kahlăk 'măk 'mok hloay jơnưq jah luh hwong, ji talơy looy tooy tôôy dro biq tahlok phuch. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Nưq laa tuôôy adro 'yo hnhư karuk biq kadrăch kah, 'yo hloq kaluh 'mok hnhư karuk heq biq taluh hwong, lunưq hruut xieh ni vlôh, kơy nưq đinq kadih kaxêêt vii biit khơl biq karuk heq klôônq xadăk. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Bơh Phao-lô taayh kalh apok, đaneq: “Te dơơp haiq xăk, vii dêq hloay 'wot đong măn kađnen.” <verse eid="ACT 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Nưq laa, atêq tuôôy patăk xok đeen, kơy nưq charơơk pơl wol muut 'lăp, ji vii biq yôq varaal, kơy kul xăk pôôt ngưưr Phao-lô ji Si-la, <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />yôôch atêq tuôôy jarooy oot vlôh pi gôk, kơy đnooy: “Wơơy êêp kơy, varơuq kajoq aduq gô băt dăt pheq duh dơơp,xôq ka gô hnoq ik jah wơơt?” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Nưq laa, oot đnooy: “Dayh tuôq aduq Lôôk Jê-xu, yôôych kơy hnoq jah wơơt — kơy ji kôôch hnhư ku kơy.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Yôôch oot padoh apok Lôôk ka kơy kung dii dêq hloay khơl dro đom hnhư kơy. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ji muut wat nưq đom klôôy, atêq tuôôy jarooy oot hooy kung kơy, kơy 'nhaau xarêh ka oot aduq kaluh hlêêl xưr, yôôch kơy vơ chiuq bap-tem — kơy kung tôôy adro hnhư kơy. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Katuôôy, tuôôy heq jarooy oot muut hnhư kơy, kơy doot garaak xa vlôh kangưưr oot ji dêq paraat hlah hlaak kung khơl adro đom hnhư, vii heq tuôq nhonq Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Tuôôy nưq, truh xaroq, khơl padrok patăk taleq dro kuun hooy, đnooy đaneq: “Dayh luh khơl manih nưq hooy.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Nưq laa, padrok 'yo tu taboon hlê kaluh apok nưq ka Phao-lô đaneq: “Khơl padrok heq patăk manih đnooy đaneq êêp kơy jah tha yôôch. Nưq juneq, atêq tuôôy hooy vlôh, apôôy baarq kơy hooy trôôk hrok hrol.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Bơh Phao-lô đnooy dii oot: “Atêq tuôôy ăm xet varơuq tiel đnayh 'wot, laa khơl manih pơq xok qwuyen koot manih La Mah, đơu leh xưh xadrah, oot heq qwel 'wot muut tu, yôôch juneq oot padu kadook xagook 'wot vlôh ư? Dik leh ik! Thay vii anưq, kadih oot, atêq tuôôy truh đnen, pheq jarooy 'wot vlôh.” <verse eid="ACT 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Nưq laa, khơl dro kuun taboon hlê kaluh apok nưq ka khơl padrok kôt, yôôch bing oot varaal yôq tuôôy tameng đaneq vaarq dro laa koot manih La Mah. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Tuôôy hooy truh yôôch, khơl padrok adô adeng oot ji atêq tuôôy jarooy vlôh pi gôk, khơl padrok xiin oot hooy xangưưy klơlh theng oot. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Nưq laa, tuôôy heq vlôh klơlh tu, vaarq dro muut đom hnhư ku Li-đi. Ji atêq tuôôy tavơh khơl oh ay, vaarq dro ahmưk nhăk oot, yôôch dưk hooy.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy dalơh hlê Am-phi-bô-lit ji A-bô-lô-ni, oot hooy truh Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, aduq e muuyq hnhư hơu ku manih Jo Thaiq. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Yôôch tyauq katik ku Phao-lô, kơy muut jưq dii oot, ji đom pe hngơy Sa-bat, kơy padoh hlolh dii oot gamưh tol Rahlăp Vah, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />Tuôôy padoh hlolh đu dêq ji ăm hloq đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh duh pheq chiuq jiq jiêh ji riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt đaneq: “Lôôk Jê-xu neq, Kơy đơu gô đnooy vlôh ka oh ay, Jơq laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Taleq dro đom khơl oot jah xok xuum ji anguk hlê tyauq Phao-lô kung Si-la, dêq hloay muuyq sôôq karôp manih Hi Lap kuh kul Kơy Plêêk, hloay leh axit khơl mư kadrê karoh e. <verse eid="ACT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Lunư, vii khơl manih Jo Thaiq e xuum 'yarơ, lunưq tuôôy heq tawooyh taayh taleq dro xơk tauq nưq aduq trôôk kôt, tưưuq anguk muuyq bing karôp manih dêh, oot dơơp xalôônq xalaaoq theng neq. Atêq tuôôy kathôp muut hnhư Ja-sôn, oot axek akhiim vaarq dro xôq jarooy vlôh kangưưr manih dêh. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Bơh tuôôy leh axek hloq baarq kơy, oot ahoot Ja-sôn kung taleq oh ay hơq vlôh kangưưr khơl padrok theng phôq, pariau tok đaneq: “Taleq dro dơơp lôônq xôônq dêh araak neq, oot kung đong e mot ka đnen, <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />laa taleq dro đơu Ja-sôn ji dêq hloay bing neq heq tiip đoonq. Oot đong dưk dơơp tachơơl hlê kaluh ganuun ku Sê-sa, tuôôy đnooy e muuyq vuua kadrơy, laa Jê-xu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Nưq laa, bing oot dơơp ka bing karôp manih karôp ji khơl padrok theng phôq xalôônq xalaaoq tuôôy tameng taleq apok nưq. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Yôôch atêq tuôôy nhonq jêêt baoh leng xing Ja-sôn ji khơl dro măn hlê, khơl padrok kôt tha ka oot hooy.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Bơh yôôch, hloay jơnưq muut ka klôôy, khơl oh ay jarooy hloay Phao-lô kung Si-la hooy truh Bê-rê, đơu vaarq dro neq, tuôôy truh aduq, yôôych hooy muut hnhư hơu ku manih Jo Thaiq. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl manih măn đnen yôôch hok xet iaq khơl manih măn Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, oot heq nhonq xok apok dii dêq hloay xuum, tuôôy tôôy hngơy lăk 'yo Rahlăp vah, 'yo kaluh varơuq nưq e jơq đanưq long leh. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Lunưq, 'ngưng dro đom sôôq oot heq tuôq, jauq hloay muuyq sôôq mư kadrê Hi Lap thuôk khơl karoh e ji leh axit khơl kanau. <verse eid="ACT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Bơh tuôôy manih Jo Thaiq aduq Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka xet đaneq apok ku Kơy Plêêk kung đong jah padoh taboon xing Phao-lô aduq Bê-rê, yôôych oot kung truh aduq neq, ahluk ji dơơp xalôônq xalaaoq manih karôp. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Nưq laa, muut ajơ nưq, khơl oh ay hloay jơnưq jarooy Phao-lô hooy vlôh aduq truh dêh tahli, đom tuôôy baarq kơy Si-la ji Ti-mô-thê yôôych đong măn ka đnư. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Măn khơl manih jarooy trôôk Phao-lô heq jarooy kơy truh ka A-thên yôôch atêq tuôôy nhonq apok patăk atăq ka Si-la ji Ti-mô-thê đaneq vaarq dro pheq truh kung kơy kang meel kang tolh, yôôych oot wiit hlê xuq.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Tuôôy nưq aduq A-thên, đom tuôôy Phao-lô takôô oot, xuum klaak kơy biq tôq jaraq xing pi'lăp xăk, tuôôy hloq theng neq e viik galaay dang vangưl. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Anưq laa kơy tagêh apok đom hnhư tagumq dii manih Jo Thaiq ji khơl dro kuh kul Kơy Plêêk, kung dii khơl dro e ka kawah tavơh muut tôôy hngơy aduq tabôôt. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Bơh muuyq sôôq manih thuôk bing khơl thơy pato bing Khwoayq Laak ji bing Khăk kih kung tagêh apok dii kơy. Muuyq sôôq đnooy: “Kadra 'ngưng apok neq xung đnooy kajoq neq?” Măn sôôq kadrơy yôôych đnooy: “Dang đaji kơy neq laa dro padoh taboon truh taleq yaak daak kadrơy,” vii kơy đong padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay truh Lôôk Jê-xu ji varơuq riirh hlê. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Katuôôy, atêq tuôôy jư kơy hlê, oot jarooy truh Manih karôp A-rê-ô-ba, đnooy đaneq: “'Wot hnoq ik xet varơuq đơơu neq, pato dayq đong jah kơy pato, laa kajoq be? <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Vii kơy xagook truh toleq varơuq akêh tôôr 'wot. Lunưq 'wot xung xet kaluh varơuq nưq e iq laa kajoq.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />(Tuôôy nưq, dêq hloay manih A-thên ji khơl tamooy riirh aduq nưq raay leh deng varơuq trôôch muut varơuq kajoq đêh iaq laa taboon varơuq long tameng varơuq đơơu akêh.)<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy jah dưk măn katul Tayuup karôp A-rê-ô-ba, Phao-lô đnooy vlôh:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:22">“Wơơy oh ay laa manih A-thên, gô hloq oh ay thier trôôch đaauq tyauq đu kach đaleq. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Vii tuôôy hooy adaauq ji tabông truh khơl adro kuh ayuôôt ku oh ay, gô pheq đnooy hloq muuyq para hơu đơu tol nưq jah akleh chư: ‘Kuh Yaak Leh Xet.’ Anưq, yaak đơu oh ay akuh tuôôy be xet, nưq laa Kơy gô đong padoh taboon ka oh ay. <verse eid="ACT 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />Kơy Plêêk, kơy Yaak heq pajêêk panưk dêh araak ji tôôy paroh đom nưq, laa Lôôk ku plêêk ji vari, Kadraq leh riirh đom kaluh hnhư hơu jo ti koot manih xơy panưk. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Kadraq kung leh jah hơu varơuq xing pla ti koot manih đaji Kadraq duh muuyq varơuq kajoq, vii kadih Kadraq kahniq ăm tôôy paroh varơuq riirh, hoot heet kung tôôy thưq kadrơy. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Katuôôy, xing muuyq dro, Kadraq heq dơơp vlôh tôôy adrơơk tamooy koot manih riirh loch dêq tol raak vari, atêq tuôôy plah vlôh kaluh muua đinq adroyq ji akăk dêh aduq riirh măn ku oot, <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />xôq ka axek akhiim Kơy Plêêk, xôq yôôch xet 'leq chiq axit yôôych oot hnoq ik jo jâmh jah Kadraq yôôch axek hloq Kadraq, tabơh long Kadraq dong dik be măn xangưưy dii tôôy muuyq dro đom haay. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Vii đom Kadraq, haay riirh, axe ji măn hlê, kung đaji taleq dro đom khơl thi sih oh ay heq đnooy, đaneq: ‘Vii haay kung laa koot xau ku Kadraq.’ <verse eid="ACT 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Anưq, vii laa koot xau ku Kơy Plêêk, haay leh duh biit đaneq Kơy Thiêêng Liêng yôôych dang đaji kaluh dang vangưl bơơn vajang, long baak, long phơu xing taay kheoq ji akoq biit ku koot manih. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Lunưq, tuôôy Kơy Plêêk heq ka'lăk tuôôy đơơy thiuq hlolh xet nưq, juneq Kadraq dăt ka koot manih, tôôy dro loch tôôy aduq, pheq wiit xuum, <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Vii Kadraq heq lăp xôq muuyq hngơy, đơu muut hngơy nưq Kadraq hnoq đnooy xadrah dêh araak đom varơuq hyioh jăk xing Manih đơu Kadraq heq đinq, tuôôy heq ăm 'yo xanưk chăk chănq ka tôôy dro bơơn kach khienq Manih nưq riirh hlê xing aduq kaxêêt.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tameng truh varơuq riirh hlê ku manih kaxêêt, muuyq sôôq tache kơy; bơh sôôq kadrơy yôôych đnooy: “'Wot kung hnoq tameng kơy truh varơuq neq yưk tra.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Vii anưq, Phao-lô chuh klơlh katul đom oot. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Bơh taleq dro nưq heq tagu tyauq kơy yôôych tuôq, đom sôôq nưq đơu vơ e Đi-ô-ni-xi-ut, muuyq dro tayuup karôp A-rê-ô-ba, muuyq mư kadrê anơng Đa-ma-ri, ji khơl dro kadrơy kung dii oot.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Atêq kaluh varơuq nưq, tuôôy xarôp hooy xing A-thên, kơy hooy truh Kô-rinh-tô. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Yôôch tuôôy heq tavơh muuyq dro Jo Thaiq nưq, anơng A-qui-la, dêh katu aduq dêh Bông, đơơu truh xing I-ta-li kung Bê-rit-sin, kadrê kơy, vii Kơ-lôt heq vlôh tanưưl ka dêq hloay manih Jo Thaiq pheq chuh klơlh Rô-ma, yôôych kơy truh hlơq oot, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />đơu vii e kung ngê, kơy heq măn ji dơơp varơuq kung dii oot, vii oot raay laa khơl thơq axit pơ raap 'yo tyauq ngê dơơp. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Tuôôy nưq, kưq tôôy hngơy Sa-bat, kơy padoh taboon đom hnhư hơu, kơy xok jah xuum dêq manih Jo Thaiq hloay manih Hi Lap. <verse eid="ACT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Bơh tuôôy kaah Si-la ji Ti-mô-thê heq hooy pôôt xing Ma-xê-đoan, yôôych Phao-lô jah dêq hloay xuum padoh taboon ka đaauq, dêq xuum dơơp xanưk ka manih Jo Thaiq truh Lôôk Jê-xu laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Lunư, tuôôy oot tachơơl hlê ji đnooy ra ơơh kơy, yôôych atêq tuôôy aruh aau, kơy đnooy dii oot: “Apôôy vahaap êêp kơy kahrôq tol akoq êêp kơy! Măn gô lưp e kadrôôp! Jauq xing juneq, gô hnoq truh dii kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Tuôôy heq chuh klơlh đnư, kơy hooy truh hnhư muuyq dro kuh kul Kơy Plêêk nưq, anơng Ti-ti-u Juk-tu, đơu hnhư dro neq măn pi gah hnhư hơu. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Long anưq, Kơ-rit-bu, dro jư 'yo hnhư hơu, heq tuôq Lôôk, kung tôôy dro đom hnhư kơy, ji 'ngưng manih Kô-rinh-tô, atêq tuôôy tameng đaauq, yôôych tuôq ji chiuq Bap-tem. <verse eid="ACT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Tuôôy nưq, Lôôk xanoh dii Phao-lô gamưh muuyq varơuq ăm xet adroyq đom klôôy: “Te yôq, wih hlê, dayh đnooy đnoyq, ji be duh niinq hnhep kajoq. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />Vii Gô măn kung koot ji be kơyq hnoq đuk ti tol koot xôq dơơp ra ơơh koot, vii e 'ngưng dro deng ka Gô đom theng neq.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Nưq laa, kơy măn hlê muuyq xanưm drơu xiêk, pato apok ku Kơy Plêêk katul đom oot.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Bơh tuôôy Ga-li-ôn dơơp padrok kôt dêh A-chai, yôôych manih Jo Thaiq anguk mamuuyq dưk tok tachơơl hlê Phao-lô ji jarooy kơy vlôh xadrah, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />tơơl đaneq: “Adro neq ahluk manih karôp ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk be troq ganuun.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Bơh tuôôy Phao-lô xung hah huuy, Ga-li-ôn heq đnooy dii manih Jo Thaiq: “Wơơy lơơy, taleq kơy Jo Thaiq hơq, atoh neq dik laa kaluh varơuq dơơp leh troq ganuun long varơuq dơơp lưp troq xơk aak, yôôych gamưh tyauq dong varơuq nưq, nưq yôôych gô heq atuq xuum dii êêp kơy, <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />măn atoh neq laa kaluh takaay truh apok xarooy, yal taayh ji ganuun đêh ku êêp kơy, yôôych êêp kơy kadih êêp 'yo ralauq. Gô leh trôôch dơơp padrok xadrah ka taleq kaluh varơuq đaneq.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Yôôch kơy đuôôy oot vlôh klơlh hnhư xadrah. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Atoh bơh, atêq tuôôy rôp Sôt-then, adro jư 'yo hnhư hơu, dêq hloay bing oot tu tiel kơy kangưưr hnhư xadrah, đơu be varơuq leq đom sôôq nưq laa đangq tabông truh đôôyq dii Ga-li-ôn.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Măn Phao-lô, ka truh ajơ neq hloay đong măn athêêp 'ngưng hngơy, yôôch vlôh hooy xing khơl oh ay, kơy hooy ge truh Si-ri, kung dii kơy laa Bê-rit-sin ji A-qui-la, atêq tuôôy heq kadih kwoah akoq kơy aduq Sen-kơ-rê, vii kơy heq e apok paleek apôôy. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Tuôôy nưq, oot hooy pôôt truh Ê-phê-sô, ji kơy xôq oot măn hlê đnư, măn kadih kơy, tuôôy heq hooy muut đom hnhư hơu, kơy tagêh dii manih Jo Thaiq. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Bơh tuôôy oot dăt kơy măn hlê athêêp muuyq kawat đnoyq, yôôych kơy leh ưng anưq. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Lunư, atêq tuôôy vlôh hooy xing oot ji đnooy: “Gô hnoq wiit hlê dii oh ay yưk tra atoh Kơy Plêêk trôôch,” yôôych kơy pôôt ge chuh klơlh Ê-phê-sô.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Ji tuôôy heq tok gah aduq Sê-sa-rê, yôôch hooy tok ji vôôch hlơq tayuup vah, yôôych kơy hooy pôôt truh An-ti-ôt. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Atêq tuôôy dalơh hlê muuyq kawah kawat, kơy dưk hooy, pa xarôp hooy hlê kaluh dêh Ga-la-ti ji Phi-ri-gi, dơơp ka dêq hloay khơl xatyauq kajưk kalh.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Tuôôy nưq, muuyq dro Jo Thaiq nưq, anơng A-bô-lô, dêh katu aduq A-lek-xan-đơ-ri-a, muuyq dro e taay xa athêêk, heq hooy pôôt truh Ê-phê-sô, tuôôy laa muuyq dro hlolh xet truh Rahlăp Vah. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Kơy 'miêh heq jah pato dayq truh apok Lôôk, ji vii xuum klaak talăng jăk, kơy padoh ji pato klip kaluh varơuq apiq truh Lôôk Jê-xu, tuôôy vơ xet pheep Bap-tem ku Jăng đơu heq. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Katuôôy, kơy pa xarôp đnooy kach kôk kalh đom hnhư hơu, bơh atêq tuôôy tameng kơy, Bê-rit-sin ji A-qui-la heq jarooy kơy xuq ji padoh hlolh ka kơy muuyq kach troq dik iaq truh đaauq ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Tuôôy nưq, vii kơy xung trôôch luh ranưh hlê A-chai, lunưq atêq tuôôy ahmưk nhăk kơy, khơl oh ay valơk thư atăq hlê khơl xatyauq xôq đoonq tiip kơy, đơu atêq tuôôy truh aduq, kơy heq waak thier 'ngưng ka khơl leq heq tuôq gamưh vanong plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Vii kơy kahnoq vlôh aklơ hlê manih Jo Thaiq muuyq kach kalh paraat, tuôôy gamưh tol Rahlăp Vah pato vlôh Lôôk Jê-xu laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh đom tuôôy A-bô-lô măn aduq Kô-rinh-tô, yôôych Phao-lô, atêq tuôôy dalơh hlê kaluh dêh măn pi ataalh, kơy hooy pôôt truh Ê-phê-sô ji tavơh muuyq sôôq khơl xatyauq hơq. <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />Katuôôy, kơy đnooy dii oot: “Tuôôy heq tuôq, oh ay e nhonq xok Kơy Phool Hiel long leh?” Bơh oot tơơl hlê kơy: “Lưp, pheq đnooy atoh e Kơy Phool Hiel, yôôych 'wot kung koq hmưq tameng truh.” <verse eid="ACT 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Kơy kung đnooy: “Anưq yôôych, oh ay heq chiuq pheep Bap-tem leq?” Yôôch oot tơơl: “Pheep Bap-tem ku Jăng.” <verse eid="ACT 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Nưq laa, Phao-lô đnooy: “Jăng dơơp pheep Bap-tem ka varơuq wiit xuum, tuôôy padoh ka manih karôp truh Kơy đong truh atêq kơy, xôq ka oot hnoq ik tuôq, nưq laa tuôq aduq Lôôk Jê-xu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Ji yôôch, atêq tuôôy tameng anưq, oot chiuq pheep bap-tem đom yal Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Tuôôy Phao-lô xôq ti tol oot, yôôych Kơy Phool Hiel truh tol oot, katuôôy oot đnooy kaluh thưq apok đêh hloay đnooy hlit. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Tuôôy nưq, oot e dêq hloay lakah kưl vaarq dro khơl kanau.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy hooy muut đom hnhư hơu, kơy kưq kôk kalh pato dayq đom pe xiêk, padoh hlolh ji xok jah xuum truh daak dêh ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Bơh tuôôy muuyq sôôq manih kưq đnoyq găk xuum ji leh tuôq, đnooy xơuq Đaauq kangưưr manih karôp, yôôych kơy heq aklah vlôh khơl xatyauq, chuh xangưưy klơlh oot, tôôy hngơy athêêk tajauq dii mamuuyq aduq hnhư hok Ti-ra-nu. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Katuôôy, varơuq neq heq xalih vlôh đom vaarq xanưm, pheq đnooy dêq hloay khơl leq riirh aduq A-si raay tameng jah apok Lôôk, dêq manih Jo Thaiq hloay manih Hi Lap. <verse eid="ACT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Kơy Plêêk kung dưk dơơp kaluh pheep akêh kôt lơyq xing ti ku Phao-lô, <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />truh nôôy pheq đnooy khanh long vaayh kahliik apiq aduq kađuh kơy jah xagook truh ka khơl leq tavơh bingq yôôych tâk bingq vlôh klơlh oot, kamuuych 'moh kung pheq kahluh vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Tuôôy nưq, taleq thơy druyh kamuuych manih Jo Thaiq hooy kađneng kahơ kung raanq apôôy taayh yal Lôôk Jê-xu tol khơl adro biq garu xi nhôp, đaneq: “Gô dăt ka may bơyh yal Jê-xu đơu Phao-lô padoh pato,” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />(Tuôôy nưq, e pơh koot kanau ku kơy Sê-va hơq, muuyq thơy tơơk tưp kôt manih Jo Thaiq, đong dơơp varơuq neq.) <verse eid="ACT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Bơh tơơl hlê, garu xi đnooy dii oot, đaneq: “Gô nhonq xet Jê-xu, gô kung xet Phao-lô, bơh êêp laa kơyq?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Yôôch adro đơu garu xi đong nhôp muut, atêq tuôôy talong kathôp muut oot yôôych katơq dêq kaah bing, ni hmơt qwayq tachơơl hlê oot, pheq đnooy tachiah kachek laa lôk ji xưr xôôh, pheq xadăk klôônq klơlh hnhư nưq. <verse eid="ACT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq nưq vlôh jêêk varơuq taboon văch xet ka dêq hloay khơl leq riirh aduq Ê-phê-sô, dêq manih Jo Thaiq hloay manih Hi Lap. Varơuq yôq varaal apôôt tol dêq hloay oot, ji yal Lôôk Jê-xu jah vado. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />'Ngưng adro đom sôôq khơl manih heq tuôq kung truh, xưng nhonq ji đnooy tauq kaluh varơuq dơơp ku oot. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Katuôôy, 'ngưng dro dơơp ngê thơy pajơơu, atêq tuôôy anguk rahlăp jơyq ku oot hlê, heq vuh kangưưr tôôy adro. Khơl drơy jauq jaq triq ku kaluh nưq, ji oot nhonq hloq laa dăp waan đông baak. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Nưq atoh, vii taay yaak, apok Lôôk ranưh vlôh athêêp ji kajưk kalh.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Tuôôy nưq, hloay tuôôy kaluh varơuq neq jah payôôch, Phao-lô heq đinq đom Kơy Phool Hiel, dalơh pangach hlê Ma-xê-đoan ji A-chai, xôq hooy xuq Jê-ru-sa-lem, tuôôy đnooy đaneq: “Atêq tuôôy gô heq truh aduq nưq, yôôych gô kung duh pheq hooy hlơq Rô-ma đnoyq.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Nưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy patăk hooy vaarq đom sôôq khơl dro waak varơuq kơy, laa Ti-mô-thê ji Ê-rat, truh Ma-xê-đoan, yôôych kadih kơy heq măn ka A-si athêêp muuyq kawat.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Bơh muut kawah kawat nưq, muuyq varơuq paloanq leh de heq xalih vlôh tajinq truh Đaauq. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Vii muuyq ti thơq baak nưq, anơng Đê-mê-triu, ragơy dơơp vangưl mo yaak At-tê-mit bơơn baak, heq taway hlê leh axit lơơy tabôôt tek ka khơl thơq dơơp bơơn ti, <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />đơu dro nưq, atêq tuôôy anguk tưưuq khơl adro thơq đom varơuq neq hlê, heq đnooy: “Wơơy tôôy adro, oh ay xet đaneq varơuq karoh e ku haay laa vlôh xing varơuq dơơp tabôôt tek neq. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Oh ay kung hloq ji tameng đaneq leh vơ aduq Ê-phê-sô, bơh dang đaji loch dêq A-si, anơng Phao-lô neq, atêq tuôôy xok jah xuum, heq khienq muuyq sôôq karôp manih dêh wiit xuum, vii đnooy đaneq kaluh tuôông dơơp vlôh xing ti khơl drơy be aalq laa yaak vah kajoq dêq. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Nưq bơh, varơuq neq leh vơ laa varơuq naap joa jarooy truh apok leh tolh đôôyq dii ngê dơơp ku haay, đơu pheq đnooy đôôyq dii hnhư đơơp mo yaak At-tê-mit kôt lơyq tuôôy be jah 'yo vlôh kajoq. Katuôôy, varơuq tađnah tađnaak ku mo yaak đơu loch A-si, truh hloay dêh araak kuh kul, dong dik jeq biq pahyaak ka'lăk.” <verse eid="ACT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy tameng anưq yôôych vơơ hloay thier ra tôq jaraq, oot pariau tok đaneq: “Kôt lơyq hloay mo yaak At-tê-mit ku manih Ê-phê-sô!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Yôôch dêq theng biq galaay ngôp varơuq rađiik miik nưq, ji manih dêh ka uun mamuuyq ka uua truh raap kacheeu, rôp tyauq Gai-ut ji A-ri-tak, manih Ma-xê-đoan, laa khơl 'wơyq kung hooy ku Phao-lô. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Bơh tuôôy Phao-lô xung vlôh kahnoq katul manih karôp, yôôch khơl xatyauq leh xôq ka kơy dơơp anưq. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Măn muuyq sôôq padrok dêh A-si laa khơl 'wơyq ku kơy, bơơn kach pahêêr truh kơy, kung heq đnooy nhăk kơy te kadih noop xăk muut raap kacheeu nưq. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Nưq yôôch, manih hơq adro neq kưq alo tok muuyq kiêuh đêh ra, vii bing manih yôôych đong rađiik miik, ji 'ngưng sôôq be xet oot tagumq tưưuq hlê vii kakơq kajoq. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Tuôôy nưq, taleq dro xing đom bing karôp taboon hêêl varơuq ka A-lek-xan-đơ, atêq tuôôy manih Jo Thaiq taluq kơy hooy tok pi adroyq, yôôch A-lek-xan-đơ, awaayh ti vlôh dơuq, đong xung đnooy hlolh dii manih karôp. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Bơh tuôôy nhonq vlôh đaneq kơy neq laa manih Jo Thaiq, yôôych muuyq hnưm ahlôôk laa kôt xing dêq hloay bing oot heq xalih vlôh đom tuôôt vaarq wat: “Kôt lơyq hloay mo yaak At-tê-mit ku manih Ê-phê-sô.” <verse eid="ACT 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Lunư, tuôôy dro thư kiq theng heq khienq manih karôp langưưp xuum hlê, kơy đnooy:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:35">“Wơơy oh ay, khơl manih tamooy Ê-phê-sô, dik e adro leq đơu be xet đaneq theng Ê-phê-sô laa manih jư hnhư hơu ku mo yaak At-tê-mit kôt lơyq ji vangưl yaak xing plêêk klêh pôôt? <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Nưq yôôych, vii kaluh varơuq neq laa leh ik chôôyq takaay ik, lunưq varơuq duh dik ka oh ay laa pheq jư langưưp xuum ji leh dơơp varơuq kajoq pơl wol. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Vii oh ay heq jarooy khơl manih neq truh, đơu oot be aalq laa dro atôk hnhư hơu, kung leh aalq laa dro đnooy ra ơơh mo yaak ku haay. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Lunưq, atoh Đê-mê-triu ji khơl thơq dơơp dii ti kung dii kơy nưq e apok rôp kadrôôp kơyq, yôôych kaluh aduq xưh xadrah măn đong jah luh 'mok, ji kung e khơl padrok ưk dêh; dayh xôq oot rôp xadrah mamuuyq. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Măn atoh oh ay đong xung vôôch kajoq truh kaluh varơuq kadrơy, yôôych ni hnoq jah xưh xadrah đom tayuup karôp tyauq heq đinq. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Vii dik, haay hnoq ik biq rôp kadrôôp paloanq apiq truh dong varơuq hngơy neng, tuôôy leh e kakơq kajoq, đơu vii kơq nưq, haay hnoq be ik ăm vlôh apok đnooy hlê ka varơuq tưưuq anguk dơơp lôônq xôônq neq.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Atêq tuôôy đnooy đanưq, kơy ăm padơy bing karôp tưưuq anguk nưq.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy ka ajơ paloanq heq yôôch, Phao-lô ăm mơơy khơl xatyauq truh, yôôch atêq tuôôy ahmưk nhăk oot, đnooy apok xa ngaah, yôôch kơy vlôh hooy, hooy trôôk truh Ma-xê-đoan. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy heq hooy hlê kaluh dêh nưq ji ahmưk nhăk oot dii muuyq baai padoh yơơt, yôôch kơy hooy truh Hi Lap. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Katuôôy, tuôôy măn đnư pe xiêk yôôch, vii xalih vlôh muuyq xôq vih ka kơy xing manih Jo Thaiq tuôôy xung hooy ge truh Si-ri, lunưq kơy heq ăm vlôh qwiet đinq wiit xuq tyauq ngưưr Ma-xê-đoan. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Tuôôy nưq, hooy kung dii kơy e Sô-ba-tê, koot Bi-ru, manih Bê-rê; măn e A-ri-tak ji Sê-kun-đu manih Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka; Gai-ut, manih Đet-bơ; Ti-mô-thê; kung Ti-chi-kơ ji Trô-phim, manih A-si. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Bơh vii heq hooy adroyq, oot đong kôô 'wot aduq Trô-ach. <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Măn 'wot, atêq kaluh hngơy Lêh Tôôp Leh Tape, heq vlôh hooy tahli xing theng Phi-lip, ji heq hooy truh đom dăp hngơy, 'wot heq truh kung oot aduq Trô-ach, laa aduq đơu 'wot măn hlê đnư đom pơh hngơy.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Tuôôy nưq, muut hngơy thưq nhưk đom twuân, tuôôy 'wot tưưuq hlê dii mamuuyq xôq pleelh tôôp, Phao-lô đnooy athêêk dii khơl tuôq. Vii heq đinq dưk hooy hngơy atêq, lunưq kơy kưq măn đnooy đnoyq baai padoh dong truh katul mưng. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Tuôôy nưq, e 'ngưng đeen đom kawah phong taalh ravaak, aduq đơu 'wot đong jah tưưuq hlê. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Bơh, muuyq dro tadăp nưq, anơng Ơ-tich, tuôôy 'ngôôy aduq 'mok kaxôô, biq lahaay rakôôp vik tawol, đom tuôôy Phao-lô padoh xiik iaq đnoyq, vii biq lahaay rakôôp vik tawol, nhu nưq heq gưlh xing paak thưq pe pôôt ji kaxêêt tuôôy jah rôôk kah. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Lunư, tuôôy heq hooy pôôt, Phao-lô kuu xăk tol nhu, yôôch kabiin xok nhu, kơy đnooy: “Te xôôl dôôl, vii varơuq riirh ku nhu đong măn đom nhu.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Atêq nưq, hooy wiit tok, pleelh tôôp ji xa waal, katuôôy athêêk đom muuyq kawah kawat dong truh rahưng xaroq, yôôch kưq đanưq, kơy dưk hooy. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Măn khơl kadrơy xagook adro kanau măn riirh xuq ji jah hlơq hlôôp leh axit.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Xatyauq nưq, tuôôy heq hooy adroyq truh aduq tau, 'wot jah jarooy truh A-sôt, laa aduq jưq đinq hnoq đoonq Phao-lô tok tau, vii kơy heq ralauq đanưq, tuôôy kadih kơy tyauq jưq đinq hooy bơơn trôôk vari. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Yôôch tuôôy kơy heq tavơh 'wot aduq A-sôt, yôôych atêq tuôôy đoonq kơy tok tau, 'wot hooy truh Mi-ti-len. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Ji tuôôy vlôh tahli xing aduq nưq, hngơy atêq 'wot hooy pôôt tahyioh Chi-ô, măn hngơy atêq nưq, 'wot truh duq Sa-môt, yôôch hngơy xatyauq nưq, 'wot heq hooy truh Mi-lê. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Vii Phao-lô heq đinq hooy ge dalơh hlê Ê-phê-sô, xôq ka kơy klơlh pheq hlơơp kawat aduq A-si, vii kơy đong pơl wol xôq e mot aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem muut hngơy Lêh Nguh Twuân, atoh varơuq nưq laa ik đôôyq dii kơy.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Nưq laa, xing Mi-lê, atêq tuôôy patăk manih truh Ê-phê-sô, kơy dăt taayh khơl kadraq lơơk ku tayuup vah truh. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Ji yôôch, tuôôy oot heq truh kung kơy, yôôych kơy đnooy dii oot: “Kadih oh ay xet hlolh, xing hngơy kapa tep, laa xing tuôôy gô joaq jôôk truh A-si, gô heq măn kung dii oh ay dang đaleq tuôôt kawat nưq, <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />tuôôy hơu varơuq Lôôk bơơn dêq hloay xuum apôôt xăk ji daak mot kung kaluh pơơl dal xalih vlôh ka gô xing kaluh xôq vih ku manih Jo Thaiq, <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />đaleq gô heq be jư hlê varơuq kajoq, nưq laa kaluh varơuq e ich, đơu leh padoh taboon ka oh ay, gô kung heq pato dayq oh ay măn aduq karôp manih, ji aduq kaluh hnhư đêh, <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />tuôôy dơơp xanưk ka dêq manih Jo Thaiq hloay Hi Lap truh varơuq wiit xuum wih truh Kơy Plêêk ji truh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Juneq, xiin 'yo nee, gô đong tol trôôk hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, vii heq chiuq Kơy Phool Hiel ahluk ahnen, 'miêh be xet kaluh kajoq hnoq xalih vlôh ka gô aduq nưq, <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />đêh vlôh varơuq Lôôk Phool Hiel dơơp xanưk dii gô đom tôôy theng, dăt đaneq looy tooy ji pơơl dal đong takôô gô. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Lunư, gô leh taboon apok leq ka xăk riirh gô laa quiq jaq đôôyq dii xăk, dơơp aleq dong payôôch varơuq charơơk ku gô ji varơuq dơơp đơu gô heq nhonq xok xing Lôôk Jê-xu, xôq dơơp xanưk ka Hêêl Kaxay jo vanong plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="ACT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Juneq, xiin 'yo nee, gô xet đaneq dêq hloay oh ay, laa katul khơl manih đơu gô heq truh hlơq tuôôy padoh taboon truh Daak Plêêk, hnoq leh măn hloq mot gô đnoyq. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Vii nưq, muut hngơy neng, gô dơơp xanưk kangưưr oh ay đaneq gô leh e kadrôôp truh vahaap ku dêq hloay oh ay. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Vii gô be jư hlê muuyq varơuq kajoq khienq ka dêq hloay iq trôôch ku Kơy Plêêk leh đnooy vlôh ik aduq oh ay. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Dayh jư 'yo kadih xăk ji hloay bing de đơu Lôôk Phool Hiel heq xôq oh ay dơơp manih jư 'yo xôq xakaq jarooy tayuup vah ku Kơy Plêêk, laa tayuup đơu Kadraq heq root bơơn vahaap ku kadih Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Gô xet đaneq atêq varơuq vlôh hooy ku gô, kaluh xo vari xơk tauq hnoq aluq alaq muut katul đom oh ay, leh biit angơuq bơy de. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Pheq đnooy xing katul đom kadih oh ay hnoq dưk tok muuyq sôôq adro đnooy vlôh kaluh varơuq lưp troq xôq aluut jarooy 'ngưng khơl xatyauq tyauq oot. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Lunưq, pheq rơơt rol, văch đaneq hngơy ji klôôy, đom tuôôt pe xanưm, gô leh padơy nhăk pato tôôy muuyq adro kung dii daak mot. <verse eid="ACT 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Juneq, gô pahnăp oh ay ka Kơy Plêêk ji ka apok ku vanong plêêk Kadraq, laa varơuq e taay yaak xôq rôôk đơ oh ay ji kahniq ăm oh ay kơ ngiip katul đom dêq hloay khơl leq dong jah yuôôr vah. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Gô be ham baak long vajang long qwuân aau ku kơyq. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Kadih oh ay xet đaneq vaarq pla ti neq heq hơu varơuq ka tuôông duh ku gô ji ku khơl manih măn kung dii gô. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Gô heq kahnoq ka oh ay đom dêq hloay tôôy varơuq đaneq duh pheq chiuq pơơl dơơp varơuq đanưq xôq waak rơy khơl leq ravoch paraat, katuôôy xôq văch kaluh apok ku Lôôk Jê-xu, vii kadih Kadraq heq pato: ‘Dik e vanong tuôôy kahniq ăm iaq laa tuôôy nhonq xok.’”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Atêq tuôôy đnooy kaluh varơuq nưq, yôôych tuôôy heq kul takuul pôôt, kơy xadrook apôôy dii dêq hloay oot. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq nhim ook thier kôt xalih vlôh katul đom oot, ji tuôôy kabiin xok ranong Phao-lô yôôch, oot hiip kơy, <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />vii hlu rơu nhưk laa apok kơy heq đnooy, đaneq oot xarôp leh măn tavơh mot kơy đnoyq. Atêq nưq, oot jarooy kơy pôôt tau.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy 'wot heq jah xagook vlôh tahli, nưq laa atêq tuôôy vlôh hooy klơlh oot, yôôych hooy hyioh, 'wot hooy truh Kôôt, yôôch truh hngơy atêq truh Rô-đơ, ji xing nưq truh Ba-ta-ra. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Tuôôy heq axek jah muuyq poop tau hooy hlê truh Phê-ni-xi, yôôych pôôt tau nưq, 'wot jah xagook vlôh tahli. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy 'yo hloq ngok tahli Chip-rơ, yôôych valah hlê kơn keng ngok tahli, 'wot hooy ge truh Si-ri ji hooy aloh truh Ti-rơ, vii tau pheq tơq haang aduq nưq. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy axek jah khơl xatyauq, 'wot măn hlê đnư pơh hngơy, đơu oot, gamưh Kơy Phool Hiel ăm xet, kưq đnooy Phao-lô te hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh tuôôy 'wot heq payôôch taleq hngơy neq, nưq laa atêq tuôôy dưk hooy, 'wot kưq đnoyq dưk hooy, tuôôy dêq hloay oot raay raa hooy jarooy 'wot kung dii kadrê ji khơl koot, ka truh hloay pi gôk theng phôq, yôôch atêq tuôôy kul takuul pôôt tol gah tahli xadrook apôôy, <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />yôôych 'wot athêêk dii mamuuyq ji tawaak tok tau, măn khơl manih nưq yôôych wiit xuq aduq oot, <verse eid="ACT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />bơh 'wot, tuôôy heq payôôch kaluh hngơy hooy xing Ti-rơ, yôôych hooy pôôt truh Bê-tô-lê-mai, ji atêq tuôôy vôôch hlơq khơl oh ay, 'wot măn hlê dii oot muuyq hngơy. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Yôôch hngơy atêq, atêq tuôôy dưk hooy, 'wot hooy truh Sê-sa-rê ji, tuôôy heq muut đom hnhư ku Phi-lip, hnhư padoh taboon Hêêl Kaxay, laa muuyq đom pơh châp sưq, 'wot măn hlê dii kơy. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Tuôôy nưq, Kơy e poot dro koot kadrê măn tadăp đnooy hlit. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Yôôch đom 'ngưng hngơy tuôôy 'wot măn hlê đnư, muuyq hnhư hlit nưq, anơng A-ga-but, heq hooy aloh xing Ju-đê. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Atêq tuôôy truh tavơh 'wot ji xok talơy hnek katêêk ku Phao-lô, yôôch vek jôôk ti ku kơy hlê, kơy đnooy: “Kơy Phool Hiel xanoh kaluh varơuq neq: ‘Tyauq kach neq, manih Jo Thaiq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem hnoq vek manih khơl kanau, đơu manih nưq e talơy hnek katêêk neq, ji oot hnoq noop adro nưq muut ti tamooy daak kadrơy.’” <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Nưq laa, tuôôy 'wot tameng taleq apok nưq, dêq 'wot hloay khơl manih ka daak dêh raay adô adeng kơy te hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Xatyauq nưq, Phao-lô tơơl hlê: “Oh ay đong dơơp kajoq nưq, nhim ook ji khienq xuum gô jiq jiêh long aleq? Bơyh gô e varơuq e 'miêh xuum, leh vơ xôq biq vek, đơu măn chiuq kaxêêt vii yal Lôôk Jê-xu aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem đnoyq.” <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy leh chiuq tameng, lunưq 'wot paq laayq đnooy nhăk, tơơl đaneq: “Apôôy iq Lôôk jah jêêk.”<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq kaluh hngơy nưq, tuôôy heq ralauq đôô đaak, 'wot hooy tok truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Yôôch muuyq sôôq khơl xatyauq xing Sê-sa-rê kung hooy dii 'wot, jarooy 'wot truh aduq Ma-na-sôn, muuyq dro katu măn Chip-rơ, laa khơl xatyauq xing kapa tep, đơu măn aduq manih neq 'wot jah adoot waal.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy 'wot heq truh aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, khơl oh ay hlah hlaak vôôch hrok 'wot. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Yôôch hngơy atêq, Phao-lô hooy dii 'wot truh tavơh Ja-kơ, katuôôy dêq hloay khơl draq lơơk raay e mot. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Vôôch hlơq oot yôôch, kơy taboon hlê tyauq tưng varơuq tôôy varơuq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq dơơp katul khơl tamooy daak kadrơy gamưh khơl hơu varơuq ku kơy. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy tameng anưq, oot ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk, katuôôy oot đnooy dii kơy: “Dro oh ay, ay hloq nưq, e kahang waan manih heq tuôq katul đom tamooy Jo Thaiq ji oot raay e xuum talăng jăk truh ganuun. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Bơh, oot heq jah tameng đnooy truh ay, đaneq ay pato dayq truh varơuq chuh ka'lăk klơlh ganuun Môi-se ka tôôy dro Jo Thaiq katul khơl tamooy kadrơy, tuôôy dăt khơl manih nưq te goch kađuh ka koot xau oot, kung te riirh tyauq kaluh dok dơơp. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nưq yôôych, pheq dơơp aleq? Chăk chănq oot hnoq tameng đaneq ay heq truh. <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Nưq dayh dơơp luneq, laa varơuq đơu 'wot đnooy dii ay. Poot dro đong măn dii 'wot, đong e aduq oot muuyq apok paleek. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Atêq tuôôy jarooy khơl manih neq tyauq yôôych dayh chiuq pa xarêh 'moh kung dii oot, ji dayh bla jêêt ka oot, xôq oot hnoq jah kwoah akoq oot, yôôch tôôy dro hnoq xet đaneq kaluh varơuq oot heq jah tameng đnooy truh ay laa be hmưq e, wih hlê kadih xăk ay kung xa măn jơq troq, tuôôy tameng jư ganuun. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Măn truh khơl manih daak kadrơy heq tuôq, 'wot heq atăq thư, valơk hlolh pheq jư xăk klơlh tuôông đơơp đok dang vangưl, vahaap, kaluh ôô kaxêêt phoch, ji varơuq apuq atrăp.” <verse eid="ACT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Nưq yôôch, hngơy atêq, atêq tuôôy jarooy taleq dro nưq tyauq, tuôôy heq jah pa xarêh kung dii oot, yôôych phao-lô hooy muut đom hnhư hơu, xôq đnooy varơuq payôôch truh sôôq hngơy ku lêh pa xarêh, jauq truh tuôôy ku lêh jah tơơk tưp ka tôôy muuyq adro đom sôôq oot.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Bơh tuôôy pơh hngơy jeq jah xaleep, taleq dro manih Jo Thaiq truh xing A-si, atêq tuôôy hloq Phao-lô đom hnhư hơu, heq ahluk ahlul dêq bing karôp ji vlôh ti tol kơy, <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />laa tok: “Tôôy adro lơơy, manih I-sơ-ra-ên lơơy, xiin waak rơy! Neq laa dro pato tôôy adro loch aduq tachơơl hlê tamooy dêh, ganuun ji aduq neq. Katuôôy, ni pheq đnooy măn jarooy manih Hi Lap muut đom hnhư hơu ji dơơp klơơr 'yêq aduq vah neq.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Vii adroyq nưq, oot heq hloq Trô-phim, manih Ê-phê-sô, kung dii kơy đom theng, đơu oot biit đaneq Phao-lô heq jarooy ay neq muut hnhư hơu. <verse eid="ACT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Dêq theng vơơ biq ahluk, vơơ e muuyq bing tamooy karôp ka uun truh, yôôch atêq tuôôy rôp xok Phao-lô, oot heq hoot kơy vlôh pi gôk hnhư hơu, ji 'mok nhăp jah kađnoch hlê. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Kung đom tuôôy raanq păk kaxêêt kơy, yôôych pahêêr lơy truh padrok xakaq bing kuun đaneq dêq theng Jê-ru-sa-lem đong biq lôônq xôônq, <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />yôôych hloay jơnưq, atêq tuôôy jarooy tyauq bing kuun ji khơl padrok dưk ưk, kơy charơơk pôôt truh aduq manih karôp. Yôôch tuôôy khơl drơy 'yo hloq padrok xakaq kung bing kuun, oot paq laayq tiel đnayh Phao-lô. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Đom tuôôy neq, tuôôy heq hooy hlê jeq, padrok xakaq ăm rôp jư kơy, đnooy dăt xôq kơy biq vek bơơn vaarq raq looy tooy, yôôch vôôch 'yo kơy laa kơyq ji kơy heq dơơp kajoq. <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Lunư, manih neq adro hơq đom bing karôp đong laa tarok muuyq varơuq đêh raa, măn padrok xakaq bing kuun, tuôôy leh e ka paraat axek vôôch jah varơuq kajoq chăk chănq vii xarooy tarok 'nhih paloanq, yôôych heq đnooy dăt xôq kơy jah jarooy xuq đôôn. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Bơh tuôôy kơy hooy truh bơk katưlh, yôôych varơuq xalih vlôh ka kơy laa pheq jah bing kuun xakôôk hooy xing varơuq xơk tauq ku manih karôp. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Vii muuyq bing manih thier karôp kưq hooy tyauq, laa tarok: “Păk kaxêêt ni yơu!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Katuôôy, tuôôy xarôp biq jarooy muut đôôn, Phao-lô đnooy dii padrok xakaq kuun: “E pheep ka gô đnooy taleq apok dii kơy be?” Yôôch padrok xakaq kuun đnooy: “Kơy xet apok Hi Lap ih? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />Nưq yôôych kơy leh aalq laa dro Ai Kâp, adro đơu adroyq kaluh hngơy neq heq paloanq ji jarooy poot ravơu ti păk kaxêêt muut wăngq we ih?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Yôôch Phao-lô tơơl: “Gô ji manih Jo Thaiq, katu măn theng Tat-sơ, dêh Si-li-si, muuyq adro manih ku theng phôq be aalq laa de kajoq. Lunưq gô xiin kơy ăm pheep gô đnooy athêêk dii manih karôp.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Nưq laa atêq tuôôy padrok xakaq kuun ăm pheep, tuôôy dưk tol bơk katưlh, Phao-lô vlôh hlêêl bơơn ti ka manih karôp. Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq hloq hnhep yôôch, kơy padoh đnooy bơơn apok Hê-bơ-rơ, đaneq:<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Wơơy khơl oh ay, khơl oh ay ji khơl vaq nhu, xiin tameng apok đnooy tagêh ku gô dii khơl oh ay juneq.”<verse eid="ACT 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tameng đaneq kơy đong padoh đnooy bơơn apok Hê-bơ-rơ dii oot, oot kang athêêp hnhep iaq đnoyq. Yôôch kơy đnooy:<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Gô laa manih Jo Thaiq, pa iir aduq theng Tat-sơ dêh Si-li-si, bơh jah pato dayq đom theng neq aduq jôôk thơy Ga-ma-li-ên, jah pato dayq tyauq trôôk hooy hyioh găk ku ganuun tyauq xing vaq kơy, e xuum talăng jăk vii Kơy Plêêk dang đaji dêq hloay oh ay đong e hngơy neng, <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />laa dro heq rôp toop Đaauq neq ăm truh kaxêêt, tuôôy rôp vek ji karuk muut tu padêq khơl kanau hloay khơl kadrê, <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />dang đaji thơy tơơk tưp kôt dơơp xanưk ka gô kung padêq hloay khơl kadraq lơơk, laa khơl adro đơu atêq tuôôy nhonq thư xing aduq oot atăq ka khơl oh ay, gô hooy vlôh truh Đa-mach, hooy jarooy trôôk khơl dro biq rôp jư măn kađnư xuq truh Jê-ru-sa-lem, xôq ka oot hnoq ik biq hmơt dook. <verse eid="ACT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh ka gô nưq laa tuôôy đong hooy trôôk ji jeq truh Đa-mach, kawah hngơy dưk, tưng hưng, muuyq jaraak tađnah thier kalh xing plêêk xaraar ahnhe rawiit gô. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Katuôôy, gô gưlh riêp pôôt vari ji tek muuyq apok xanoh dii gô, đaneq: ‘Sau-lơ, Sau-lơ, aleq koot rôp toop Gô?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Nưq yôôch, gô tơơl hlê: ‘Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq laa kơyq?’ Kadraq xanoh dii gô: ‘Gô laa Jê-xu manih Na-xa-ret, Kơy đơu koot đong rôp toop.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Tuôôy nưq, khơl manih đong măn kung gô 'yo hloq jaraak tađnah nưq, bơh oot leh tameng hlolh apok ku Kơy đong xanoh dii gô. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Măn gô yôôych tơơl: ‘Kuh Lôôk, koot duh dơơp kajoq?’ Atêq nưq, Lôôk xanoh dii gô: ‘Atêq tuôôy dưk tok, dayh hooy muut theng Đa-mach, ji aduq nưq koot hnoq jah đnooy ăm xet truh dêq hloay kaluh kajoq heq jah đinq ka koot pheq dơơp.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Nưq laa, đom tuôôy gô leh 'yo hloq ro vii kơq jaraak tađnah xaraar ploat nưq, lunưq gamưh ik rôp ti jarooy hooy xing khơl manih măn kung ni, gô heq hooy muut theng Đa-mach. <verse eid="ACT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Tuôôy nưq, ay A-na-nia nưq, muuyq dro talăng jăk tyauq ganuun, jah xanưk kaxay xing tôôy dro Jo Thaiq riirh ka đnư, <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />tuôôy heq truh dii gô ji dưk pi gah, ay dăt gô: ‘Ay Sau-lơ lơơy, dayh tađnah mot hlê.’ Klip wat nưq, gô 'yo tok hloq ay nưq. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Atêq nưq, ay đnooy: ‘Kơy Plêêk ku mo kơy haay heq rơơlh ay xôq xet iq trôôch Kadraq, ji xôq 'yo hloq Kơy Hyioh Jăk, kung đaji xôq tameng apok đnooy xing huuy Kadraq, <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />vii ay hnoq laa muuyq dro xanưk ka Kadraq kangưưr tôôy dro truh kaluh kajoq ay heq hloq ji tameng. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Tuôôy nưq, ay măn takôô kajoq? Atêq tuôôy dưk tok, dayh chiuq bap-tem ji dayh dơơp xarêh kadrôôp maroh ay gamưh xadrook apôôy yal Kadraq.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Atêq nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh ka gô tuôôy heq wiit xuq Jê-ru-sa-lem, ji tuôôy gô đong xadrook apôôy đom hnhư hơu, nưq laa kadih gô klêh muut ka ajơ phoch langoch. <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />Gô hloq Kadraq xanoh dii gô: ‘Dayh yơu, ji dayh vlôh klơlh Jê-ru-sa-lem kach pơl wol, vii oot hnoq leh châp nhonq apok xanưk ku koot truh Gô.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Bơh gô tơơl: ‘Kuh Lôôk, kadih oot xet đaneq koot 'miêh heq rôp karuk ji hmơt tiel đom tưng hnhư hơu khơl leq tuôq aduq Kadraq. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Tuôôy vahaap ku Ê-tiên, dơơp xanưk ku Kadraq, biq kahrôq vlôh, kadih koot 'miêh kung dưk jeq đnư, trôôch anưq, ji 'yo jư aau gôk ku khơl dro păk kaxêêt ay nưq.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />Yôôch Kadraq xanoh dii gô: ‘Dayh hooy, vii gô hnoq patăk koot hooy xangưưy truh dii khơl tamooy daak kadrơy.’”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Tuôôy nưq, manih karôp đong tameng kơy dong truh apok neq, yôôych oot tok apok, đnooy đaneq: “Pheq păk kaxêêt adro manih luneq klơlh raak vari, vii be đangq xôq ni riirh.” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Katuôôy, tuôôy oot đong laa pariau, avih aau gôk ji tavih thul tok plêêk, <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />yôôych padrok xakaq heq đnooy dăt xôq kơy jah jarooy muut đôôn, xanoh kơy pheq chiuq vôôch dook bơơn rooy, xôq hnoq ik xet vii kakơq kajoq đơu manih karôp laay taayh tarok tachơơl kơy đanưq. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Bơh tuôôy oot heq pahyioh kơy vlôh ji talơy xarôp xung biq qwưt rooy, Phao-lô đnooy dii padrok xakaq kuun đong dưk kađnư: “Jơq be ganuun ăm pheep khơl kơy xok rooy tiel muuyq dro La Mah đơu koq biq xưh xadrah?” <verse eid="ACT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Tuôôy nưq, vii tameng anưq, yôôych padrok xakaq kuun, atêq tuôôy truh kung dro padrok xakaq kuun, heq taboon hlê đaneq: “Kadraq đong đinq dơơp kajoq? Vii manih neq laa manih dêh La Mah.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Nưq laa, tuôôy heq hooy truh, padrok xakaq kuun đnooy dii kơy: “Dayh ăm gô xet, ay e jơq laa manih dêh La Mah long leh?” Yôôch kơy đnooy: “Jơq.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Tuôôy nưq, padrok xakaq kuun tơơl hlê: “Gô heq root qwuyen manih dêh nưq bơơn muuyq sôôq jêêt kôt.” Bơh Phao-lô đnooy: “Măn gô dik jah pa iir vlôh đanưq.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Vii anưq, taleq dro đinq hmơt tiel kơy hloay jơnưq chuh hooy klơlh kơy, măn padrok xakaq kuun yôôych yôq varaal tuôôy xet đaneq kơy laa manih dêh La Mah, ji vii xăk heq ăm rôp vek kơy.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Nưq yôôch, hngơy atêq, vii xung xet chăk vii aleq đơu kơy biq manih Jo Thaiq rôp xadrah, lunưq padrok xakaq kuun heq luh vek kơy, ji đnooy dăt ka khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt kung padêq hloay Tayuup Karôp anguk hlê. Yôôch atêq tuôôy jarooy Phao-lô pôôt, padrok xakaq kuun ăm xôq kơy dưk katul oot.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy 'yo anhinq muut tayuup karôp, Phao-lô đnooy: “Wơơy khơl oh ay, wơơy khơl oh ay, gô heq riirh kangưưr Kơy Plêêk dii dêq xuum klaak pa xarêh dong truh hngơy neng.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Bơh thơy tơơk tưp kôt A-na-nia đnooy dăt ka khơl manih dưk jeq kơy pađa muut huuy kơy. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Muut tuôôy neq, Phao-lô đnooy dii kơy nưq: “Apưt biq tôô ko hơq, Kơy Plêêk xarôp đnayh kơy! Kơy 'ngôôy xưh xadrah gô tyauq ganuun, đơu vlôh tanưưl xôq gô biq tiel trăk ganuun aleq?” <verse eid="ACT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Lunư, khơl manih dưk gah nưq đnooy: “Kơy đong đnooy ra ơơh thơy tơơk tưp kôt ku Kơy Plêêk ih?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Phao-lô đnooy: “Wơơy oh ay, gô heq leh xet đaneq kơy nưq laa thơy tơơk tưp kôt. Vii heq e valơk đaneq: ‘Xăk te đnooy varơuq xơk dii dro dưk xanok tamooy haay.’”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy nhonq hloq đaneq muuyq bing laa manih Sa-đu-sê, măn bing hơq laa manih Pha-ri-si, Phao-lô heq đnooy kôt apok katul Tayuup Karôp, đaneq: “Wơơy oh ay, wơơy khơl oh ay, gô laa muuyq dro Pha-ri-si, koot ku manih Pha-ri-si; Gô đong biq xưh xadrah apiq truh varơuq takôô gamưh ji varơuq riirh hlê ku adro kaxêêt.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy kơy đnooy varơuq neq, yôôych muuyq varơuq takaay tayaat xalih vlôh katul manih Pha-ri-si ji manih Sa-đu-sê, yôôch manih karôp biq aklah bing vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Vii manih Sa-đu-sê đnooy đaneq leh e varơuq riirh hlê, kung leh e yaak plêêk long kaluh yaak, bơh manih Pha-ri-si yôôych châp nhonq dêq vaarq varơuq nưq. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Lunưq, xarooy laa ook tachơơl tarok 'nhih xalih vlôh, ji atêq tuôôy dưk tok, muuyq sôôq thơy pato ganuun thuôk bing Pha-ri-si tagêh, đaneq: “'Wot be hloq e kadrôôp xơk kajoq aduq manih neq. Đơu xet 'leq, muuyq yaak long muuyq yaak plêêk heq xanoh kung kơy nưq …” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ji yôôych, tuôôy takaay tayaat kang vlôh diik miik, padrok xakaq kuun, vii biit yôq leh kheoq Phao-lô hnoq biq oot chieh chek, heq đnooy dăt ka bing kuun hooy pôôt tagoa xok kơy xing katul đom oot, katuôôy xagook kơy xuq đôôn.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Bơh, muut klôôy hngơy atêq, tuôôy truh pi gah kơy: Lôôk xanoh: “Dayh kajưk xuum vii koot heq dơơp xanưk truh Gô đaleq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, yôôych varơuq duh dik ka koot kung laa dơơp xanưk đanưq aduq Rô-ma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Nưq yôôch truh xaroq, atêq tuôôy xôq vih kung mamuuyq, taleq dro Jo Thaiq kadih paleek đôk, đaneq leh xa kung be hôôch dong truh tuôôy bing oot păk kaxêêt jah Phao-lô. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Tuôôy nưq, e 'ngưng iaq poot kưl dro xôq vih neq, <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />đơu tuôôy truh dii khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji khơl draq lơơk, oot tơơl: “'Wot heq paleek đôk muuyq apok karoay axaap kadih 'wot xôq leh xa kajoq dong truh tuôôy 'wot păk kaxêêt jah Phao-lô. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Vii anưq, juneq, xiin khơl kơy kung Tayuup Karôp vlôh mot kangưưr padrok xakaq kuun, đaji laa đong đinq vôôch axek dong hlolh iaq kaluh dong varơuq apiq truh ni, xôq kơy nưq hnoq ik jarooy ni pôôt ka khơl kơy. Măn 'wot yôôych karauq xôq păk kaxêêt ni adroyq tuôôy ni truh aduq.” <verse eid="ACT 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Bơh koot kanau ku ay kadrê Phao-lô, vii heq tameng truh xôq vih takôô karauq, lunưq atêq tuôôy truh ji muut đom đôôn, heq tauq hêêl neq ka Phao-lô. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Nưq laa, tuôôy heq taayh muuyq đom khơl adro padrok hlê, Phao-lô đnooy: “Xiin jarooy nhu tadăp blaay neq truh dii padrok xakaq kuun, vii nhu e varơuq padoh taboon ka kơy nưq.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Nưq, atêq tuôôy jarooy nhu tyauq, adro padrok heq jarooy nhu truh tavơh kơy padrok xakaq kuun ji tơơl: “Adro tu Phao-lô, atêq tuôôy taayh gô, heq gamưh gô jarooy nhu tadăp blaay neq truh ka kadraq, vii e varơuq pheq đnooy dii kadraq.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Nưq laa, atêq tuôôy heq rôp ti nhu ji hruy muut aduq đê đêh, dro padrok xakaq kuun vôôch: “Varơuq đơu nhu e xôq padoh tauq ka gô laa kajoq?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Tuôôy nưq nhu tơơl đaneq: “Khơl manih Jo Thaiq heq athêêk muuyq xuum dăt kadraq aleq ka hngơy dơh kadraq hnoq ik jarooy Phao-lô pôôt ka Tayuup Karôp, đaji đong đinq vôôch 'yo dong hlolh iaq truh kơy nưq. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Jo nưq, xiin kadraq te xôq biq bing oot xok xuum, vii iaq poot kưl dro đom sôôq oot đong klôônq du ring kôô kơy nưq, laa khơl adro heq kadih paleek đôk leh xa kung be hôôch dong truh tuôôy păk kaxêêt jah kơy. Hloay juneq oot đong ralauq 'miêh, takôô varơuq châp nhonq xing kadraq.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Anưq, padrok xakaq kuun ăm nhu tadăp blaay vlôh xuq, đnooy dăt nhu: “Te ăm kơyq xet đaneq nhu heq đnooy taboon ka gô kaluh varơuq neq.” <verse eid="ACT 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Atêq tuôôy taayh vaarq dro padrok hơq, kơy dăt: “Dayh palauq ralauq vaarq hreek bing kuun kung dii pơh kưl acho ôô ahleh ji vaarq hreek kuun adrơk maak dơơp aleq ka bing kuun hnoq ik dưk hooy truh Sê-sa-rê muut wat thưq pe klôôy neng,” <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />katuôôy atăq ăm ôô acho xôq ka Phao-lô 'ngôôy tok, bing hnoq ik xagook kơy nưq hrok hrol truh padrok dêh Phê-lit, <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />đom tuôôy heq valơk hla thư e đnooy varơuq luneq:<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Kơ-lôt Li-sia atăq kơy padrok Phê-lit đangq vado: Apok vôôch hlơq kul vado. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Adro neq, atêq tuôôy biq rôp xing manih Jo Thaiq ji jeq biq oot păk kaxêêt, yôôych gô heq wơơt tuôôy truh talaap kung dii bing kuun, vii xet ik đaneq adro nưq laa manih La Mah. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Katuôôy, vii xung xet truh apok rôp kadrôôp đơu xing nưq oot rôp xadrah kơy nưq, gô heq jarooy kơy nưq pôôt ka Tayuup Karôp ku oot, <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />đơu gô hloq kơy nưq biq rôp xadrah apiq truh kaluh varơuq tagêh truh ganuun ku oot, bơh be e rôp xadrah leq đangq kaxêêt long rôp karuk. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Nưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy muuyq xôq vih hnoq xalih vlôh tachơơl dii manih neq jah tauq vlôh ka gô, gô heq vơơ hloay jarooy adro nưq truh kadraq, tuôôy kung đnooy dăt ka khơl manih atok xadrah pheq đnooy rôp xadrah adro nưq kangưưr kadraq.”<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Anưq, khơl bing kuun, tyauq apok tanưưl jah đnooy ka oot, atêq tuôôy jarooy Phao-lô tyauq, heq jarooy kơy hooy đom ka klôôy truh An-ti-ba-tri. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Yôôch hngơy atêq, oot wiit xuq đôôn, tuôôy heq xôq bing kuun ôô ahleh hooy đnoyq kung kơy, <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />đơu bing kuun neq, tuôôy heq muut đom theng Sê-sa-rê ji atăq hla thư ka padrok dêh, yôôych kung heq xagook vlôh Phao-lô ka kơy nưq. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy đok thư ji vôôch kơy e pa iir xing dêh leq, yôôch tuôôy heq xet laa katu măn Si-li-si, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />padrok dêh đnooy: “Gô hnoq xưh xadrah kơy tyauq ganuun tuôôy khơl manih rôp xadrah kơy kung truh đnen”, yôôch dăt xôq kơy jah karuk jư đom hnhư vuua ku Hê-rôt.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq dăp hngơy, thơy tơơk tưp kôt A-na-nia, kung dii taleq dro khơl draq lơơk nưq, ji hnhư tagêh Tet-tu-lu hơq heq hooy pôôt, laa khơl adro hooy truh xôq rôp xadrah kangưưr padrok dêh tachơơl hlê Phao-lô. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Yôôch tuôôy kơy heq jah taayh truh, Tet-tu-lu pa xarôp rôp xadrah kơy, tuôôy tơơl: “Vii jah varơuq langưưp paat kôt gamưh kadraq, ji jo 'ngưng dơơp đơơu xalih truh ka tamooy neq xing varơuq 'yo xangưưy ranưh ranơơy ku kadraq, <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />lunưq wơơy kadraq Phê-lit đangq vado, dêq đom tôôy varơuq hloay loch tôôy aduq, 'wot 'yo nhonq kaluh kông varơuq dơơp nưq dii dêq hloay xuum xet ơơn. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Bơh xôq gô klơlh dơơp ngơyq kadraq athêêp 'ngưng iaq, gô xiin kadraq, dii varơuq atuq xuum ku kơy, tameng 'wot padoh lê lêq. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Dik, vii 'yo hloq kadra neq đaji adro bingq jich, ji laa dro ahluk varơuq lôônq xôônq aduq tôôy adro Jo Thaiq loch dêh araak, kung laa dro dưk ưk bing ja Na-xa-ret, <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />laa adro pheq đnooy heq raanq dơơp klơơr 'yêq hnhư hơu, kung laa adro đơu 'wot heq rôp jư, — [ Ji 'wot xung xưh xadrah tyauq ganuun ku 'wot. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Bơh kơy padrok xakaq Li-sia, atêq tuôôy truh aduq, heq tagoa xok ni klơlh ti 'wot bơơn maak xieh, <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />vlôh tanưưl ka khơl adro rôp xadrah ni pheq truh kangưưr kadraq] — đơu xing aduq ni, kadraq hnoq ik kadih xăk 'yo vôôch truh dêq hloay kaluh varơuq neq xôq nhonq vlôh kaluh kadrôôp đơu 'wot đong rôp xadrah ni.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Nưq yôôch, manih Jo Thaiq kung ka uua tyauq, 'yo nhonq kaluh varơuq nưq laa đanưq.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Phao-lô kung heq tơơl hlê, atêq tuôôy padrok dêh vlôh hlêêl ka kơy đnooy: “Vii xet kadraq heq dơơp padrok xưh xadrah ka tamooy neq đom 'ngưng xanưm, lunưq gô hlah xuum kadih đnooy tagêh truh kaluh varơuq apiq truh gô, <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />vii Kadraq hnoq ik nhonq xet đaneq xing tuôôy gô hooy tok xôq ayuôôt laat aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem laa leh galơh kưl vaarq hngơy, <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />ji oot leh rôp tavơh gô takaay tayaat dii kơyq đom hnhư hơu, kung be dơơp vlôh varơuq paloanq aduq bing karôp, long đom kaluh hnhư hơu, long loch dêq theng phôq, <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Oot kung leh e paraat dưk xanưk kajoq ka kadraq truh kaluh kadrôôp đơu oot juneq đong rôp kadrôôp gô. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Bơh gô 'yo nhonq dii Kadraq varơuq neq, đaneq tyauq đaji Đaauq đơu oot taayh laa bing ja, đơu tyauq nưq gô hơu varơuq Kơy Plêêk ku khơl mo kơy, xôq xuum tuôq muut dêq hloay kaluh kajoq gamưh tol ganuun ji kaluh apok jah valơk đom kaluh rahlăp hlit, <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />e xuum takôô gamưh aduq Kơy Plêêk đơu kadih oot kung đong takôô, tuôôy đinq laa hnoq e varơuq riirh hlê ku dêq manih hyioh jăk hloay adro xơk tauq. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Vii kơq nưq, kadih gô kung raanq paraat xôq e muuyq xuum klaak leh đangq trek kangưưr Kơy Plêêk ji koot manih đom tôôy varơuq. <verse eid="ACT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq 'ngưng xanưm, gô wiit xuq, xagook tyauq jêêt waak tajưp ka vari dêh gô, kung kaluh kuah tơơk tưp, <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />đơu muut tuôôy nưq, oot rôp tavơh gô chiuq pa xarêh 'moh đom hnhư hơu, leh achung dii manih karôp, kung be kung dii varơuq paloanq. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Bơh taleq dro Jo Thaiq hơq xing A-si, laa khơl adro đangq pheq truh kahnoq vlôh kangưưr kadraq yôôch atok xadrah, atoh oot e paq kê varơuq kajoq tachơơl dii gô. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Long laa kadih khơl manih măn đnen pheq đnooy vlôh varơuq be troq leq đơu oot heq axek ik tuôôy gô dưk kangưưr Tayuup Karôp ku manih Jo Thaiq, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />e be laa truh muuyq apok đnooy vlôh đaneq đơu gô heq laa kôt tuôôy dưk katul oot, đaneq: ‘Gô đong chiuq xưh xadrah kangưưr khơl oh ay hngơy neng apiq truh varơuq riirh hlê ku dro kaxêêt.’”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Nưq yôôch Phê-lit, vii xet ro raang kaluh varơuq apiq truh Đaauq, heq xôq hlê varơuq xưh kaluh panưh, tuôôy đnooy: “Tuôôy leq kơy padrok xakaq Li-sia hnoq ik hooy pôôt đnen, gô hnoq đinq hloay kaluh varơuq apiq truh êêp kơy,” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />ji đnooy dăt ka padrok xakaq kuun jư 'yo Phao-lô, katuôôy pheq ăm kơy e varơuq rayơh rayơơy, ji leh klơl khơl manih oh ay ku kơy truh văch xiap kơy.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Yôôch taleq hngơy atêq nưq, Phê-lit, tuôôy wiit hlê kung dii Đơ-ru-si, kadrê kơy, laa muuyq mư kadrê Jo Thaiq, yôôych heq ăm taayh Phao-lô truh ji tameng kơy padoh taboon truh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Bơh tuôôy kơy đong padoh taboon truh varơuq hyioh jăk ji varơuq jư xăk, kung varơuq xưh xadrah hnoq truh, yôôych Phê-lit, vii kadrăch varaal, heq tơơl hlê: “Juneq dayh wiit xuq, bơh tuôôy e kawah, gô hnoq ăm taayh kơy truh.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Kung ajơ nưq, kung vii takôô đaneq hnoq e axit jêêt baak jah Phao-lô palo ăm ka xăk, lunưq xing nưq, padrok dêh kưq ragơy athêêk dii kơy tuôôy ăm taayh kơy truh ratơh. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Bơh tuôôy dalơh dêq vaarq xanưm, Phê-lit e manih dưk thêq laa Bôt-tiu Phê-tu, katuôôy vii xung xok xuum manih Jo Thaiq, lunưq Phê-lit heq xôq Phao-lô biq karuk.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Anưq, tuôôy heq truh nhonq chưk đom dêh, yôôych pe hngơy atêq Phê-tu hooy tok xing Sê-sa-rê truh Jê-ru-sa-lem. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Katuôôy, Khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji khơl adro dưk ưk đom tamooy Jo Thaiq vlôh kahnoq kangưưr kơy tachơơl hlê Phao-lô ji oot apôôy taayh kơy, <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />tuôôy xiin muuyq vanong tachơơl dii Phao-lô, nưq laa padrok dêh hnoq ik ăm mơơy taayh Phao-lô tok Jê-ru-sa-lem, đom tuôôy ralauq xôq vih karauq xôq păk kaxêêt kơy tyauq trôôk. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Atêq nưq, Phê-tu tơơl hlê đaneq Phao-lô yôôych đong biq karuk aduq Sê-sa-rê, măn kadih xăk kơy yôôych jeq pheq dayh dayh dưk hooy. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Kơy đnooy: “Vii anưq, khơl manih dưk xanok katul đom êêp kơy, atêq tuôôy kung pôôt đnư, atoh e varơuq kajoq be troq aduq manih neq, yôôych oot dayh rôp kadrôôp kơy nưq.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq măn dii oot leh 'ngưng iaq thơơm long kưl hngơy, kơy nưq hooy pôôt truh Sê-sa-rê. Hngơy atêq, atêq tuôôy 'ngôôy muut ragê xưh xadrah, kơy nưq dăt ăm Phao-lô jah jarooy vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy kơy heq truh,khơl manih Jo Thaiq 'miêh xing Jê-ru-sa-lem pôôt heq dưk rawiit kơy, đnooy vlôh 'ngưng apok rôp kadrôôp parêq parơh đơu oot leh hnoq dơơp xanưk ik, <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />đom tuôôy Phao-lô kadih đnooy tagêh đaneq: “Gô be lôp paq kê kadrôôp leq tachơơl hlê ganuun ku manih Jo Thaiq, leh tachơơl hlê hnhư hơu, kung leh tachơơl hlê Sê-sa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Bơh vii xung xok xuum manih Jo Thaiq, Phê-tu tơơl apok Phao-lô đaneq: “Kơy e trôôch, atoh hooy tok Jê-ru-sa-lem, xôq chiuq xưh xadrah ka đnư kangưưr gô truh kaluh varơuq neq be?” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Lunưq, Phao-lô tơơl: “Gô đong dưk kangưưr hnhư xadrah ku Sê-sa, laa aduq duh ka gô pheq chiuq xưh xadrah. Gô be dơơp varơuq kajoq dơơp ra ơơh ka manih Jo Thaiq, đaji kadraq kung xet thier hlolh. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Anưq, atoh gô dơơp ra ơơh ji heq dơơp varơuq kajoq đangq kaxêêt, yôôych gô be xiin ăm klơlh kaxêêt. Bơh atoh leh kadrôôp leq măn đom sôôq kaluh kajoq oot rôp xadrah gô, yôôych leh kơyq hnoq ik palo gô ka oot. Gô kienq hlê truh Sê-sa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy heq tajauq dii tayuup karôp kôq vânq, Phê-tu tơơl apok: “Kơy heq kienq hlê tok Sê-sa. Kơy hnoq hooy truh Sê-sa!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq tuôôy ratơh hlê taleq hngơy, vuua Ak-rip-ba ji mo Bê-rê-nit heq hooy pôôt truh Sê-sa-rê, vôôch hlơq Phê-tu. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Yôôch đom tuôôy khơl kơy nưq măn đnư 'ngưng hngơy, Phê-tu padoh hlê ka vuua kaluh dong varơuq truh Phao-lô, đaneq: “Adro khơl kanau hơq laa muuyq dro tu jah Phê-lit xôq hlê, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />đơu truh manih neq, khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt ji khơl draq lơơk manih Jo Thaiq heq atăq rôp xadrah, tuôôy gô măn aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, đooy xưh xadrah tachơơl dii kơy nưq. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Gô heq tơơl apok dii oot đaneq tyauq ganuun ku La Mah laa leh atăq noop adro leq adroyq tuôôy adro biq rôp kadrôôp hnoq ik tangưưr mot dii khơl adro rôp xadrah, katuôôy nhonq jah kawah kadih đnooy tagêh truh varơuq rôp kadrôôp nưq. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Vii anưq, tuôôy heq ka uua mamuuyq truh đnen, leh tagay vlôh takiêh tahyơq hlê 'leq, yôôych hngơy atêq, tuôôy 'ngôôy muut ragê xưh xadrah yôôch, gô dăt ka adro nưq jah jarooy muut, <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />đơu apiq truh adro rôp kadrôôp, atêq tuôôy khơl adro rôp kadrôôp jah ăm dưk tok, oot heq leh ăm hloq apok rôp kadrôôp leq đaji kaluh kadrôôp xơk đơu gô biit. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Tađôôy muut đnư, oot e muuyq sôôq takaay tayaat dii kơy nưq truh đaauq ku oot ji truh Jê-xu nưq heq kaxêêt đơu Phao-lô đnooy laa măn đong riirh. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Nưq laa, vii leh xet chăk varơuq tayaat truh kaluh varơuq neq, gô heq vôôch kơy nưq jơq be xung hooy truh Jê-ru-sa-lem xôq jah xưh xadrah kađnư truh kaluh dong varơuq nưq. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Bơh tuôôy Phao-lô kienq hlê xôq kơy jah jư 'yo kôô varơuq xưh xadrah ku vuua, gô heq vlôh tanưưl xôq kơy nưq jah jư 'yo dong truh tuôôy gô hnoq ik jarooy kơy nưq tok Sê-sa.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Yôôch Ak-rip-ba đnooy dii Phê-tu: “Kadih gô kung xung tameng manih neq.” Kơy tơơl hlê: “Hngơy dơh vuua hnoq jah tameng kơy nưq.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Anưq, muut hngơy atêq, tuôôy Ak-rip-ba ji Bê-rê-nit heq truh kung pheep tăk thier ra uk ra aar ji tawaak muut đom hnhư gưl dii dêq khơl xakaq kuun, hloay khơl adro tyauq tong varơuq dơơp ku theng phôq, yôôch tuôôy Phê-tu đnooy dăt, yôôych Phao-lô jah jarooy muut. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Phê-tu đnooy vlôh: “Kuh vuua Ak-rip-ba ji dêq hloay oh ay e mot kung dii 'wot, oh ay đong 'yo hloq adro neq, laa adro đơu muuyq bing karôp manih Jo Thaiq heq kung mamuuyq waak apôôy gô, hloay măn Jê-ru-sa-lem hloay ka đnen, pariau tarok xôq leh ăm kơy nưq riirh đnoyq. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Bơh gô xet ik kơy nưq heq be dơơp varơuq kajoq đangq kaxêêt. Lunư, vii kadih xăk adro neq heq kienq tok truh vuua, lunưq gô đinq jarooy kơy nưq hooy, <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />đơu truh kơy nưq, gô be e kajoq chăk chănq xôq tauq tok ka vuua. Vii anưq, gô jarooy kơy nưq vlôh kangưưr oh ay, ji tolh iaq laa kangưưr vuua, wơơy vuua Ak-rip-ba, xôq atêq tuôôy wat vôôch 'yo neq xalih vlôh, gô e varơuq kajoq nưq đơu gô hnoq ik tauq tok. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Vii dii gô, tuôôy rôp jarooy muuyq dro tu đơu leh đnooy vlôh kaluh kadrôôp nưq tachơơl hlê ni yôôych dik laa lưp e liq.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Nưq yôôch, vuua Ak-rip-ba đnooy dii Phao-lô: “Kơy jah pheep xôq đnooy vlôh truh xăk.” Muut tuôôy neq, atêq tuôôy tơơk ti vlôh, Phao-lô kadih đnooy tagêh, đaneq:<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Kuh vuua Ak-rip-ba, apiq truh tôôy varơuq đơu gô biq rôp kadrôôp xing manih Jo Thaiq, gô hloq gô dik tơơl dal tuôôy jeq kadih bing ka gô kangưưr vuua hngơy neng, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />nhưk laa vii vuua laa manih hlolh xet dêq hloay kaluh dok dơơp ji hloay kaluh dong varơuq tagay takaay tayaat katul đom manih Jo Thaiq. Lunưq gô xiin vuua atuq xuum tameng gô. <verse eid="ACT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Dik anưq, tôôy adro Jo Thaiq raay xet kach riirh ku gô xing tuôôy măn de, xalih vlôh xing tuôôy kapa tep katul đom tamooy gô kung đaji aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />vii heq xet adroyq truh gô xing adroyq, lunưq atoh oot e xuum xôq dơơp xanưk, yôôych nưq laa gô heq riirh tyauq bing ja leh hlơu klêq đom đaauq ku 'wot, laa bing ja Pha-ri-si. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Juneq, gô dưk đnen chiuq xưh xadrah laa vii xuum takôô gamưh aduq apok tavek Kơy Plêêk heq lăp dii kơl mo kơy ku 'wot, <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />laa apok tavek đơu kưl vaarq adrơơk 'wot đom varơuq talăng jăk, đong takôô xôq nhonq jah, tuôôy ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk hngơy ji klôôy. Kuh vuua, jơq vii xuum takôô gamưh nưq, gô đong biq rôp kadrôôp xing manih Jo Thaiq. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Atoh Kơy Plêêk khienq manih kaxêêt riirh hlê, vii aleq varơuq nưq biq 'yo laa varơuq leh hnoq tuôq ik katul đom oh ay? <verse eid="ACT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />Dik anưq, gô heq kadih biit duh pheq dưk dơơp 'ngưng kach tachơơl đôôyq dii yal Jê-xu Na-xa-ret, <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />laa kaluh varơuq đơu gô heq dơơp hloay kaah măn Jê-ru-sa-lem, gô pheq đnooy măn rôp karuk 'ngưng dro khơl vah muut karuk atêq tuôôy nhonq jah qwuyen xing khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, ji hloay ajơ oot biq păk kaxêêt, yôôych gô heq viet phiuq ưng anưq. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Tuôôy ragơy hmơt dook oot đom kaluh hnhư hơu, gô heq ahnanh dăt oot pheq katơơk galơh, katuôôy vii tôq jaraq oot paq ik, gô pheq đnooy heq hooy rôp toop oot dong truh hloay kaluh theng daak kadrơy, <verse eid="ACT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />đơu đom kaluh varơuq rôp toop nưq, đong tuôôy hooy trôôk truh Đa-mach kung dii qwuyen ji varơuq dơơp xing khơl thơy tơơk tưp kôt, <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />yôôych kuh vuua, tuôôy katul mot hngơy dưk, tol trôôk hooy, gô 'yo hloq xaraar tađnah xing plêêk, xaraar ah iaq hloay mot hngơy, jaraak ahnhe rawiit gô ji khơl adro đong hooy achung dii gô. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Katuôôy, atêq tuôôy dêq hloay 'wot gưlh pôôt vari, gô tek muuyq apok đnooy xanoh dii gô bơơn apok Hê-bơ-rơ: ‘Sau-lơ, Sau-lơ, aleq koot rôp toop Gô? Dik leh tơơl dal ka koot tuôôy heq đa muut nok 'mooch.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Atêq nưq, gô tơơl: ‘Kuh Lôôk, Kadraq laa kơyq?’ Yôôch Lôôk xanoh: ‘Gô laa Jê-xu, Kơy đơu koot đong rôp toop. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Lunư, dayh dưk tok ji dưk hyioh tol jôôk koot, vii xing varơuq neq đơu Gô heq rama vlôh dii koot, xôq pato đinq koot dơơp xapok ji manih xanưk hloay truh kaluh varơuq koot heq hloq aduq Gô, hloay kaluh varơuq Gô hnoq kahnoq ka koot, <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />tuôôy wơơt koot klơlh tamooy koot ji klơlh kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy đơu Gô patăk koot truh, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />xôq luh mot oot, xôq ka wih klơlh kamơng jaluk wih truh xaraar tađnah, ji klơlh qwuyen lưk ku Sa-tan truh kung Kơy Plêêk, xôq oot nhonq xok varơuq tha ka'lăk kadrôôp maroh, kung kơ ngiip katul đom khơl manih heq jah pa xarêh xing xuum tuôq aduq Gô.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Vii anưq, kuh vuua Ak-rip-ba, gô heq be hôôk leh tameng đôôyq dii varơuq ăm hloq adroyq xing plêêk nưq, <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />wih hlê, adroyq dêq gô heq padoh taboon ka khơl manih aduq Đa-mach, yôôch dêq aduq Jê-ru-sa-lem, hloay loch dêq dêh Ju-đê, kung ka khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, pheq wiit xuum ji wiit xuq kung Kơy Plêêk, dưk dơơp kaluh varơuq taxưngq dii xuum wiit xuum nưq. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Vii kơq kaluh varơuq nưq, manih Jo Thaiq, atêq tuôôy rôp jư gô đom hnhư hơu, kưq axek kach păk kaxêêt gô. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Anưq, gamưh nhonq jah varơuq wơơt waak xing Kơy Plêêk dong truh hngơy neng, gô heq dưk tok, dơơp xanưk vơơ ka adro de, vơơ ka khơl kôt, leh đnooy kajoq đêh iaq kaluh kajoq đơu dêq khơl hnhư hlit hloay Môi-se heq đnooy laa xarôp xalih vlôh — <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh jah đinq pheq chiuq pơơl, ji vii laa manih adroyq dêq vlôh xing varơuq riirh hlê ku khơl adro kaxêêt, Kadraq hloay hnoq đnooy vlôh varơuq tađnah dêq ka tamooy dêh 'wot hloay kaluh tamooy daak kadrơy.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy kơy đong kadih đnooy tagêh bơơn kaluh varơuq neq, Phê-tu đnooy kalh xarooy đaneq: “Kơy adruôy yôôch, Phao-lô lơơy! Varơuq xa hok 'ngưng qwaq dơơp kơy jêêk adro ta'ngơk.” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Bơh Phao-lô đnooy: “Gô leh adruôy 'leq, wơơy kadraq Phê-tu đangq vado, wih hlê gô đong đnooy kaluh apok dong dik ji talăng jăk. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Vii kơy vuua xet truh kaluh varơuq neq — gô pheq đnooy kôk dik tơơl dii kadraq — bơyh gô tuôq kajưk be muuyq varơuq leq đom kaluh varơuq neq padu ik kơy vuua, vii dong varơuq nưq yôôych heq leh hmưq ik dưk dơơp măn đom kamơng jaluk leq nưq. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Kul vuua Ak-rip-ba, vuua tuôq khơl hnhư hlit be? Gô xet đaneq vuua tuôq.” <verse eid="ACT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Bơh Ak-rip-ba dăt Phao-lô: “Kơy đong xok xuum gô xôq vlôh jêêk khơl tuôq Kơ Đôk đom kawat lêq ih?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Bơh Phao-lô tơơl: “Dik laa gô apôôy vôôch Kơy Plêêk, long đom kawat lêq long yơơt, leh vơ vuua, đơu măn dêq hloay khơl leq tameng gô hngơy neng jah vlôh jêêk kung muuyq dang đaji gô đong e, đêh vlôh taleq looy tooy neq.”<verse eid="ACT 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Yôôch vuua dưk tok, kung dii padrok dêh, kaah mo Bê-rê-nit hloay khơl manih đong 'ngôôy dii oot, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />ji atêq tuôôy chuh hooy, oot tajauq dii mamuuyq, đnooy đaneq: “Manih neq be dơơp kajoq đangq kaxêêt long rôp tu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Yôôch Vuua Ak-rip-ba đnooy dii Phê-tu: “Manih neq 'miêh hnoq ik jah tha, atoh kơy nưq heq be kienq hlê tok Sê-sa.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy đinq heq jah đnooy vlôh xôq ka 'wot hooy bơơn trôôk daak tahli truh I-ta-li, yôôych oot pahnăp kaah Phao-lô hloay muuyq sôôq manih tu kadrơy ka muuyq dro padrok xakaq kuun, anơng Ju-lơ, thuôk bing kuun Âu-gu-ta. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy heq hooy tok muuyq poop tau xing A-tra-mit, đong xarôp hooy dalơh tahli truh kaluh aduq pangach tyauq A-si, yôôych 'wot jah jarooy vlôh tahli, A-ri-tak, manih theng Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, dêh Ma-xê-đoan măn kung 'wot. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Yôôch hngơy atêq, 'wot truh muut Si-đôn, katuôôy Ju-lơ, vii xa dơơp dii Phao-lô thier kaxay xuum, heq ăm pheep kơy truh dii khơl 'wơyq xôq e jah varơuq văch xiap ku oot. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Xing aduq nưq, atêq tuôôy vlôh tahli, 'wot ăm tau truh jeq ngok tahli Chip-rơ bơh vii khiel đong klôôp kaxơơlh. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Katuôôy, atêq tuôôy dalơh hlê dêh tahli pangach tyauq Si-li-si ji Bam-phi-li, 'wot heq truh muut Mi-ra, thuôk Li-si. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Măn đnư, vii padrok xakaq kuun axek jah muuyq poop tau xing A-lek-xan-tri e yưk hooy truh I-ta-li, lunưq kơy jarooy 'wot tok tau nưq. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôt 'ngưng hngơy hooy manưưn ji tuôôy heq truh jeq Kơ-nit muuyq kach thier pơơl hwơơl, yôôych vii khiel leh ăm pheep 'wot truh jeq iaq đnoyq, 'wot heq ăm tau truh jeq ngok tahli Kơ-rêt, ta hyioh Sa-môn. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Yôôch kưq hooy pi gah dii ngok tahli nưq muuyq kach pơơl hwơơl, 'wot hooy truh muuyq aduq hơq jah taayh laa Mih Kangh, aduq neq măn jeq theng La-sê.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Bơh vii heq hlơơp thier 'ngưng kawat, ji yưk hooy nưq yôôych heq vlôh jêêk ngwi hiêmh vii pheq đnooy heq dêq tuôôy deek xa hlơơp yôôch, lunưq Phao-lô ahmưk nhăk, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />tuôôy đnooy dii oot, đaneq: “wơơy oh ay, gô hloq đaneq yưk hooy neq hnoq pheq tavơh dii tôônq hư ji 'ngưng hlơơp hlăp, leh vơ truh kông haang ji poop tau, đơu măn xăk riirh ku haay đnoyq.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Bơh padrok xakaq kuun jah xok xuum bơyh dro charơơk tau ji kôôch tau iaq laa kaluh apok jah Phao-lô đnooy vlôh. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Lunư, vii kangh leh hơơp măn hlê đom muua ka oaq, lunưq 'ngưng adro heq đnooy vlôh iq đinq vlôh tahli xing aduq neq, atoh bơơn kach leq nưq, yôôych oot hnoq ik truh măn aduq Phê-nit, muuyq kangh aduq Kơ-rêt, 'yo tyauq ngưưr tâây naam ji tyauq ngưưr tâây băk, xôq măn hlê muua ka oaq. <verse eid="ACT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy khiel naam klôôp hơơy, vii biit heq ik jah muk đik, lunưq atêq tuôôy vưyq neeo, oot ăm tau charơơk pangach tyauq gah, truh jeq ngok tahli Kơ-rêt. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Bơh be xiik atêq, muuyq đơơt khiel puh kaxuh jah taayh laa Ơ-ra-qui-lôn, xing ngok tahli klôôp pôôt. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tau heq biq guôônq hooy ji leh ik tangưưr dii khiel ik đnoyq, yôôych atêq tuôôy ka'lăk tăk, 'wot biq đôôk tyauq. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Bơh atêq tuôôy hooy aloh tyauq pi kađoq khiel ku muuyq ngok tahli nưq jah taayh laa Kơ-lô-đa, yôôych galeh galal dik 'wot đơơu hnoq ik e paraat jư hlê poop ge wơơt manih, <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />laa thưq đơu tuôôy heq duuy tok, khơl drơy xok hloay kaluh talơy varưq waak raa, vek xăk tau dong kajưk. Katuôôy, Vii e yôq, xet 'leq hnoq ik măk ahyaal tol manay choah Si-rơ-tơ, yôôych tuôôy heq ăm tha neeo pôôt, oot kưq xôq biq đôôk tyauq đanưq. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Bơh tuôôy 'wot biq khiel puh ra ơơh ra ơơy, yôôych muut hngơy atêq, khơl drơy pa xarôp qwel kông haang pôôt tahli ăm ahyơơl tau. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Truh hngơy thưq pe, oot kadih ti qwel pôôt tahli kaluh valong đôô tol tau. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Tuôôy nưq, đong tuôôy leh e mot hngơy kung be e kaluh xalok paq e đom 'ngưng hngơy, katuôôy khiel xông xôôy leh de măn đong puh ranhuq 'wot, yôôych dêq hloay takôô gamưh măn hlê aleq ka 'wot jah wơơt heq biq hlơơp dêq. <verse eid="ACT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Yôôch tuôôy pa ek muuyq kawat yơơt leh xa, yôôych Phao-lô, tuôôy dưk tok măn katul oot, heq đnooy:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 27:21">“Wơơy oh ay, tuôôy nưq atoh heq tameng tyauq gô te vlôh tahli chuh klơlh Kơ-rêt, yôôych kung heq trengq ik tôônq hư ji hlơơp hlaak neq. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Juneq, gô ahmưk nhăk oh ay kôk kalh tok, vii hnoq leh e tôônq haiq truh xăk riirh katul đom oh ay, đơu vơ hlơơp poop tau neq heq. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Vii klôôy neng, muuyq yaak plêêk xing Kơy Plêêk, Kơy gô thuôk xuq ji laa Kơy gô vanê, heq dưk pi gah gô, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />xanoh: ‘Phao-lô, te yôq. Ay duh pheq vlôh hơu kangưưr Sê-sa, lunưq dayh 'yo hơq, bơyh xuum hwêêt Kơy Plêêk heq kahniq ka ay tôôy adro đong hooy tol yưk hooy kung dii ay.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Vii nưq, wơơy oh ay, dayh kajưk xuum! Vii gô tuôq gamưh Kơy Plêêk, đaneq dong varơuq hnoq xalih vlôh đanưq, tyauq đaji kach heq jah tauq ka gô. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Bơh haay pheq măk ahyaal ka muuyq ngok tahli leq nưq.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy truh klôôy thưq kưl poot, đom tuôôy 'wot măn đong pa duôôl tol daak Tahli A-đơ-ria-tich, yôôych kawah katul mưng, khơl 'wơyq tau biit đaneq oot đong hooy jeq truh muuyq dêh vari leq nưq. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Atêq tuôôy tha play wolh, oot hloq jaruq vaarq kưl plaalh, yôôch hooy athêêp muuyq kaplah xangưưy iaq, ji laay tha play wolh, oot hloq măn kưl dăp plaalh. <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Katuôôy, vii e yôq, xet 'leq 'wot hnoq ik ngưk muut phơu talaat aduq leq nưq, lunưq tuôôy heq tha poot vawauq neeo xing aduq hlooy tau pôôt, oot trôôch kajoq truh xaroq. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Bơh tuôôy khơl 'wơyq tau axek kach klôônq hooy klơlh tau ji ăm raduk ge wơơt manih pôôt tahli, dơơp bôô đaji đinq hooy tha neeo xing akoq tau. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Phao-lô đnooy dii padrok xakaq kuun ji khơl bing kuun: “Atoh khơl manih neq leh măn hlê tol tau, êêp kơy leh ik jah wơơt.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Anưq laa bing kuun goch kloh talơy varưq ku ge wơơt manih ji xôq ka ni đôôk hooy. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Tuôôy nưq, dong truh tuôôy plêêk jeq vlôh tađnah hloay, Phao-lô ahmưk nhăk tôôy adro dayh xa axit tuôông xa, đaneq: “Tuôôy đong takôô dong truh hngơy neng, hngơy thưq kưl poot, oh ay măn kưq đnoyq deek xa, be chiuq xa kajoq. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Anưq, gô xiin oh ay dayh xa axit tuôông xa, vii varơuq nưq laa deng ka varơuq wơơt oh ay. Vii leh kơyq đom oh ay hnoq hlơơp muuyq raq hlôôk tol akoq.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Nưq laa, tuôôy heq đnooy đanưq ji xok tôôp vlôh, kơy kuh kway Kơy Plêêk kangưưr tôôy adro, yôôch atêq tuôôy pleelh tôôp vlôh, kơy pa xarôp xa. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Yôôch tuôôy tôôy adro e jah varơuq ahmưk nhăk, yôôch kadih oot heq xok tuôông xa. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Tuôôy nưq, 'wot e dêq hloay vaarq hreek pơh kưl drơu dro tol tau. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ji yôôch, tuôôy jah phiq klaak dii tuôông xa yôôch, oot dơơp ahyơơl tau, bơơn kach qwel va qwaay pôôt tahli. <verse eid="ACT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Tuôôy nưq ajơ plêêk heq xaroq, oot leh nhonq vlôh dêh vari nưq, bơh oot đơơu hloq muuyq poop dêh nưq e manay choah tahli, laa aduq đơu oot tajauq 'yo hnoq ik laayq tau muut ik be. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Goch ka'lăk neeo yôôch, oot xôq hlê 'laarq tahli. Katuôôy, atêq tuôôy luh talơy benh laayq ji tơơk buông măn akoq tau, yôôych tyauq ngưưr khiel, oot jư ka tau kahluh hyioh truh manay choah tahli. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Bơh tuôôy đuk ka aduq vaarq alook daak tavơh mamuuyq yôôych tau măk ahyaal, ji vii akoq tau măk găk măn đnư, tau kưq leh anhưh hrưng kajoq ik, măn hlooy tau yôôych biq pôh padah naat bơyh ranaq kalh. <verse eid="ACT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Tuôôy nưq, iq đinq ku bing kuun laa dơơp aleq xôq oot păk kaxêêt khơl tu karuk, e đaneq kơyq nưq e hnoq xaloot gamưh jalôôy hooy hlơơp. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Bơh vii xung wơơt Phao-lô, padrok xakaq kuun heq klơl hlê iq đinq ku oot, Katuôôy kơy đnooy dăt ka khơl leq xet jalôôy adroyq dik kalong vlôh klơlh tau xôq jalôôy muut vari, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />ji khơl manih măn hlê, taleq dro neq katuk muut kaluh tômq tapaat, măn sôôq manih hơq xok kaluh thưq kadrơy xing xăk tau, yôôch tyauq kach nưq, varơuq xalih truh ka dêq hloay 'wot laa jah xagook muut vari kach hrok hrol.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Tuôôy jah hrok hrol yôôch, yôôch tuôôy nưq 'wot 'yo xet đaneq ngok tahli neq jah taayh laa Man-tơ. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Katuôôy, tamooy đom dêh deng ka 'wot varơuq hlah hlaak đêh xateek, vii oot heq vôôch hrok dêq hloay 'wot bơơn kach atuut ôôlh vii muuyq đơơt jit đong truh ji vii jaleek. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Bơh tuôôy Phao-lô heq agoop jah muuyq bo kadrưp ji ahluk muut ôôlh, yôôych muuyq poop volh taweek, atêq tuôôy talôôk vlôh klơlh kachô tôq, heq qwal riit xok ti kơy. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy tamooy đom dêh 'yo hloq volh qwal tol ti kơy, oot đnooy dii mamuuyq: “Manih neq chăk chănq laa dro păk kaxêêt manih, laa dro đơu long jah wơơt klơlh tahli, bơh hyioh jăk leh ăm riirh.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Atêq nưq, tuôôy heq ta'nhơyh volh muut ôôlh, kơy heq be e huq aleq kajoq. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Lunư, oot 'miêh biit kơy pa xarôp biq golh ahlưng long tưng hưng gưlh kaxêêt. Bơh atêq tuôôy oot 'yo kôô heq xiit ji hloq be e kajoq lưp aleq xalih vlôh ka kơy, yôôych tuôôy heq tađôôy iq, oot đnooy kơy laa muuyq kơy yaak.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Tuôôy nưq, măn raa wiit aduq nưq laa kaluh hluôôt vari ku kơy ja lang ngok tahli, anơng Bup-li-u, laa manih vôôch hrok 'wot, heq đoonq tiip muuyq kach hlah hlaak đom pe hngơy. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh nưq laa vaq ku Bup-li-u đong vik lêêt tol chanưng vii biq tanget aluq kaniet, yôôych Phao-lô, atêq tuôôy hooy muut tavơh kơy ji xadrook apôôy, xôq ti tol kơy, heq paxêêk yơh ka kơy. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Nưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy dong varơuq nưq xalih vlôh, khơl manih kadrơy tol ngok tahli biq bingq kung hooy truh ji jah paxêêk yơh, <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />đơu oot kung heq kuh yôq 'wot dii varơuq kul vado thier kôt, pheq đnooy đong tuôôy vlôh tahli, oot xagook atăq 'ngưng thưq deng ka varơuq duh ku 'wot.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Tuôôy nưq, atêq pe xiêk, 'wot vlôh tahli tol muuyq poop tau e kleh vangưl Đi-ôt-ku-ri, xing A-lek-xan-ri-a, heq măn ka oaq aduq ngok tahli. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Tuôôy jah truh gah aduq Si-ra-ku-sơ, 'wot măn đnư pe hngơy. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Xing nưq vlôh tahli, 'wot hooy truh Rê-gi-um, yôôch muuyq hngơy atêq, vii đơơt khiel naam puh tok, 'wot heq hooy truh Pu-tê-ô-li hngơy xatyauq atêq nưq, <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />nưq laa aduq đơu atêq tuôôy tavơh muuyq sôôq oh ay, 'wot heq jah adô adeng măn hlê kung oot đom pơh hngơy, ji kưq đanưq, 'wot hooy truh Rô-ma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Xing nưq, tuôôy tameng hêêl truh 'wot, khơl oh ay heq hooy truh tavơh mot dii 'wot măn aduq Tabôôt Ap-bi-u ji Ba Lưh Qwuanq, tuôôy 'yo hloq oot, Phao-lô heq e jah varơuq kajưk tuôq, kuh kway Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Nưq yôôch, tuôôy 'wot heq muut đom theng Rô-ma, Phao-lô jah pheep măn đêh raa kơy dii muuyq dro kuun jư 'yo kơy.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Tuôôy nưq, varơuq xalih vlôh atêq pe hngơy nưq laa kơy ăm mơơy khơl adro laa khơl padrok đom tamooy Jo Thaiq kung truh. Yôôch tuôôy oot heq tagumq hlê, kơy đnooy dii oot: “Wơơy oh ay, khơl oh ay, long be dơơp kajoq tachơơl hlê manih karôp long dok dơơp ku vaq kơy haay, bơh xing Jê-ru-sa-lem gô heq biq rôp jarooy đaji dro karuk đom ti manih La Mah, <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />đơu kadih oot, atêq tuôôy 'yo vôôch gô, 'miêh đinq bla rayơh rayơơy ka gô vii be e muuyq kadrôôp đangq kaxêêt leq măn aduq gô. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Bơh vii manih Jo Thaiq aklơ hlê, gô biq băt pheq kienq hlê tok Sê-sa — đom tuôôy be e iq kienq hlê manih dêh gô. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Anưq, vii liq jo nưq, gô heq mơơy êêp kơy truh, xôq tavơh ji athêêk. Vii kơq xuum takôô gamưh ku I-sơ-ra-ên, đơu gô đong chiuq kal looy tooy neq.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Lunư, oot đnooy dii kơy: “'Wot koq nhonq jah hla thư kajoq truh kơy xing Ju-đê, kung koq e oh ay leq truh tauq boon long đnooy paq kê varơuq xơuq kajoq truh kơy. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Bơh 'wot hloq trôôch tameng xing pi kơy kaluh kajoq kơy biit, vii truh bing ja neq, varơuq jah xet măn aduq 'wot nưq laa ni biq tachơơl aklơ loch aduq.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Nưq yôôch, atêq tuôôy đinq hngơy ka kơy, yôôych 'ngưng manih iaq heq truh kung kơy aduq kachô măn ku kơy, đơu xing xaroq ăm truh rayôôp klôôy, kơy padoh taboon dii oot, bơơn kach dơơp xanưk truh daak dêh Kơy Plêêk, katuôôy đnooy xok xuum oot truh Lôôk Jê-xu xing kaah ganuun Môi-se hloay kaluh rahlăp hlit. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Long muuyq sôôq manih chiuq tuôq kaluh varơuq jah padoh boon, bơh sôôq kadrơy yôôych leh tuôq. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Tuôôy nưq, tuôôy e varơuq lưp tagu dii mamuuyq, oot chuh hooy atêq tuôôy Phao-lô đnooy muuyq varơuq, đaneq: “Gamưh kơy hlit Ê-sai, Kơy Phool Hiel heq xanoh troq dik dii mo kơy ku êêp kơy, <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />đaneq: ‘Dayh hooy truh tamooy neq ji đnooy:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">“Tuôôy tameng, êêp koot hnoq tameng ik, đơu êêp koot chăk chănq leh hlolh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">ji tuôôy 'yo, êêp koot hnoq hloq, đơu êêp koot chăk chănq be hloq ik.”<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Vii xuum tamooy neq heq vlôh jêêk găk khăk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">tôôr oot dang đaji leh tameng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ji mot oot yôôych kađniêp hlê,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">leh kheoq muuyq tuôôy leq nưq, oot e hnoq hloq ik bơơn mot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">tameng ik bơơn tôôr, ji hlolh ik bơơn xuum klaak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">yôôch oot hnoq ik wiit hlê,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">ji Gô hnoq paxêêk yơh ka oot.’<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Vii anưq, varơuq hlolh xet pheq e aduq khơl kơy, nưq laa varơuq wơơt xok neq ku Kơy Plêêk heq jah padoh taboon ka khơl tamooy daak kadrơy, ji oot hnoq tameng.” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />[Tuôôy kơy đnooy yôôch taleq apok nưq, khơl manih Jo Thaiq vlôh xuq, e varơuq takaay tayaat diik miik katul đom oot.]<verse eid="ACT 28:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Tuôôy nưq, kơy măn dêq vaarq xanưm đom hnhư xapo ku kơy, ji tiip đoonq dêq hloay khơl leq hooy truh kung kơy, <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />tuôôy padoh taboon truh daak dêh Kơy Plêêk ji pato dayq kaluh varơuq truh Lôôk, laa Lôôk wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, dii dêq hloay xuum kôk dik, leh tavơh đơ klơl leq.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>